-font-family: TimesNewRoman;\">ě</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 150%; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">ní. Jednání probíhá v souladu s jednacím </span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 150%; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: TimesNewRoman;\">ř</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 150%; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">ádem nejmén</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 150%; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: TimesNewRoman;\">ě</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 150%; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin;\"> dvakrát ro</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 150%; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: TimesNewRoman;\">č</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 150%; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">n</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 150%; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: TimesNewRoman;\">ě</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 150%; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font