('743', '874', 'Dějepisna olympiáda', 'dejepisna-olympiada', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\" align=\"center\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Dějepisna olympiáda<br /></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><a href=\"images/foto/2022/dejepis.jpg\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><img src=\"images/foto/2022/dejepis.jpg\" width=\"700\" /></span></a></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: #222222; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\">G</span></span><span style=\"color: #222222; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\">ratulujeme našim žákům za úspěšné umístění na dějepisné olympiádě v Náchodě </span><img class=\"an1\" style=\"height: 1.2em; width: 1.2em; vertical-align: middle; color: #222222; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/14.0/1f3eb/72.png\" alt=\"?\" data-emoji=\"?\" /><span style=\"color: #222222; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\"> (okresní kolo). Jiří Havel 2.B (vpravo), se umístil na krásném 1. místě</span><img class=\"an1\" style=\"height: 1.2em; width: 1.2em; vertical-align: middle; color: #222222; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/14.0/1f947/72.png\" alt=\"?\" data-emoji=\"?\" /><span style=\"color: #222222; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\"> a tudíž postupuje do krajského kola v Hradci Králové. </span><img class=\"an1\" style=\"height: 1.2em; width: 1.2em; vertical-align: middle; color: #222222; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/14.0/1f44f_1f3fb/72.png\" alt=\"??\" data-emoji=\"??\" /><span style=\"color: #222222; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\"> Je také nutno říci, že Jiří dosáhnul nejvyššího počtu bodů a tím se zasloužil o nejlepší výsledek z celého Královehradeckého kraje. Filip Ducháč 4.B (vlevo), se umístil na znamenitém 6. místě. </span><img class=\"an1\" style=\"height: 1.2em; width: 1.2em; vertical-align: middle; color: #222222; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/14.0/1f44d_1f3fb/72.png\" alt=\"??\" data-emoji=\"??\" /><img class=\"an1\" style=\"height: 1.2em; width: 1.2em; vertical-align: middle; color: #222222; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/14.0/1f44f_1f3fb/72.png\" alt=\"??\" data-emoji=\"??\" /></span></p>', '', '1', '9', '2022-03-29 20:12:16', '140', '', '2022-03-29 20:12:21', '140', NULL, NULL, '2022-03-29 20:12:16', NULL, '{\"image_intro\":\"\",\"image_intro_alt\":\"\",\"float_intro\":\"\",\"image_intro_caption\":\"\",\"image_fulltext\":\"\",\"image_fulltext_alt\":\"\",\"float_fulltext\":\"\",\"image_fulltext_caption\":\"\"}', '{\"urla\":false,\"urlatext\":\"\",\"targeta\":\"\",\"urlb\":false,\"urlbtext\":\"\",\"targetb\":\"\",\"urlc\":false,\"urlctext\":\"\",\"targetc\":\"\"}', '{\"article_layout\":\"\",\"show_title\":\"\",\"link_titles\":\"\",\"show_tags\":\"\",\"show_intro\":\"\",\"info_block_position\":\"\",\"info_block_show_title\":\"\",\"show_category\":\"\",\"link_category\":\"\",\"show_parent_category\":\"\",\"link_parent_category\":\"\",\"show_associations\":\"\",\"show_author\":\"\",\"link_author\":\"\",\"show_create_date\":\"\",\"sh