\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 18pt;\\\"><strong>Poj\\u010fte studovat s n\\u00e1mi:<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img style=\\\"float: right; margin-top: 20px;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/Hlavni_strana\\/1..jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"418\\\" height=\\\"167\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li><span style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\"><strong>Cestovn\\u00ed ruch<br><br><\\/strong><\\/span><\\/li>\\r\\n<li><span style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\"><strong>Ekonomick\\u00e9 lyceum<br><br><\\/strong><\\/span><\\/li>\\r\\n<li style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\"><strong>Sportovn\\u00ed management<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 9pt;\\\"><strong><br><\\/strong><\\/span><em><span style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">Jsme bezbari\\u00e9rov\\u00e1 \\u0161kola. \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 <\\/span><\\/em><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"padding: 0px 0px 0px 30px; margin: 0px;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"padding: 0px 0px 0px 30px; margin: 0px;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<div style=\\\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; padding-left: 40px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\"><strong>N\\u00e1v\\u0161t\\u011bvn\\u00edci z\\u00e1mku T\\u0159ebo\\u0148<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/div>\\r\\n<div style=\\\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; padding-left: 40px;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">V\\u00e1\\u017een\\u00e1 pan\\u00ed \\u0159editelko, z\\u00fa\\u010dastnila jsem se prohl\\u00eddky B na z\\u00e1mku v T\\u0159eboni, kdy byl pr\\u016fvodce mlad\\u00fd mu\\u017e, kter\\u00fd se p\\u0159edstavil jako Jan Kub\\u00ed\\u010dek. Cht\\u011bla jsem V\\u00e1m napsat, \\u017ee jeho v\\u00fdklad byl velmi kultivovan\\u00fd, byl to velmi zaj\\u00edmav\\u00fd p\\u0159ednes. Informace byly ucelen\\u00e9, hovo\\u0159il bez v\\u00fdrazn\\u00fdch probl\\u00e9m\\u016f a hlavn\\u011b nahlas. Je to velmi p\\u0159\\u00edjemn\\u00fd mlad\\u00fd mu\\u017e a jak jsem pochopila, studuje na Va\\u0161\\u00ed \\u0161kole. Na pr\\u00e1ci pr\\u016fvodce se velmi hod\\u00ed. P\\u0159eji V\\u00e1m v\\u00edce takov\\u00fdch student\\u016f a jemu p\\u0159eji v\\u0161e dobr\\u00e9 p\\u0159i studiu a hodn\\u011b spokojen\\u00fdch n\\u00e1v\\u0161t\\u011bvn\\u00edk\\u016f.<br>S p\\u0159\\u00e1telsk\\u00fdm pozdravem Krist\\u00fdna Kozelkov\\u00e1<\\/span><\\/div>\\r\\n<div style=\\\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; padding-left: 40px;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/div>\\r\\n<div style=\\\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; padding-left: 40px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\"><strong>N\\u00e1v\\u0161t\\u011bvn\\u00edci z\\u00e1mku Jind\\u0159ich\\u016fv Hradec<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/div>\\r\\n<div style=\\\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; padding-left: 40px;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">V\\u00e1\\u017een\\u00e1 pan\\u00ed \\u0159editelko, r\\u00e1di bychom vyj\\u00e1d\\u0159ili pod\\u011bkov\\u00e1n\\u00ed Va\\u0161\\u00ed studentce S\\u00e1\\u0159e Balcarov\\u00e9 z 3. ro\\u010dn\\u00edku cestovn\\u00edho ruchu, kter\\u00e1 vykon\\u00e1vala praxi jako pr\\u016fvodkyn\\u011b ve St\\u00e1tn\\u00edm hradu a z\\u00e1mku Jind\\u0159ich\\u016fv Hradec. S\\u00e1ra byla velice vst\\u0159\\u00edcn\\u00e1 a ochotn\\u00e1 k na\\u0161im v\\u0161ete\\u010dn\\u00fdm a podrobn\\u00fdm dotaz\\u016fm k historii hradu a z\\u00e1mku. A pokud na\\u0161e ot\\u00e1zka p\\u0159esahovala jej\\u00ed v\\u011bdomosti nev\\u00e1hala a ,, vygooglila\\\" aby uspokojila na\\u0161i zv\\u011bdavost. Jej\\u00ed proslov byl z\\u0159eteln\\u00fd a hlasit\\u00fd, co\\u017e n\\u00e1\\u0161 z\\u00e1jezd senior\\u016f uv\\u00edtal. V\\u00e1\\u017een\\u00e1 pan\\u00ed \\u0159editelko, p\\u0159ejeme V\\u00e1m spoustu takov\\u00fdch student\\u016f dob\\u0159e p\\u0159ipraven\\u00fdch do budouc\\u00edho povol\\u00e1n\\u00ed. Je\\u0161t\\u011b jednou d\\u011bkujeme v\\u0161em pedagog\\u016fm a dr\\u017e\\u00edme palce p\\u0159i v\\u00fdchov\\u011b budouc\\u00ed generace.<br>S pozdravem Alena Hemalov\\u00e1 spolek Senio\\u0159i 55+ \\u0160aratice<\\/span><\\/div>\\r\\n<div style=\\\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; padding-left: 40px;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/div>\\r\\n<div style=\\\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; padding-left: 40px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\"><strong>N\\u00e1v\\u0161t\\u011bvn\\u00edci z\\u00e1mku Konopi\\u0161t\\u011b<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/div>\\r\\n<div style=\\\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; padding-left: 40px;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Dobr\\u00fd den, v\\u010dera jsem ji\\u017e pon\\u011bkolik\\u00e1t\\u00e9 nav\\u0161t\\u00edvil v\\u00e1\\u0161 z\\u00e1mek spolu s kamar\\u00e1dem, kter\\u00fd byl na z\\u00e1mku poprv\\u00e9. Absolvovali jsem prvn\\u00ed a druh\\u00fd okruh a v t\\u00e9to zpr\\u00e1v\\u011b bych cht\\u011bl pochv\\u00e1lit ob\\u011b pan\\u00ed pr\\u016fvodkyn\\u011b. Prvn\\u00edm okruhem n\\u00e1s od 13:00 doprov\\u00e1zela sle\\u010dna pr\\u016fvodkyn\\u011b Alice Ka\\u0161parov\\u00e1 (Academia Mercurii) a mus\\u00edm skute\\u010dn\\u011b pochv\\u00e1lit jej\\u00ed v\\u00fdkon. I kdy\\u017e z\\u0159ejm\\u011b na z\\u00e1mku za\\u010d\\u00edn\\u00e1, dok\\u00e1zala velmi poutav\\u011b vykl\\u00e1dat o historii i expon\\u00e1tech a bez probl\\u00e9m\\u016f odpov\\u00eddala i na v\\u0161ete\\u010dn\\u00e9 dotazy n\\u011bkter\\u00fdch n\\u00e1v\\u0161t\\u011bvn\\u00edk\\u016f. Skute\\u010dn\\u011b m\\u00e1 o z\\u00e1mku velk\\u00e9 znalosti. Zvl\\u00e1dala i komunikovat s cizinci, kte\\u0159\\u00ed vypadali velmi spokojen\\u011b. Zkr\\u00e1tka n\\u00e1m to podtrhlo celkov\\u00fd pozitivn\\u00ed dojem z prohl\\u00eddky. Druh\\u00fd okruh jsme absolvovali od 14:00 se sle\\u010dnou pr\\u016fvodkyn\\u00ed, jej\\u00ed\\u017e jm\\u00e9no si bohu\\u017eel nepamatuji, ale byla takt\\u00e9\\u017e v\\u00fdborn\\u00e1. Bylo zn\\u00e1t, \\u017ee u\\u017e n\\u011bjak\\u00fd \\u010das prov\\u00e1z\\u00ed a nijak j\\u00ed nevyvedli z m\\u00edry dva mal\\u00ed ak\\u010dn\\u00ed chlapci, kte\\u0159\\u00ed n\\u00e1s rozesm\\u00edvali sv\\u00fdmi dotazy. Je mi ct\\u00ed, \\u017ee i jej\\u00ed v\\u00fdkon m\\u016f\\u017eu pochv\\u00e1lit. Up\\u0159\\u00edmn\\u011b jsem se ob\\u00e1val, \\u017ee s nav\\u00fd\\u0161en\\u00edm cen vstupn\\u00e9ho se nenav\\u00fd\\u0161\\u00ed kvalita pr\\u016fvodcovstv\\u00ed, ale po v\\u010derej\\u0161\\u00edm dni jsem naprosto klidn\\u00fd a m\\u016f\\u017eu v\\u0161em jen doporu\\u010dit. Ob\\u011bma sle\\u010dn\\u00e1m p\\u0159eji mnoho \\u00fasp\\u011bch\\u016f a cel\\u00e9mu t\\u00fdmu z\\u00e1mku tak\\u00e9. Pros\\u00edm, aby byly pochvaly vy\\u0159\\u00edzeny;) P\\u0159eji p\\u011bkn\\u00fd den a \\u00fasp\\u011b\\u0161nou sez\\u00f3nu. <br>S pozdravem Dominik M\\u00fcller.<\\/span><\\/div>\\r\\n<div style=\\\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; padding-left: 40px;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/div>\\r\\n<div style=\\\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; padding-left: 40px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\"><strong>N\\u00e1v\\u0161t\\u011bvn\\u00edci z\\u00e1mku N\\u00e1chod z Doudleb nad Orlic\\u00ed\\u00a0<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/div>\\r\\n<div style=\\\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; padding-left: 40px;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">P\\u0159eji hezk\\u00fd den, dnes jsme s man\\u017eelem absolvovali prohl\\u00eddku n\\u00e1chodsk\\u00e9ho z\\u00e1mku. Prov\\u00e1zela n\\u00e1s studentka va\\u0161\\u00ed \\u0161koly Kate\\u0159ina Bene\\u0161ov\\u00e1. Cht\\u011bli bychom t\\u00edmto pochv\\u00e1lit jej\\u00ed v\\u00fdrazn\\u00fd, hlasit\\u00fd, velice zaj\\u00edmav\\u00fd projev bez jedin\\u00e9ho p\\u0159e\\u0159eknut\\u00ed. Nav\\u0161t\\u011bvujeme mnoho pam\\u00e1tek v \\u010cesk\\u00e9 republice, ale m\\u00e1lokdy se s tak \\u0161ikovn\\u00fdmi pr\\u016fvodci setk\\u00e1me . P\\u0159ejeme v\\u00e1m hodn\\u011b takov\\u00fdch \\u0161ikovn\\u00fdch student\\u016f.<br>S pozdravem man\\u017eel\\u00e9 Macha\\u010dovi Doudleby nad Orlic\\u00ed<\\/span><\\/div>\\r\\n<div style=\\\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; padding-left: 40px;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/div>\\r\\n<div style=\\\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; padding-left: 40px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\"><strong>N\\u00e1v\\u0161t\\u011bvn\\u00edci z\\u00e1mku Ro\\u017emberk<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/div>\\r\\n<div style=\\\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; padding-left: 40px;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Dobr\\u00fd den pan\\u00ed \\u0159editelko, cht\\u011bl bych touto cestou vyj\\u00e1d\\u0159it pochvalu Va\\u0161emu studentovi Tade\\u00e1\\u0161ovi H\\u00e1jkovi a z\\u00e1rove\\u0148 Va\\u0161\\u00ed \\u0161kole. 20.5. tohoto roku jsme nav\\u0161t\\u00edvili hrad Ro\\u017emberk, kde n\\u00e1s prov\\u00e1zel hradem V\\u00e1\\u0161 student.Z jeho celkov\\u00e9ho projevu bylo patrn\\u00e9 zap\\u00e1len\\u00ed pro sv\\u016fj obor.Jeho rod\\u00edc\\u00ed se profesionalita byla jasn\\u011b viditeln\\u00e1 z p\\u0159ehledu a znalost\\u00ed historie v dan\\u00e9m objektu.Byl schopen odpov\\u00eddat i na na\\u0161e dotazy, na kter\\u00e9 nemohl b\\u00fdt p\\u0159ipraven.A co je je\\u0161t\\u011b dnes m\\u00e1lo k vid\\u011bn\\u00ed, byla jeho skromnost a evidentn\\u00ed \\u00facta ke star\\u0161\\u00edm lidem. S t\\u00edm v\\u0161\\u00edm jsme byli velmi spokojeni a snad i p\\u0159ekvapeni. P\\u0159\\u00e1li bychom si, aby nejen Va\\u0161e \\u0161kola dost\\u00e1vala takov\\u00e1to slova uzn\\u00e1n\\u00ed. P\\u0159eji V\\u00e1m hodn\\u011b takov\\u00fdch student\\u016f a hodn\\u011b \\u00fasp\\u011bch\\u016f do budoucna. <br>Hezk\\u00fd den p\\u0159eje R.P. a R.J.<\\/span><\\/div>\\r\\n<div style=\\\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/div>\\r\\n<div style=\\\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\">\\r\\n<div style=\\\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; padding-left: 40px;\\\">\\r\\n<div style=\\\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\"><strong>N\\u00e1v\\u0161t\\u011bvn\\u00edci z\\u00e1mku N\\u00e1chod z Olomoucka<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/div>\\r\\n<div style=\\\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Dobr\\u00fd den, v\\u010dera 9.6., jsem spolu s man\\u017eelem nav\\u0161t\\u00edvila N\\u00e1chodsk\\u00fd z\\u00e1mek, byli jsme mile p\\u0159ekvapeni, \\u017ee n\\u00e1s prov\\u00e1zel V\\u00e1\\u0161 student. Pro\\u0161li jsme si oba okruhy, a smek\\u00e1me p\\u0159ed jeho nasazen\\u00edm. V\\u00edce takov\\u00fdch mlad\\u00fdch lid\\u00ed, d\\u011bkuji a chv\\u00e1l\\u00edm. Student se n\\u00e1m p\\u0159edstavil - Jan K\\u00f6nig\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/div>\\r\\n<div style=\\\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<div style=\\\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; padding-left: 40px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\"><strong>Kastel\\u00e1nka st\\u00e1tn\\u00edho z\\u00e1mku T\\u0159ebo\\u0148<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/div>\\r\\n<div style=\\\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; padding-left: 40px;\\\">\\r\\n<div style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">V\\u00e1\\u017een\\u00e1 pan\\u00ed \\u0159editelko, <\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">r\\u00e1da bych touto cestou vyzdvihla vynikaj\\u00edc\\u00ed p\\u0159\\u00edpravu Va\\u0161ich studentek na praxi u n\\u00e1s v T\\u0159eboni. <\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Ag\\u00e1ta Hub\\u00e1lkov\\u00e1 a Barbora Va\\u0161\\u00ed\\u010dkov\\u00e1 u n\\u00e1s byly ji\\u017e podruh\\u00e9 a op\\u011bt doslova zaz\\u00e1\\u0159ily. Nejen, <\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">\\u017ee p\\u0159ijely v\\u00fdborn\\u011b p\\u0159ipraven\\u00e9, tak\\u017ee mohly od prvn\\u00edho dne samostatn\\u011b prov\\u00e1zet, ale je\\u0161t\\u011b <\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">pom\\u00e1haly s p\\u0159\\u00edpravou a prov\\u00e1d\\u011bn\\u00edm m\\u00e9n\\u011b p\\u0159ipraven\\u00fdm praktikantk\\u00e1m z jin\\u00e9 \\u0161koly. <\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">V\\u0161echny Va\\u0161e studentky pat\\u0159\\u00ed ji\\u017e tradi\\u010dn\\u011b k nejlep\\u0161\\u00edm praktikantk\\u00e1m, kter\\u00e9 u n\\u00e1s kdy p\\u016fsobily. <\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Blahop\\u0159eji V\\u00e1m k tak vynikaj\\u00edc\\u00edm pedagogick\\u00fdm \\u00fasp\\u011bch\\u016fm a t\\u011b\\u0161\\u00edm se na dal\\u0161\\u00ed spolupr\\u00e1ci.<\\/span><\\/div>\\r\\n<div style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">S pozdravem <\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">kastel\\u00e1nka <\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">St\\u00e1tn\\u00ed z\\u00e1mek T\\u0159ebo\\u0148<\\/span><\\/div>\\r\\n<div style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; padding-left: 40px;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<div style=\\\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; padding-left: 40px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\"><strong>N\\u00e1v\\u0161t\\u011bvnice hradu Nov\\u00e9 Hrady<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/div>\\r\\n<div style=\\\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; padding-left: 40px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Dobr\\u00fd den pan\\u00ed \\u0159editelko!<\\/span><\\/div>\\r\\n<div style=\\\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; padding-left: 40px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Minul\\u00fd t\\u00fdden jsem nav\\u0161t\\u00edvila hrad v Nov\\u00fdch Hradech a byla jsem hodn\\u011b p\\u0159ekvapen\\u00e1 pr\\u016fvodcem Janem Kejzlarem, kter\\u00fd je studentem Va\\u0161\\u00ed \\u0161koly. Jeho \\u00fa\\u017easn\\u00fd v\\u00fdklad a profesion\\u00e1ln\\u00ed, ale p\\u0159irozen\\u00fd p\\u0159\\u00edstup k n\\u00e1m n\\u00e1v\\u0161t\\u011bvn\\u00edk\\u016fm byl prost\\u011b skv\\u011bl\\u00fd! Pros\\u00edm o p\\u0159ed\\u00e1n\\u00ed pochvaly panu Kejzlarovi a velk\\u00e9 d\\u00edky! Byla jsem tam se svou kamar\\u00e1dkou a dohodly jsme se, \\u017ee V\\u00e1m to prost\\u011b mus\\u00edme sd\\u011blit.<\\/span><br><span style=\\\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">P\\u0159eji V\\u00e1m i n\\u00e1m hodn\\u011b takov\\u00fdch student\\u016f. <\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Zdrav\\u00edm a p\\u0159eji kr\\u00e1sn\\u00fd den, <\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">n\\u00e1v\\u0161t\\u011bvnice hradu<\\/span><\\/div>\\r\\n<div style=\\\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; padding-left: 40px;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/div>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; text-align: left;\\\"><strong><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Dobr\\u00fd den pane u\\u010diteli,<\\/span><\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; text-align: left;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">v\\u010dera jsme v\\u00e1m vr\\u00e1tili prvn\\u00ed praktikanty. V<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">elice oce\\u0148uji, \\u017ee se kluci p\\u0159ijeli pod\\u00edvat (ze sv\\u00e9 vlastn\\u00ed iniciativy) na hrad je\\u0161t\\u011b p\\u0159ed samotn\\u00fdm p\\u0159ezkou\\u0161en\\u00edm. V\\u0161em to v\\u0159ele doporu\\u010duji, ale ne v\\u017edy je t\\u00e9to nab\\u00eddky vyu\\u017eito. Na p\\u0159ezkou\\u0161en\\u00ed p\\u0159ijeli v\\u0161ichni t\\u0159i p\\u0159ipraveni velice pe\\u010dliv\\u011b, m\\u011bli pov\\u011bdom\\u00ed o hrad\\u011b, dob\\u0159e ch\\u00e1pali souvislosti. Na za\\u010d\\u00e1tku praxe byli je\\u0161t\\u011b kluci na n\\u011bkolika prohl\\u00eddk\\u00e1ch, aby vid\\u011bli samotnou prohl\\u00eddku v praxi. Naprosto bez probl\\u00e9m\\u016f se pot\\u00e9 zapojili do n\\u00e1v\\u0161t\\u011bvnick\\u00e9ho provozu v\\u010detn\\u011b d\\u011btsk\\u00fdch prohl\\u00eddek. Co mus\\u00edm opravdu vyzdvihnout je jejich schopnost improvizace p\\u0159i nestandardn\\u00edch situac\\u00edch, kter\\u00e9 jsou bohu\\u017eel tak\\u00e9 sou\\u010d\\u00e1st\\u00ed na\\u0161\\u00ed pr\\u00e1ce. Kluci je zvl\\u00e1dli naprosto bez probl\\u00e9m\\u016f. <\\/span><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Pokud bych m\\u011bla zhodnotit p\\u0159\\u00edpravu a pr\\u00e1ci s pr\\u016fvodcovsk\\u00fdmi texty, nem\\u00e1m jedinou v\\u00fdtku.\\u00a0<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Prvn\\u00ed prohl\\u00eddky, kter\\u00e9 kluci na hrad\\u011b absolvovali u\\u017e \\\"naostro\\\", byly mo\\u017en\\u00e1 trochu nejist\\u00e9, ale to je u pr\\u016fvodc\\u016f, kte\\u0159\\u00ed p\\u0159edchoz\\u00ed pr\\u016fvodcovsk\\u00e9 zku\\u0161enosti nemaj\\u00ed, naprosto b\\u011b\\u017en\\u00e9. Kluci se v\\u0161ak velmi brzy zapracovali a dal\\u0161\\u00ed odveden\\u00e9 prohl\\u00eddky byly na profesion\\u00e1ln\\u00ed \\u00farovni. J\\u00e1 sama jsem jim byla n\\u011bkolikr\\u00e1t na kontroln\\u00ed prohl\\u00eddce, a a\\u017e na p\\u00e1r drobnost\\u00ed nebo up\\u0159esn\\u011bn\\u00ed jsem byla spokojen\\u00e1. <\\/span><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Dal\\u0161\\u00ed pr\\u016fb\\u011bh praxe byl bez z\\u00e1drhelu, kluci plnili zadan\\u00e9 \\u00fakoly pe\\u010dliv\\u011b, sv\\u011bdomit\\u011b, nastavili la\\u0165ku opravdu vysoko.<\\/span> <br><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<div style=\\\"padding-left: 30px;\\\">\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 9pt;\\\"><em><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px;\\\">Hlavn\\u00ed pr\\u016fvodkyn\\u011b hradu Ka\\u0161perk<\\/span><br><\\/em><img src=\\\"data:image\\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAGAAAABgCAYAAADimHc4AAARiUlEQVR4Xu3dA5AkSRcH8Nyzbe3ZjrNt27Zt27Zt27Zt27a++34ZkRN1fd0z1T1d29239SImdnamurLy\\/Z\\/fy5o+\\/\\/s\\/hZJaxoE+JQAt431cuASgtfwvAWgx\\/0sASgBazYEWr1\\/6gBKAFnOgxcv3Ew14++23w\\/fffx8GHHDAuF2ph+\\/HGWecMOSQQ7aMBb\\/88kt4\\/fXXwwADDND1DH\\/99VcYeuihQ9++fUOfPn0Kf7bCAfjqq6\\/COuusE954440w0EADxQ3ZJAB22223sPLKKxe+yVoLXH\\/99WHXXXeNjE7M9myjjjpquPTSS8NII41U+LMVDsBVV10V1l133fDnn3\\/+YzM2vMIKK4RTTjklDDrooIVvtHKB33\\/\\/PWy44YbhiiuuqLr2hRdeGJZeeunCn6tQAJiarbbaKpx99tlVNzLGGGOE6667Lkw66aSFb7RygQ8++CDMMccc4Ysvvqi69iqrrBLOOOOMwp+rUADee++9sOKKK4aXXnop2v1KogU0YPXVVy98o5ULXHDBBWGTTTapuq7nGm+88cLtt98ezVGRVCgAV199dVhvvfUCda9F1Pycc84JAw88cJH7\\/Ne9SfgNN9xQc81BBhkkHH\\/88YULR2EAsPk77rhjOP3006tKf9r5cMMNF+6\\/\\/\\/4ocf2KRGWLLrpoYIZqES1YbbXVwqmnnlroYxUGgM0tvvji4c033+xxA8cee2xYf\\/31e7yuWRcQCsLxxx9\\/dAvARBNNFC6\\/\\/PIwwQQTNGvpf5vhosrRN910U1hppZVyPfhCCy0UREv9gviitddeOzCPPbVC5Adnnnlm9GNFUSEa8NFHH4VtttkmACEPDTPMMDFSWnjhhfNc3qtrPJPI7JNPPsl1H8\\/EF4jYiqBCAJDgiP1lmnmIvV1mmWXC+eefn+fyhq\\/57bffwhZbbBEuvvjiHqU\\/u4hcYZ