l, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Velmi dobr\\u00e1 spolupr\\u00e1ce je s <strong style=\\\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\\\">Hospod\\u00e1\\u0159skou komorou <\\/strong>v\\u00a0N\\u00e1chod\\u011b, kdy podnikatel\\u00e9 i veden\\u00ed pobo\\u010dky pom\\u00e1haj\\u00ed p\\u0159i sout\\u011b\\u017e\\u00edch studentsk\\u00fdch spole\\u010dnost\\u00ed, zakl\\u00e1d\\u00e1n\\u00ed firem a jejich \\u0159\\u00edzen\\u00ed.<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: 150%; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-fareast-language: CS; mso-no-proof: yes;\\\"><img src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/partneri\\/7.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"284\\\" height=\\\"103\\\" border=\\\"0\\\"><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: 150%; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">\\u0160kola \\u00fazce spolupracuje se spr\\u00e1vn\\u00edmi\\u00a0org\\u00e1ny a to s\\u00a0<strong style=\\\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\\\">Krajsk\\u00fdm \\u00fa\\u0159adem Kr\\u00e1lov\\u00e9hradeck\\u00e9ho kraje<\\/strong>, s\\u00a0organizac\\u00ed <strong style=\\\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\\\">SEVER<\\/strong>, <strong style=\\\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\\\">\\u00da\\u0159adem pr\\u00e1ce N\\u00e1chod<\\/strong>, <strong style=\\\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\\\">M\\u011bstsk\\u00fdm \\u00fa\\u0159adem N\\u00e1chod<\\/strong>.<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">\\u0160kola se \\u00fa\\u010dastn\\u00ed mezin\\u00e1rodn\\u00edch projekt\\u016f <strong>ERASMUS<sup>+<\\/sup><\\/strong> , kter\\u00e9 spadaj\\u00ed pod spr\\u00e1vu Domu zahrani\\u010dn\\u00ed spolupr\\u00e1ce,<\\/span><br><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Na Po\\u0159\\u00ed\\u010d\\u00ed 1035\\/4 | 110 00 Praha 1<\\/span><br><img src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/partneri\\/logo.png\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"284\\\" height=\\\"73\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">\\u0160kola spolupracuje s\\u00a0mnoha subjekty v\\u00a0\\u010cesk\\u00e9 republice v\\u00a0oblasti cestovn\\u00edho ruchu, kde \\u017e\\u00e1ci mohou vykon\\u00e1vat sv\\u00e9 odborn\\u00e9 praxe nebo \\u0161kole poskytuj\\u00ed odborn\\u00e9 exkurze v\\u00a0r\\u00e1mci pln\\u011bn\\u00ed studijn\\u00edch c\\u00edl\\u016f. K\\u00a0t\\u011bmto objekt\\u016fm pat\\u0159\\u00ed:<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNoSpacing\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Adr\\u0161pa\\u0161sk\\u00e9 sk\\u00e1ly (p\\u0159\\u00edrodn\\u00ed pam\\u00e1tka)<\\/span><br><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Bechyn\\u011b<\\/span><br><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Be\\u010dov nad Teplou<\\/span><br><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Bouzov<\\/span><br><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Broumov (kl\\u00e1\\u0161ter)<\\/span><br><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Barun\\u010dina \\u0161kola v \\u010cesk\\u00e9 Skalici<br><\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">\\u010castolovice<\\/span><br><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Dobro\\u0161ov (pevnost)<\\/span><br><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Hor\\u0161ovsk\\u00fd T\\u00fdn<\\/span><br><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Josefov (pevnost)<\\/span><br><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Jind\\u0159ich\\u016fv Hradec<\\/span><br><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Ka\\u0161perk<\\/span><br><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Kratochv\\u00edle<br><\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Kun\\u011btick\\u00e1 Hora<br><\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Kost<\\/span><br><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Kyn\\u017evart<\\/span><br><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Lednice<\\/span><br><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Lemberk<\\/span><br><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Muzeum v N\\u00e1chod\\u011b<\\/span><br><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Muzeum v Nov\\u00e9m M\\u011bst\\u011b nad Metuj\\u00ed<\\/span><br><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Nov\\u00e9 Hrady<\\/span><br><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">N\\u00e1chod<\\/span><br><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Nov\\u00e9 M\\u011bsto nad Metuj\\u00ed<\\/span><br><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Ro\\u017emberk<br><\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Rychnov nad Kn\\u011b\\u017enou<br><\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">T\\u0159ebo\\u0148<br><\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Wonk\\u016fv d\\u016fm Jarom\\u011b\\u0159<\\/span><br><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">\\u017