('271', 'com_content.article.262', '', '2026-09-10 22:12:34', '140', '3490', '548fed2a3db87e8749686a8b41283d34e1cc4bea', '{\"title\":\"Adapta\\u010dn\\u00ed kurz - Montanie 1.AB\",\"alias\":\"adaptacni-kurz-montanie-1-ab\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2016-10-05 11:49:07\",\"publish_up\":\"2016-10-05 11:49:07\",\"ordering\":364,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":false,\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":false,\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":false,\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Adapta\\u010dn\\u00ed kurz - Montanie 1.AB<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/phocagallery\\/2017\\/Adaptacni_kurz\\/IMG_1788.jpg\\\" rel=\\\"alternate\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><img src=\\\"images\\/phocagallery\\/2017\\/Adaptacni_kurz\\/IMG_1788.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"640\\\" height=\\\"480\\\" \\/><\\/span><\\/span><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><a href=\\\"index.php\\/cs\\/cs-fotogalerie\\/2016-2017\\/category\\/27-adaptacni-kurz-montanie-1-ab\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"alternate\\\">Fotogalerie ZDE:<\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\">V\\u00edce fotek na facebooku \\u0161koly<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>5. z\\u00e1\\u0159\\u00ed - pro na\\u0161i t\\u0159\\u00eddu kouzeln\\u00e9 datum. Odj\\u00ed\\u017ed\\u011bli jsme toti\\u017e na adapta\\u010dn\\u00ed kurz, kter\\u00fd se uskute\\u010dnil v hotelu Montanie. Z\\u00edskali jsme nov\\u00e9 vzpom\\u00ednky, nov\\u00e9 z\\u00e1\\u017eitky a taky to nejd\\u016fle\\u017eit\\u011bj\\u0161\\u00ed \\u2013 p\\u0159\\u00e1tele a lidi, na kter\\u00e9 se m\\u016f\\u017eeme spolehnout. <br \\/> Seznamovali jsme se, jezdili po r\\u016fzn\\u00fdch zaj\\u00edmav\\u00fdch m\\u00edstech, dokonce jsme si byli zaplavat nebo se zrelaxovat v saun\\u011b.<br \\/> Ka\\u017ed\\u00fd z v\\u00fdletu s n\\u011b\\u010d\\u00edm ode\\u0161el. A\\u0165 u\\u017e to byly skleni\\u010dky ze skl\\u00e1rny v Harrachov\\u011b, v\\u00e1no\\u010dn\\u00ed ozdoby z firmy Rautis nebo jen s bolav\\u00fdma nohama z v\\u00fdletu na Je\\u0161t\\u011bd a rozhlednu \\u0160t\\u011bp\\u00e1nku.<br \\/> Chceme pod\\u011bkovat v\\u0161em u\\u010ditel\\u016fm, co s n\\u00e1mi jezdili na v\\u00fdlety nebo se jen pod\\u00edleli na sestaven\\u00ed tohoto kurzu.<br \\/> Za prvn\\u00ed A i B, Nela Kultov\\u00e1.<\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":262,\"asset_id\":393,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('272', 'com_content.article.263', '', '2026-09-10 22:12:34', '140', '3280', '876426e7dc07c79aac6711ce5b7fca754a228ba4', '{\"title\":\"\\u0160koln\\u00ed v\\u00fdlet 2.AB v Havlovic\\u00edch\",\"alias\":\"skolni-vylet-2-ab-v-havlovicich\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2016-10-05 12:05:44\",\"publish_up\":\"2016-10-05 12:05:44\",\"ordering\":361,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":false,\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":false,\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":false,\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">\\u0160koln\\u00ed v\\u00fdlet 2.AB v Havlovic\\u00edch<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/phocagallery\\/2017\\/Havlovice\\/mercuri.jpg\\\" rel=\\\"alternate\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><img src=\\\"images\\/phocagallery\\/2017\\/Havlovice\\/mercuri.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"640\\\" height=\\\"480\\\" \\/><\\/span><\\/span><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><a href=\\\"index.php\\/cs\\/cs-fotogalerie\\/2016-2017\\/category\\/28-skolni-vylet-2-ab-v-havlovicich\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"alternate\\\">Fotogalerie ZDE:<\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Netradi\\u010dn\\u011b v z\\u00e1\\u0159\\u00ed se t\\u0159\\u00edda 2. AB vydala na \\u0161koln\\u00ed v\\u00fdlet do Havlovic. Vyu\\u017eili jsme kr\\u00e1sn\\u00e9 po\\u010das\\u00ed, abychom prot\\u00e1hli sv\\u00e1 t\\u011bla na kol\\u00e1ch i na tamn\\u00edch kr\\u00e1sn\\u00fdch sportovi\\u0161t\\u00edch. O na\\u0161e \\u017ealudky se staral v\\u00fdborn\\u011b Michal Ulrich z hosp\\u016fdky na Ho\\u0159i\\u010dk\\u00e1ch. Jak n\\u00e1m bylo n\\u00e1dhern\\u011b a jak\\u00e1 skv\\u011bl\\u00e1 atmosf\\u00e9ra na v\\u00fdlet\\u011b vl\\u00e1dla, sv\\u011bd\\u010d\\u00ed n\\u00e1sleduj\\u00edc\\u00ed fotodokumentace. Velk\\u00e9 d\\u00edky pat\\u0159\\u00ed i p. Nov\\u00e1\\u010dkovi za odvoz v\\u011bc\\u00ed a materi\\u00e1lu a spr\\u00e1vc\\u016fm Havlovick\\u00e9ho are\\u00e1lu za vst\\u0159\\u00edcnost. <br \\/> V\\u0161ichni u\\u017e se t\\u011b\\u0161\\u00edme na dal\\u0161\\u00ed spole\\u010dn\\u00e9 akce!!!! <br \\/> Sportu zdar t\\u0159\\u00edda 2.AB<\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":263,\"asset_id\":394,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
