MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Sportovn\\u00ed management - UNIFITTEST<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/phocagallery\\/2021\\/Sportovn\\u00ed management - UNIFITTEST\\/image_67164417.jpg\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/phocagallery\\/2021\\/Sportovn\\u00ed management - UNIFITTEST\\/image_67164417.jpg\\\" width=\\\"640\\\" \\/><\\/a><a href=\\\"index.php\\/cs\\/cs-fotogalerie\\/2019-2021\\/category\\/93-sportovni-management-unifittest\\\">Fotgalerie ZDE:<\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"padding-left: 30px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u017d\\u00e1ci 1. ro\\u010dn\\u00edku oboru Sportovn\\u00ed management m\\u011bli svoji prvn\\u00ed praktickou v\\u00fduku.<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"padding-left: 30px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">Na sportovn\\u00edm stadionu Hamra v N\\u00e1chod\\u011b realizovali motorick\\u00e9 testy s m\\u011b\\u0159en\\u00edm v\\u00fdkonu. Sv\\u00e9 hodnoty si pr\\u016fb\\u011b\\u017en\\u011b zaznamen\\u00e1vali a ve \\u0161kole je pak zapisovali do tabulek UNIFITTESTU. Sv\\u00e9 v\\u00fdkony budou vyhodnocovat pravideln\\u011b ka\\u017ed\\u00fd p\\u016fl rok. Test jim prozrad\\u00ed stav jejich v\\u00fdkonnosti. Sv\\u00e9 v\\u00fdsledky pou\\u017eij\\u00ed jako z\\u00e1klad sv\\u00e9 budouc\\u00ed semin\\u00e1rn\\u00ed pr\\u00e1ce z odborn\\u00e9 praxe.<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"padding-left: 30px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">M\\u011b\\u0159en\\u00e9 sportovn\\u00ed aktivity pro UNIFITTEST:\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"padding-left: 30px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">- \\u010dlunkov\\u00fd b\\u011bh<br \\/>- 12 min vytrvalostn\\u00ed b\\u011bh<br \\/>- sed-leh<br \\/>- skok z m\\u00edsta<br \\/>- shyby<br \\/>- dosah v p\\u0159edklonu<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":293,\"asset_id\":424,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('303', 'com_content.article.294', '', '2026-09-10 22:12:49', '140', '12332', '215addff5a1598118fa0ffc57aa0327fca19c1ec', '{\"title\":\"Gymn\\u00e1zium\",\"alias\":\"cs-gymnazium\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":8,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2015-12-19 12:31:09\",\"publish_up\":\"2015-12-19 12:31:09\",\"ordering\":58,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"cs-CZ\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":false,\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":false,\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":false,\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"NoParagraphStyle\\\" style=\\\"text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-GB\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\\\">GYMN\\u00c1ZIUM<\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN-GB\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\\"> \\u2013 <\\/span><span lang=\\\"EN-GB\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\\\">studijn\\u00ed obor 79-41-K\\/41<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"NoParagraphStyle\\\" style=\\\"text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/span>Jedn\\u00e1 se a klasick\\u00e9 studium v\\u0161eobecn\\u00e9ho gymn\\u00e1zia, kter\\u00e9 je zam\\u011b\\u0159eno na v\\u00fduku humanitn\\u00edch p\\u0159edm\\u011bt\\u016f. Ve 3. a 4. ro\\u010dn\\u00edku si \\u017e\\u00e1ci vyb\\u00edraj\\u00ed z\\u00a0voliteln\\u00fdch p\\u0159edm\\u011bt\\u016f, ty, kter\\u00e9 vyu\\u017eij\\u00ed v praxi, nebo, kter\\u00e9 budou cht\\u00edt d\\u00e1le studovat na vysok\\u00e9 \\u0161kole.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"NoParagraphStyle\\\" style=\\\"text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/dokumenty\\/ucebni_plan\\/Gymnazium.pdf\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"alternate\\\"><strong>U\\u010debn\\u00ed pl\\u00e1n pro studijn\\u00ed obor Gymn\\u00e1zium<\\/strong><\\/a><\\/span> <br \\/><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"NoParagraphStyle\\\" style=\\\"text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\\\"><b><span style=\\\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\\">Maturitn\\u00ed zkou\\u0161ka<br \\/><\\/span><\\/b>- je slo\\u017eena ze dvou \\u010d\\u00e1st\\u00ed:<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"NoParagraphStyle\\\" style=\\\"text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/span>1)<span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"> St\\u00e1tn\\u00ed spole\\u010dn\\u00e1 \\u010d\\u00e1st<br \\/><\\/span>-\\u017e\\u00e1k maturuje ze dvou p\\u0159edm\\u011bt\\u016f:<br \\/>1. \\u010cesk\\u00fd jazyk a literatura<br \\/>2. Ciz\\u00ed jazyk nebo matematika<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"NoParagraphStyle\\\" style=\\\"text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/span>2)<span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"> \\u0160koln\\u00ed profilov\\u00e1 \\u010d\\u00e1st<br \\/><\\/span>- \\u017e\\u00e1k maturuje ze dvou libovoln\\u00fdch p\\u0159edm\\u011bt\\u016f ze sv\\u00e9ho u\\u010debn\\u00edho pl\\u00e1nu<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"NoParagraphStyle\\\" style=\\\"text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/span><b><span style=\\\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\\">Pro koho je studium vhodn\\u00e9<\\/span><\\/b><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"NoParagraphStyle\\\" style=\\\"text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\\\">Je vhodn\\u00e9 pro studium formou individu\\u00e1ln\\u00edho vzd\\u011bl\\u00e1v\\u00e1n\\u00ed, pro ty, kte\\u0159\\u00ed se nemohou \\u00fa\\u010dastnit denn\\u00edho doch\\u00e1zen\\u00ed do \\u0161koly. Je vhodn\\u00e9 nap\\u0159\\u00edklad pro vrcholov\\u00e9 sportovce, studenty dlouhodob\\u011b v\\u00a0zahrani\\u010d\\u00ed, studenty zdravotn\\u011b znev\\u00fdhodn\\u011bn\\u00e9 \\u010di ji\\u017e studenty v\\u00a0zam\\u011bstn\\u00e1n\\u00ed, kte\\u0159\\u00ed si cht\\u011bj\\u00ed doplnit maturitn\\u00ed vzd\\u011bl\\u00e1n\\u00ed. Jde o \\u0159\\u00edzen\\u00e9 samostudium s\\u00a0pomoc\\u00ed elektronick\\u00fdch \\u010di osobn\\u00edch konzultac\\u00ed. Do \\u0161koly studenti doch\\u00e1zej\\u00ed pouze na zkou\\u0161ky.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"NoParagraphStyle\\\" style=\\\"text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\\\"><i><span style=\\\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\\">Budova \\u0161koly je bezbari\\u00e9rov\\u00e1, vhodn\\u00e1 pro \\u017e\\u00e1ky, kte\\u0159\\u00ed pot\\u0159ebuj\\u00ed bezbari\\u00e9rov\\u00fd pohyb.<\\/span><\\/i><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"NoParagraphStyle\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 150%; text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/span><img src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/obory\\/Gym_1.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"562\\\" height=\\\"378\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"NoParagraphStyle\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 150%;\\\"><b><span style=\\\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/b><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"NoParagraphStyle\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 150%;\\\"><b><span style=\\\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\\">V\\u00a0\\u010cEM JSME JIN\\u00cd?<\\/span><\\/b><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"NoParagraphStyle\\\" style=\\\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1;\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: Symbol;\\\">\\u00b7<span style=\\\"font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\\\">\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 <\\/span><\\/span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\\\">u\\u010debn\\u00ed pl\\u00e1n p\\u0159izp\\u016fsoben\\u00fd ka\\u017ed\\u00e9mu studentovi na m\\u00edru<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"NoParagraphStyle\\\" style=\\\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l1 l