tom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Interaktivn\\u00ed p\\u0159\\u00edprava na maturitn\\u00ed zkou\\u0161ku z\\u00a0angli\\u010dtiny<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/phocagallery\\/2016\\/interaktivni\\/1.jpg\\\" rel=\\\"alternate\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><img src=\\\"images\\/phocagallery\\/2016\\/interaktivni\\/1.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"250\\\" \\/><\\/span><\\/a><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/phocagallery\\/2016\\/interaktivni\\/2.jpg\\\" rel=\\\"alternate\\\"><img src=\\\"images\\/phocagallery\\/2016\\/interaktivni\\/2.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"250\\\" \\/><\\/a><a href=\\\"images\\/phocagallery\\/2016\\/interaktivni\\/3.jpg\\\" rel=\\\"alternate\\\"><img src=\\\"images\\/phocagallery\\/2016\\/interaktivni\\/3.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"250\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Angli\\u010dtin\\u00e1\\u0159i ze \\u010dtvrt\\u00e9ho ro\\u010dn\\u00edku se piln\\u011b p\\u0159ipravuj\\u00ed na nadch\\u00e1zej\\u00edc\\u00ed maturitn\\u00ed kl\\u00e1n\\u00ed. Maturitn\\u00ed okruhy si procvi\\u010duj\\u00ed interaktivn\\u00ed a z\\u00e1bavnou formou prost\\u0159ednictv\\u00edm z\\u00e1bavn\\u00e9 televizn\\u00ed sout\\u011b\\u017ee A-Z kv\\u00edz.<\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":433,\"asset_id\":564,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
