0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">DEN ANGLICK\\u00c9 KUCHYN\\u011a<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/phocagallery\\/2016\\/DEN_ANGLICKE_KUCHYNE\\/14.jpg\\\" rel=\\\"alternate\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/phocagallery\\/2016\\/DEN_ANGLICKE_KUCHYNE\\/14.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"650\\\" \\/><\\/span><\\/span><\\/a><a href=\\\"index.php\\/cs\\/cs-fotogalerie\\/cs-2015-2016\\/category\\/17-vareni\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"alternate\\\">Fotogalerie ZDE:<\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><br \\/>V \\u00fater\\u00fd, 24. 5., se skupina Anglick\\u00e9ho jazyka z 1. ro\\u010dn\\u00edku z\\u00fa\\u010dastnila miniprojektu s n\\u00e1zvem DEN ANGLICK\\u00c9 KUCHYN\\u011a v D\\u00e9\\u010dku. Pod veden\\u00edm Charlotte Mallinson, dobrovolnice z Anglie, si studenti zkusili p\\u0159ipravit tradi\\u010dn\\u00ed anglick\\u00e1 j\\u00eddla. Va\\u0159ili jsme FISH AND CHIPS, SHEPARD\\u2019S PIE a MINI BAKED POTATOES. Krom\\u011b p\\u0159\\u00edpravy a ochutn\\u00e1vky j\\u00eddla jsme si nav\\u00edc roz\\u0161\\u00ed\\u0159ili slovn\\u00ed z\\u00e1sobu na t\\u00e9ma \\u201ej\\u00eddlo\\u201c. It was a wonderful day <i class=\\\"_lew\\\" title=\\\"Emotikona smile\\\"><i class=\\\"_4-k1 img sp_fM-mz8spZ1b sx_5371b4\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><img src=\\\"media\\/editors\\/tinymce\\/plugins\\/emoticons\\/img\\/smiley-smile.gif\\\" alt=\\\"smile\\\" \\/><\\/span><\\/i><\\/i>.<\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":437,\"asset_id\":568,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
