('449', 'com_content.article.440', '', '2026-09-10 22:14:37', '140', '3289', 'da37626369cccd449b32746c5112557f14500739', '{\"title\":\"\\u017div\\u00e1 knihovna\",\"alias\":\"ziva-knihovna\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2016-05-30 09:11:33\",\"publish_up\":\"2016-05-30 09:11:33\",\"ordering\":373,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":false,\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":false,\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":false,\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">\\u017div\\u00e1 knihovna<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/phocagallery\\/2016\\/Ziva_knihovna\\/1.jpg\\\" rel=\\\"alternate\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/phocagallery\\/2016\\/Ziva_knihovna\\/1.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"650\\\" \\/><\\/a><em><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><a href=\\\"index.php\\/cs\\/cs-fotogalerie\\/cs-2015-2016\\/category\\/19-ziva-knihovna\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"alternate\\\">Fotogalerie ZDE:<\\/a><\\/span><\\/em><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Projekt \\u017dIV\\u00c1 KNIHOVNA \\u2013 UM\\u011aN\\u00cd \\u017d\\u00cdT SPOLU prob\\u011bhl na Academia Mercurii ve spolupr\\u00e1ci s\\u00a0SV\\u010c D\\u00e9\\u010dko a Domem zahrani\\u010dn\\u00ed spolupr\\u00e1ce dne 26. 5. 2016. Projekt je postaven na principu: Potkej sv\\u016fj p\\u0159edsudek! Na m\\u00edsto mluven\\u00ed o p\\u0159edsudku se studenti mohli setkat a v\\u00a0anglick\\u00e9m \\u010di \\u010desk\\u00e9m jazyce pohovo\\u0159it se z\\u00e1stupci vybran\\u00fdch t\\u00e9mat, kte\\u0159\\u00ed vystupovali jako \\u017eiv\\u00e9 knihy, co vypr\\u00e1v\\u00ed sv\\u016fj \\u017eivotn\\u00ed p\\u0159\\u00edb\\u011bh. \\u017divou knihou byl nap\\u0159\\u00edklad cestovatel z\\u00a0Indie, ob\\u010dan Keni \\u017eij\\u00edc\\u00ed ve st\\u0159edn\\u00ed Evrop\\u011b, velvyslanec \\u010cR v\\u00a0S\\u00fdrii \\u010di dobrovoln\\u00edci EDS z\\u00a0r\\u016fzn\\u00fdch zem\\u00ed Evropy. Na\\u0161i studenti tak z\\u00edskali vhled do r\\u016fzn\\u00fdch \\u017eivotn\\u00edch situac\\u00ed a z\\u00e1rove\\u0148 mohli procvi\\u010dit sv\\u00e9 znalosti anglick\\u00e9ho jazyka.<\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":440,\"asset_id\":571,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('450', 'com_content.article.441', '', '2026-09-10 22:14:38', '140', '2801', '3124f0ae99367adb21c5b023d2141ad46355ac0a', '{\"title\":\"\\u017d\\u00e1kyn\\u011b 1. ro\\u010dn\\u00edku oboru Cestovn\\u00ed ruch vystupuj\\u00ed jako moder\\u00e1torky dokument\\u00e1rn\\u00edho filmu\",\"alias\":\"adrspasske-skaly\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2016-05-30 09:22:49\",\"publish_up\":\"2016-05-30 09:22:49\",\"ordering\":372,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":false,\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":false,\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":false,\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">\\u017d\\u00e1kyn\\u011b 1. ro\\u010dn\\u00edku oboru Cestovn\\u00ed ruch vystupuj\\u00ed jako moder\\u00e1torky dokument\\u00e1rn\\u00edho filmu<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/youtu.be\\/YaEGQkhXwu4\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"alternate\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/Adr.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"650\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Anna K\\u016fsov\\u00e1 a Tereza Martincov\\u00e1, \\u017e\\u00e1kyn\\u011b 1. ro\\u010dn\\u00edku oboru Cestovn\\u00ed ruch, m\\u011bly vyj\\u00edme\\u010dnou mo\\u017enost b\\u011bhem sv\\u00e9 odborn\\u00e9 praxe v Adr\\u0161pa\\u0161sk\\u00fdch skal\\u00e1ch, kde pracovaly jako pr\\u016fvodkyn\\u011b a to vystupovat jako moder\\u00e1torky dokument\\u00e1rn\\u00edho filmu o Adr\\u0161pa\\u0161sk\\u00fdch skal\\u00e1ch.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Dokument je zde ke shl\\u00e9dnut\\u00ed:<br \\/> <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/youtu.be\\/YaEGQkhXwu4\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\">https:\\/\\/youtu.be\\/YaEGQkhXwu4<\\/a><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":441,\"asset_id\":572,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('451', 'com_content.article.442', '', '2026-09-10 22:14:38', '140', '3516', 'cc3d7b5315e2ce13ea8c905064aa4c80496018f5', '{\"title\":\"DAY OF ENGLISH CUISINE\",\"alias\":\"day-of-english-cuisine\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2016-06-02 07:28:22\",\"publish_up\":\"2016-06-02 07:28:22\",\"ordering\":371,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":false,\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":false,\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":false,\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">DAY OF ENGLISH CUISINE<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\">\\u00a0<a href=\\\"DAY%20OF ENGLISH CUISINE\\\" rel=\\\"alternate\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/phocagallery\\/2016\\/DAY_OF_ENGLISH_CUISINE\\/P5310648.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"650\\\" \\/><\\/a><em><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><a href=\\\"index.php\\/cs\\/cs-fotogalerie\\/cs-2015-2016\\/category\\/20-day-of-english-cuisine\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"alternate\\\">Fotogalerie ZDE:<\\/a><\\/span><\\/em><br \\/><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/Academia-Mercurii-soukrom%C3%A1-st%C5%99edn%C3%AD-%C5%A1kola-v-N%C3%A1chod%C4%9B-721620921249175\\/photos\\/?tab=album&amp;album_id=1015110338566897\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"alternate\\\">V\\u00edce foto na FB<\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0Studenti 1. a 2. ro\\u010dn\\u00edku Academia Mercurii m\\u011bli dne 30. 5. 2016 mo\\u017enost zkusit si uva\\u0159it n\\u011bkolik j\\u00eddel tradi\\u010dn\\u00ed anglick\\u00e9 kuchyn\\u011b. Za pomoci anglick\\u00e9 dobrovolnice Charlotte Mallinson a dal\\u0161\\u00edch zahrani\\u010dn\\u00edch dobrovolnic Evropsk\\u00e9 dobrovoln\\u00e9 slu\\u017eby studenti va\\u0159ili v\\u00a0prostor\\u00e1ch SV\\u010c D\\u00e9\\u010dka tradi\\u010dn\\u00ed anglick\\u00fd v\\u00e1no\\u010dn\\u00ed puding (zcela odli\\u0161n\\u00fd od \\u010desk\\u00e9ho pudingu), tradi\\u010dn\\u00ed rybu Fish and chips, past\\u00fd\\u0159sk\\u00fd kol\\u00e1\\u010d z\\u00a0mlet\\u00e9ho masa a bramborov\\u00e9 ka\\u0161e Sheppard\\u00b4s pie a zape\\u010den\\u00fd brambor se s\\u00fdrem \\u010cedar Baked potatoes with Cheddar cheese. J\\u00eddla se n\\u00e1m vyda\\u0159ila a \\u010dek\\u00e1n\\u00ed na v\\u00e1no\\u010dn\\u00ed pudink jsme vyu\\u017eili k\\u00a0hran\\u00ed vzd\\u011bl\\u00e1vac\\u00edch her v\\u00a0anglick\\u00e9m jazyce. Enjoy your meal!<\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":442,\"asset_id\":573,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
