('552', 'com_content.article.543', '', '2026-09-10 22:15:49', '140', '6558', 'cee92c88fd6e9318fcb7aaad5a03c9aadd789d51', '{\"title\":\"Z\\u00e1znam z 24. zased\\u00e1n\\u00ed Valn\\u00e9ho shrom\\u00e1\\u017ed\\u011bn\\u00ed S\\u00edt\\u011b p\\u0159idru\\u017een\\u00fdch \\u0161kol UNESCO v \\u010cesk\\u00e9 republice\",\"alias\":\"zaznam-z-24-zasedani-valneho-shromazdeni-site-pridruzenych-skol-unesco-v-ceske-republice\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2018-10-22 10:31:32\",\"publish_up\":\"2018-10-22 10:31:32\",\"ordering\":273,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":false,\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":false,\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":false,\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Z\\u00e1znam z 24. zased\\u00e1n\\u00ed Valn\\u00e9ho shrom\\u00e1\\u017ed\\u011bn\\u00ed S\\u00edt\\u011b p\\u0159idru\\u017een\\u00fdch \\u0161kol UNESCO v \\u010cesk\\u00e9 republice<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2019\\/IMG_2559.jpg\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2019\\/IMG_2559.jpg\\\" width=\\\"640\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Ve dnech 24. a 25. z\\u00e1\\u0159\\u00ed 2018 se veden\\u00ed \\u0161koly z\\u00fa\\u010dastnilo 24. zased\\u00e1n\\u00ed Valn\\u00e9ho shrom\\u00e1\\u017ed\\u011bn\\u00ed S\\u00edt\\u011b p\\u0159idru\\u017een\\u00fdch \\u0161kol UNESCO v\\u00a0\\u010cR v\\u00a0Hlinsku. Akce se konala pod z\\u00e1\\u0161titou Ing. Bohumila Bern\\u00e1\\u0161ka, \\u010dlena Rady Pardubick\\u00e9ho kraje za oblast \\u0161kolstv\\u00ed. Jedn\\u00e1n\\u00ed se konalo v\\u00a0Multifunk\\u010dn\\u00edm centru Hlinsko. \\u00davodn\\u00ed vystoupen\\u00ed zah\\u00e1jil RNDr. Rostislav Dvo\\u0159\\u00e1\\u010dek, \\u0159editel hostitelsk\\u00e9 \\u0161koly, a pot\\u00e9 prob\\u011bhla i vystoupen\\u00ed v\\u00fdznamn\\u00fdch host\\u016f - p\\u00e1n\\u016f Miroslava Kr\\u010dila, DiS., starosty m\\u011bsta Hlinsko a prof. PhDr. Stanislava \\u0160techa, CSc., p\\u0159edsedy \\u010cesk\\u00e9 komise pro UNESCO.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Dal\\u0161\\u00ed \\u010d\\u00e1st\\u00ed programu byl blok tematick\\u00fdch prezentac\\u00ed, kde PhDr. Ilona Vojancov\\u00e1 z N\\u00e1rodn\\u00edho pam\\u00e1tkov\\u00e9ho \\u00fastavu, Spr\\u00e1vy souboru lidov\\u00fdch staveb Vyso\\u010dina p\\u0159ednesla p\\u0159edn\\u00e1\\u0161ku na t\\u00e9ma: <em>\\u201eVesnick\\u00e9 masopustn\\u00ed obch\\u016fzky a masky na Hlinecku\\u201c.<\\/em> N\\u00e1sledn\\u011b prof. PhDr. Leo\\u0161 \\u0160atava, CSc. z \\u00dastavu etnologie, Univerzity Karlovy v\\u00a0Praze p\\u0159edstavil p\\u0159edn\\u00e1\\u0161ku na t\\u00e9ma <em>\\u201eProblematika asimilace a revitalizace men\\u0161inov\\u00fdch jazyk\\u016f: aktu\\u00e1ln\\u00ed trendy\\u201c.<\\/em><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Pot\\u00e9 dostaly slovo vybran\\u00e9 \\u0161koly a prezentovaly sv\\u00e9 n\\u00e1vrhy projekt\\u016f konan\\u00e9 v r\\u00e1mci T\\u00fddne \\u0161kol UNESCO ve \\u0161koln\\u00edm roce 2017\\/2018 na t\\u00e9ma: \\u201eOsudov\\u00e9 osmi\\u010dky v na\\u0161ich d\\u011bjin\\u00e1ch\\u201c a \\u201eSport jako prost\\u0159edek k podpo\\u0159e vzd\\u011bl\\u00e1v\\u00e1n\\u00ed, zdrav\\u00ed, rozvoje a m\\u00edru\\u201c.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Ostatn\\u00ed \\u0161koly prezentovaly akce konan\\u00e9 v r\\u00e1mci T\\u00fddne \\u0161kol UNESCO ve \\u0161koln\\u00edm roce 2017\\/2018 prost\\u0159ednictv\\u00edm plak\\u00e1t\\u016f, kter\\u00e9 m\\u011bly nov\\u011b digit\\u00e1ln\\u00ed podobu, a kter\\u00e9 byly prom\\u00edt\\u00e1ny ve smy\\u010dce v pr\\u016fb\\u011bhu cel\\u00e9ho zased\\u00e1n\\u00ed.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>V\\u00a0odpoledn\\u00edch hodin\\u00e1ch prob\\u011bhly na t\\u00e9ma: <em>\\u201ehlineck\\u00fd Betl\\u00e9m a pivovar Rycht\\u00e1\\u0159\\u201c<\\/em> \\u00a0ve skupin\\u00e1ch exkurze; ty pak byly\\u00a0 zakon\\u010deny prohl\\u00eddkou \\u0161koly.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Druh\\u00fd den zah\\u00e1jila N\\u00e1rodn\\u00ed koordin\\u00e1torka zhodnocen\\u00edm stavu \\u010dlensk\\u00e9 z\\u00e1kladny, p\\u0159edstavila pl\\u00e1n \\u010dinnosti S\\u00edt\\u011b na \\u0161koln\\u00ed rok 2018\\/2019 a pravidla pro pou\\u017e\\u00edv\\u00e1n\\u00ed loga \\u010dlena S\\u00edt\\u011b.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Dal\\u0161\\u00ed \\u010d\\u00e1st\\u00ed programu byl op\\u011bt blok tematick\\u00fdch prezentac\\u00ed a to: \\u201eK<em>onflikty mezi velk\\u00fdmi skupinami lid\\u00ed a zp\\u016fsoby jejich \\u0159e\\u0161en\\u00ed<\\/em>\\u201c - doc. PhDr. Zden\\u011bk Uherek, CSc., Institut sociologick\\u00fdch studi\\u00ed, Fakulta soci\\u00e1ln\\u00edch v\\u011bd, Univerzita Karlova v\\u00a0Praze. <em>\\u201eMezin\\u00e1rodn\\u00ed rok periodick\\u00e9 soustavy prvk\\u016f\\u201c<\\/em> - RNDr. Ing. Petr Distler, Ph.D., Katedra u\\u010ditelstv\\u00ed a didaktiky chemie, P\\u0159\\u00edrodov\\u011bdeck\\u00e1 fakulta Univerzity Karlovy v\\u00a0Praze a posledn\\u00ed prezentace <em>\\u201eMezin\\u00e1rodn\\u00ed d\\u011btsk\\u00e1 v\\u00fdtvarn\\u00e1 v\\u00fdstava Lidice\\u201c<\\/em> - Mgr. Martina Lehmannov\\u00e1, Pam\\u00e1tn\\u00edk Lidice.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Na z\\u00e1v\\u011br valn\\u00e9 shrom\\u00e1\\u017ed\\u011bn\\u00ed na n\\u00e1vrh Koordina\\u010dn\\u00edho t\\u00fdmu schv\\u00e1lilo n\\u00e1vrhy t\\u00e9mat pro projekty konan\\u00e9 v r\\u00e1mci T\\u00fddne \\u0161kol UNESCO ve \\u0161koln\\u00edm roce 2018\\/2019:<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>(1) Mezin\\u00e1rodn\\u00ed rok jazyk\\u016f p\\u016fvodn\\u00edch obyvatel<br \\/>(2) Mezin\\u00e1rodn\\u00ed rok um\\u00edrn\\u011bnosti<br \\/>(3) Mezin\\u00e1rodn\\u00ed rok periodick\\u00e9 soustavy prvk\\u016f<\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":543,\"asset_id\":674,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
