l\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Z\\u00e1meck\\u00e9 schody - z\\u00e1vody<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<div dir=\\\"ltr\\\">\\r\\n<div style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">Dv\\u011b druh\\u00e1 m\\u00edsta obsadily t\\u00fdmy chlapc\\u016f a d\\u00edvek p\\u0159i b\\u011bhu do z\\u00e1meck\\u00fdch schod\\u016f 8.11.2018 v N\\u00e1chod\\u011b.\\u00a0<\\/div>\\r\\n<div style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">V\\u0161em za p\\u0159edveden\\u00e9 v\\u00fdkony d\\u011bkujeme. MV<\\/div>\\r\\n<div style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/div>\\r\\n<div style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2019\\/Schody\\/IMG_20181108_115345.jpg\\\"><img src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2019\\/Schody\\/IMG_20181108_115345.jpg\\\" width=\\\"200\\\" \\/><\\/a> \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 <a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2019\\/Schody\\/IMG_20181108_101310.jpg\\\"><img src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2019\\/Schody\\/IMG_20181108_101310.jpg\\\" width=\\\"200\\\" \\/><\\/a>\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 <a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2019\\/Schody\\/IMG_20181108_101400.jpg\\\"><img src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2019\\/Schody\\/IMG_20181108_101400.jpg\\\" width=\\\"200\\\" \\/><\\/a>\\u00a0<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/div>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":548,\"asset_id\":679,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
