":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Fitness, spr\\u00e1vn\\u00e1 strava a v\\u00fd\\u017eiva \\u2013 p\\u0159edn\\u00e1\\u0161ka \\u2013 6.12.2018<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Jan Val\\u00e1\\u0161ek -\\u00a0 profesion\\u00e1ln\\u00ed tren\\u00e9r, v\\u00fd\\u017eivov\\u00fd poradce, mas\\u00e9r<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u017d\\u00e1ci 2. a 3. ro\\u010dn\\u00edku se z\\u00fa\\u010dastnili zaj\\u00edmav\\u00e9 p\\u0159edn\\u00e1\\u0161ky o tom, jak za\\u010d\\u00edt cvi\\u010dit, jak se spr\\u00e1vn\\u011b stravovat, jak\\u00e1 pravidla dodr\\u017eovat.<br \\/>Na p\\u0159ipraven\\u00e9 dotazy Jan Val\\u00e1\\u0161ek velmi fundovan\\u011b odpov\\u00eddal. Doporu\\u010dil n\\u00e1vody na cvi\\u010den\\u00ed a stravu, jak za\\u010d\\u00e1te\\u010dn\\u00edk\\u016fm, tak pokro\\u010dil\\u00fdm.<br \\/>Na ja\\u0159e se ur\\u010dit\\u011b setk\\u00e1me znovu a popov\\u00edd\\u00e1me o v\\u00fdsledc\\u00edch doporu\\u010den\\u00fdch rad.\\u00a0<\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":551,\"asset_id\":682,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
