 style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Maturitn\\u00ed ples 4.ABC, 2018<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/phocagallery\\/2019\\/Ples\\/1.jpg\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/phocagallery\\/2019\\/Ples\\/1.jpg\\\" width=\\\"640\\\" \\/><\\/a><em><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><a href=\\\"index.php\\/cs\\/cs-fotogalerie\\/2017-2019\\/category\\/72-maturitni-ples\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">Fotogalerie ZDE:<\\/a><br \\/><br \\/><\\/span><\\/em><\\/p>\\r\\n<div dir=\\\"ltr\\\">\\r\\n<div dir=\\\"ltr\\\">\\r\\n<div dir=\\\"ltr\\\">\\r\\n<div dir=\\\"ltr\\\">\\r\\n<div dir=\\\"ltr\\\">\\r\\n<div dir=\\\"ltr\\\">\\r\\n<div dir=\\\"ltr\\\">\\r\\n<div dir=\\\"ltr\\\">\\r\\n<div dir=\\\"ltr\\\">\\r\\n<div dir=\\\"ltr\\\"><span style=\\\"margin: 0px; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #000000;\\\">Dne 8. 12. 2018 prob\\u011bhl maturitn\\u00ed ples t\\u0159\\u00edd 4. ABC v\\u00a0prostor\\u00e1ch n\\u00e1chodsk\\u00e9ho divadla Ber\\u00e1nek. Cel\\u00fd ples se nesl v havajsk\\u00e9m stylu. Byla k vid\\u011bn\\u00ed \\u0159ada vystoupen\\u00ed student\\u016f maturitn\\u00edch ro\\u010dn\\u00edk\\u016f. B\\u011bhem plesu prob\\u00edhala bohat\\u00e1 sout\\u011b\\u017e o ceny.\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/span><\\/div>\\r\\n<div>Snad se v\\u0161em n\\u00e1v\\u0161t\\u011bvn\\u00edk\\u016fm ples l\\u00edbil a v p\\u0159\\u00ed\\u0161t\\u00edm roce na vid\\u011bnou.\\u00a0<\\/div>\\r\\n<div>\\u00a0<\\/div>\\r\\n<div>Studenti maturitn\\u00edho ro\\u010dn\\u00edku.<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/div>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":553,\"asset_id\":684,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
