('564', 'com_content.article.555', '', '2026-09-10 22:15:55', '140', '2891', '286f012e4ccf9e2e6e339441695e88d3c53e6db0', '{\"title\":\"\\u0160koln\\u00ed kolo Ekonomick\\u00e9 olympi\\u00e1dy\",\"alias\":\"skolni-kolo-ekonomicke-olympiady\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2019-01-04 19:52:49\",\"publish_up\":\"2019-01-04 19:58:04\",\"ordering\":263,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":false,\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":false,\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":false,\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2019\\/EO.png\\\" width=\\\"234\\\" height=\\\"95\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Ekonomick\\u00e1 olympi\\u00e1da<\\/strong>\\u00a0je mezin\\u00e1rodn\\u00ed sout\\u011b\\u017e ve znalostech z ekonomie a financ\\u00ed, kter\\u00e1 je ur\\u010dena student\\u016fm st\\u0159edn\\u00edch \\u0161kol. Ot\\u00e1zky do sout\\u011b\\u017ee a koncepci Ekonomick\\u00e9 olympi\\u00e1dy spoluvytv\\u00e1\\u0159\\u00ed ekonomov\\u00e9 a odborn\\u00edci z Institutu ekonomick\\u00e9ho vzd\\u011bl\\u00e1v\\u00e1n\\u00ed a \\u010cesk\\u00e9 n\\u00e1rodn\\u00ed banky.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u0160koln\\u00edho kola 3. ro\\u010dn\\u00edku ekonomick\\u00e9 olympi\\u00e1dy se v\\u00a0leto\\u0161n\\u00edm roce z\\u00fa\\u010dastnili \\u017e\\u00e1ci z\\u00a01. \\u2013 4. ro\\u010dn\\u00edku. Do krajsk\\u00e9ho kola postoupila <br \\/><strong>Odeta Packov\\u00e1<\\/strong> z\\u00a01. ro\\u010dn\\u00edku, obor Ekonomick\\u00e9 lyceum.\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Gratulujeme!!!!<br \\/>Ing. Jaroslava Teuberov\\u00e1<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><em><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/em><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":555,\"asset_id\":686,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('565', 'com_content.article.556', '', '2026-09-10 22:15:55', '140', '4511', '00c130681a654c6e98c5322c44d0d7610070ee37', '{\"title\":\"Studenti \\u00fasp\\u011b\\u0161n\\u011b reprezentuj\\u00ed na\\u0161\\u00ed \\u0161kolu na Veletrhu JA firem\",\"alias\":\"studenti-uspesne-reprezentuji-nasi-skolu-na-veletrhu-ja-firem\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2019-01-21 09:33:44\",\"publish_up\":\"2019-01-21 09:53:55\",\"ordering\":261,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":false,\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":false,\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":false,\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Studenti \\u00fasp\\u011b\\u0161n\\u011b reprezentuj\\u00ed na\\u0161\\u00ed \\u0161kolu na Veletrhu JA firem<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2019\\/ja_firma.jpg\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2019\\/ja_firma.jpg\\\" width=\\\"640\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Ve st\\u0159edu 12. prosince 2018 se v prostor\\u00e1ch Obchodn\\u00ed akademie, S0\\u0160 a Jazykov\\u00e9 \\u0161koly s pr\\u00e1vem st\\u00e1tn\\u00ed jazykov\\u00e9 zkou\\u0161ky, Hradec Kr\\u00e1lov\\u00e9 konal ji\\u017e <strong>7. ro\\u010dn\\u00edk Veletrhu JA firem<\\/strong> <strong>s\\u00a0mezin\\u00e1rodn\\u00ed \\u00fa\\u010dast\\u00ed.<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Sou\\u010d\\u00e1st\\u00ed veletrhu bylo celkem 7 sout\\u011b\\u017e\\u00ed:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Nejlep\\u0161\\u00ed JA firma<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Nejlep\\u0161\\u00ed logo<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Nejlep\\u0161\\u00ed slogan<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>90 vte\\u0159in s investorem (v anglick\\u00e9m jazyku)<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Nejlep\\u0161\\u00ed prodejce<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Nejsympati\\u010dt\\u011bj\\u0161\\u00ed JA firma<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Firma s\\u00a0nejv\\u011bt\\u0161\\u00edmi tr\\u017ebami<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>Sv\\u00e9 podnikatelsk\\u00e9 dovednosti zde pom\\u011b\\u0159ovalo celkem 24 studentsk\\u00fdch firem z\\u00a0\\u010cesk\\u00e9 a Slovensk\\u00e9 republiky.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Na\\u0161i \\u0161kolu velice \\u00fasp\\u011b\\u0161n\\u011b reprezentovaly studentsk\\u00e9 firmy <strong>DreamPrint a GreenEnergy<\\/strong>, kter\\u00e9 zalo\\u017eili \\u017e\\u00e1ci 3. ro\\u010dn\\u00edku v\\u00a0r\\u00e1mci p\\u0159edm\\u011btu aplikovan\\u00e1 ekonomika.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Firma DreamPrint vyr\\u00e1b\\u00ed potisky na tri\\u010dka a mikiny, podnikatelsk\\u00fdm z\\u00e1m\\u011brem firmy GreenEnergy je V\\u00fdroba zdrav\\u00fdch ka\\u0161\\u00ed a m\\u00fcsli.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Firma DreamPrint zv\\u00edt\\u011bzila se sv\\u00fdm sloganem: \\u201eTiskneme va\\u0161e sny\\u201c, <strong>1. m\\u00edsto<\\/strong> je v\\u00a0konkurenci 24 firem velk\\u00fdm \\u00fasp\\u011bchem.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Dant\\u00e9 Damas Burdych obsadil <strong>2. m\\u00edsto<\\/strong> v\\u00a0sout\\u011b\\u017ei 90 vte\\u0159in s\\u00a0investorem, kde obhajoval p\\u0159ed porotou podnikatelsk\\u00fd z\\u00e1m\\u011br firmy DreamPrint v\\u00a0anglick\\u00e9m jazyce.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Gratulujeme a d\\u011bkujeme za reprezentaci \\u0161koly.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Ing. Jaroslava Teuberov\\u00e1<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=8FxhhlzCzkI&amp;feature=youtu.be\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">Pod\\u00edvejte se na report\\u00e1\\u017e \\u010cT1 ze 7. ro\\u010dn\\u00edku Veletrhu studentsk\\u00fdch JA firem<\\/a><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":556,\"asset_id\":687,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
