\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Slavnostn\\u00ed p\\u0159ed\\u00e1v\\u00e1n\\u00ed maturitn\\u00edho vysv\\u011bd\\u010den\\u00ed 2019<br \\/><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/phocagallery\\/2019\\/Maturitni_vysvedceni\\/P1130223.jpg\\\" width=\\\"640\\\" \\/><a href=\\\"index.php\\/cs\\/cs-fotogalerie\\/2017-2019\\/category\\/78-maturitni-vysvedceni\\\">Fotogalerie ZDE:<\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>11.\\u010dervna se na n\\u00e1chodsk\\u00e9 radnici konalo ji\\u017e tradi\\u010dn\\u00ed p\\u0159ed\\u00e1v\\u00e1n\\u00ed maturitn\\u00edch vysv\\u011bd\\u010den\\u00ed absolvent\\u016fm studijn\\u00edch obor\\u016f cestovn\\u00ed ruch a ekonomick\\u00e9 lyceum. Maturitn\\u00ed vysv\\u011bd\\u010den\\u00ed p\\u0159edal a absolvent\\u016fm pogratuloval pan m\\u00edstostarosta Mgr. Franti\\u0161ek Majer spole\\u010dn\\u011b s\\u00a0pan\\u00ed \\u0159editelkou Mgr. Danou Jarol\\u00edmovou, t\\u0159\\u00eddn\\u00edm u\\u010ditelem Mgr. Martinem Vrabcem a dal\\u0161\\u00edmi pedagogy. <br \\/>V\\u0161em na\\u0161im absolvent\\u016fm gratulujeme!<\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":585,\"asset_id\":716,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('595', 'com_content.article.586', '', '2026-09-10 22:16:11', '140', '3757', '55a3c281b194c773f882f4ec8084025004f57624', '{\"title\":\"\\u201eV\\u0161ude dob\\u0159e doma nejl\\u00edp\\u201c\",\"alias\":\"vsude-dobre-doma-nejlip\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2019-06-18 20:44:01\",\"publish_up\":\"2019-06-18 20:44:01\",\"ordering\":247,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":false,\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":false,\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":false,\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">\\u201eV\\u0161ude dob\\u0159e doma nejl\\u00edp\\u201c <\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/phocagallery\\/2019\\/Skolky\\/Brezinova_1.jpg\\\" width=\\\"640\\\" \\/><a href=\\\"index.php\\/cs\\/cs-fotogalerie\\/2017-2019\\/category\\/79-vsude-dobre-doma-nejlip\\\">Fotogalerie ZDE:<\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>\\u201eV\\u0161ude dob\\u0159e doma nejl\\u00edp\\u201c<\\/strong> a neb jak procestovat 6 zem\\u00ed za jeden den<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Ve dnech 17. a 18. \\u010dervna p\\u0159ipravili u\\u010ditel\\u00e9 a vybran\\u00ed \\u017e\\u00e1ci 2. a 3. ro\\u010dn\\u00edku na\\u0161\\u00ed \\u0161koly d\\u011btskou animaci pro n\\u00e1chodsk\\u00e9 \\u0161kolky. Jednalo se o \\u0161kolku B\\u0159ezinova a Al\\u0161ova. Pro \\u0161kolkov\\u00e9 d\\u011bti bylo nachyst\\u00e1no 6 stanovi\\u0161\\u0165, kde ka\\u017ed\\u00e9 stanovi\\u0161t\\u011b p\\u0159edstavovalo jednu zemi. Zem\\u011b byly vybr\\u00e1ny podle jazyk\\u016f, kter\\u00e9 se na na\\u0161\\u00ed \\u0161kole vyu\\u010duj\\u00ed, tedy: \\u010cesk\\u00e1 republika, Anglie, N\\u011bmecko, \\u0160pan\\u011blsko, Rusko a Francie. \\u017d\\u00e1ci si pro d\\u011bti p\\u0159ipravili r\\u016fzn\\u00e9 pom\\u016fcky, se\\u00a0kter\\u00fdmi pak dan\\u00e9 zem\\u011b p\\u0159edstavili. Tento nov\\u00fd projekt m\\u011bl velk\\u00fd \\u00fasp\\u011bch jak na stran\\u011b mate\\u0159sk\\u00fdch \\u0161kol, tak na stran\\u011b na\\u0161\\u00ed st\\u0159edn\\u00ed \\u0161koly. Setk\\u00e1n\\u00ed t\\u011bchto dvou generac\\u00ed a vz\\u00e1jemn\\u00e9 p\\u0159ed\\u00e1v\\u00e1n\\u00ed informac\\u00ed bylo velk\\u00fdm z\\u00e1\\u017eitkem pro v\\u0161echny z\\u00fa\\u010dastn\\u011bn\\u00e9. R\\u00e1di bychom v\\u00a0p\\u0159\\u00ed\\u0161t\\u00edm \\u0161koln\\u00edm roce tento projekt op\\u011bt zopakovali.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Ob\\u011bma generac\\u00edm moc d\\u011bkujeme a p\\u0159ejeme kr\\u00e1sn\\u00e9 pr\\u00e1zdniny!<br \\/>Igor Chmela\\u0159 a \\u0160\\u00e1rka Rudolfov\\u00e1<\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":586,\"asset_id\":717,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('596', 'com_content.article.587', '', '2026-09-10 22:16:11', '140', '4017', '383f1ba9d15f90058721688f6a8d022eb6c66162', '{\"title\":\"Prezentace studentsk\\u00fdch firem Junior Achievement\",\"alias\":\"prezentace-studentskych-firem-junior-achievement\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2019-06-23 19:40:37\",\"publish_up\":\"2019-06-23 19:45:42\",\"ordering\":246,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":false,\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":false,\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":false,\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Prezentace studentsk\\u00fdch firem Junior Achievement<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/phocagallery\\/2019\\/Junior_Achievement\\/1-horz.jpg\\\" width=\\\"640\\\" \\/><a href=\\\"index.php\\/cs\\/cs-fotogalerie\\/2017-2019\\/category\\/80-junior-achievement\\\">Fotogalerie ZDE:<\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Ve st\\u0159edu 19. 6. prob\\u011bhly v\\u00a0budov\\u011b \\u0161koly prezentace studentsk\\u00fdch firem, kter\\u00e9 touto akc\\u00ed ukon\\u010dily svoji \\u010dinnost. Studentsk\\u00e9 re\\u00e1ln\\u00e9 spole\\u010dnosti byly zalo\\u017eeny v\\u00a0r\\u00e1mci p\\u0159edm\\u011btu aplikovan\\u00e1 ekonomie ve 3. ro\\u010dn\\u00edku studijn\\u00edch obor\\u016f ekonomick\\u00e9 lyceum a cestovn\\u00ed ruch.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Spole\\u010dnost \\u201eGreenEnergy\\u201c m\\u011bla jako svoji hlavn\\u00ed \\u010dinnost v\\u00fdrobu ovesn\\u00fdch ka\\u0161\\u00ed a m\\u00fcsli do znovu naplniteln\\u00fdch sklenic. Viz\\u00ed firmy bylo nab\\u00eddnout b\\u011b\\u017en\\u011b se stravuj\\u00edc\\u00edm lidem zdrav\\u011bj\\u0161\\u00ed a ekologi\\u010dt\\u011bj\\u0161\\u00ed zp\\u016fsob, pod motem \\u201eZdrav\\u011b \\u2013 chutn\\u011b - hrav\\u011b\\u201c.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Spole\\u010dnost \\u201eDreamprint\\u201c se naopak rozhodla podnikat v\\u00a0potisc\\u00edch na oble\\u010den\\u00ed. Viz\\u00ed firmy bylo otisknout to co si z\\u00e1kazn\\u00edk \\u201evysn\\u00ed\\u201c na libovoln\\u00fd kus oble\\u010den\\u00ed. Z\\u00a0vize vzniklo i moto spole\\u010dnosti \\u201eTiskneme Va\\u0161e sny\\u201c.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Ob\\u011b firmy \\u010delily b\\u011bhem roku jak mnoh\\u00fdm obt\\u00ed\\u017e\\u00edm, tak skl\\u00edzely \\u00fasp\\u011bch, nap\\u0159\\u00edklad v\\u00a0sout\\u011b\\u017e\\u00edch studentsk\\u00fdch firem, kde firma Dreamprint z\\u00edskala 1. m\\u00edsto za nejlep\\u0161\\u00ed slogan a 2. m\\u00edsto za prezentaci v\\u00a0anglick\\u00e9m jazyce. \\u017d\\u00e1ci m\\u011bli mo\\u017enost si vyzkou\\u0161et \\u201e\\u017eivotn\\u00ed cyklus\\u201c firmy od jej\\u00edho zalo\\u017een\\u00ed k\\u00a0jej\\u00edmu ukon\\u010den\\u00ed a zajist\\u00e9 si odnesli mnoho zku\\u0161enost\\u00ed do sv\\u00e9ho dal\\u0161\\u00edho p\\u016fsoben\\u00ed.<\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":587,\"asset_id\":718,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
