hor\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Nicolas Mor\\u00e1vek student 1. A studijn\\u00edho oboru Ekonomick\\u00e9 lyceum<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"padding-left: 60px;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2022\\/Nicolas.png\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2022\\/Nicolas.png\\\" width=\\\"640\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\"><strong>Nicolas Mor\\u00e1vek<\\/strong>\\u00a0student 1. A studijn\\u00edho oboru Ekonomick\\u00e9 lyceum, se<br \\/>z\\u00fa\\u010dastnil Konference o budoucnosti Evropy\\u00a0 na t\\u00e9ma\\u00a0 \\u201eKlima a zdrav\\u00ed\\u00a0 ve \\u0160trasburku\\u201c.<br \\/>Konference se \\u00fa\\u010dastnilo 200 lid\\u00ed ze v\\u0161ech \\u010dlensk\\u00fdch st\\u00e1t\\u016f EU. C\\u00edlem t\\u00e9to akce bylo zjistit n\\u00e1pady a n\\u00e1zory oby\\u010dejn\\u00fdch ob\\u010dan\\u016f a ty nejlep\\u0161\\u00ed pak p\\u0159edn\\u00e9st politik\\u016fm ve \\u0160trasburku.<br \\/>Nicolas byl vylosov\\u00e1n a stal se ambasadorem, kter\\u00fd bude tyto n\\u00e1zory prezentovat Evropsk\\u00e9mu parlamentu na konci \\u0159\\u00edjna.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">video: <a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.meps.sk\\/aktualne.php?v=3824\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" data-saferedirecturl=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/url?q=http:\\/\\/www.meps.sk\\/aktualne.php?v%3D3824&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1635873218892000&amp;usg=AFQjCNHHoqXnY6YWDTbG_uD9iAwsT_GVkA\\\">http:\\/\\/www.meps.sk\\/aktualne.<wbr \\/>php?v=3824<\\/a><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":705,\"asset_id\":836,\"ful