\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">T\\u00e9mata \\u0161kol UNESCO<br \\/><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><img src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2022\\/UNESCO.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"675\\\" \\/><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #222222; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\\\">T\\u00e9mata \\u0161kol UNESCO: 1) Svoboda tisku, 2) Pl\\u00fdtv\\u00e1n\\u00ed potravinami, 3) 100. v\\u00fdro\\u010d\\u00ed R.U.R.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":744,\"asset_id\":875,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('754', 'com_content.article.745', '', '2026-09-10 22:18:58', '140', '4627', 'a4a30fb3e1eb71947085e2a31c64433ac32a6e8e', '{\"title\":\"ERASMUS+ Malta\\/Gozo - \\u017e\\u00e1kovsk\\u00e9 mobility\",\"alias\":\"erasmus-malta-gozo-zakovske-mobility\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2022-05-24 19:25:00\",\"publish_up\":\"2022-05-24 19:25:00\",\"ordering\":175,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":false,\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":false,\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":false,\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">ERASMUS+ Malta\\/Gozo - \\u017e\\u00e1kovsk\\u00e9 mobility<br \\/><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2022\\/Malta\\/1.jpg\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><img src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2022\\/Malta\\/1.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" \\/><\\/span><\\/a><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2022\\/Malta\\/2.jpg\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><img src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2022\\/Malta\\/2.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" \\/><\\/span><\\/a><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2022\\/Malta\\/3.jpg\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><img src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2022\\/Malta\\/3.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" \\/><\\/span><\\/a><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">Minul\\u00fd t\\u00fdden jsme se \\u00fa\\u010dastnili projektu Erasmus + na ostrov\\u011b Gozo, kter\\u00fd se nach\\u00e1z\\u00ed na Malt\\u011b. Spole\\u010dn\\u011b se z\\u00e1stupci ze \\u0160pan\\u011blska a dom\\u00e1c\\u00edch u\\u010ditel\\u016f a \\u017e\\u00e1k\\u016f z\\u00a0Malty. Cel\\u00fd program prob\\u00edhal podle pl\\u00e1nu. M\\u011bli jsme mo\\u017enost nahl\\u00e9dnout do hodin v\\u00fduky, ochutnat m\\u00edstn\\u00ed speciality a hlavn\\u011b poznat m\\u00edstn\\u00ed kulturu, pam\\u00e1tky.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">Vzhledem k\\u00a0tomu, \\u017ee n\\u00e1m po\\u010das\\u00ed p\\u0159\\u00e1lo, tak jsme nav\\u0161t\\u00edvili m\\u00edstn\\u00ed pl\\u00e1\\u017ee. N\\u00e1sledn\\u011b jsme lod\\u00ed cestovali kolem ostrova. Dal\\u0161\\u00ed dny jsme nav\\u0161t\\u00edvili hlavn\\u00ed m\\u011bsto Malty Valletu, citadelu ve Victorii.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">Na z\\u00e1v\\u011br \\u017e\\u00e1ci odprezentovali se sv\\u00fdmi kolegy z\\u00a0ciziny zadan\\u00e9 t\\u00e9ma, kter\\u00e9 se t\\u00fdkalo n\\u00e1rodn\\u00edch jazyk\\u016f pr\\u00e1v\\u011b \\u010cesk\\u00e9 republiky, Malty a \\u0160pan\\u011blska. Cel\\u00e1 akce byla velmi zda\\u0159il\\u00e1 a v\\u0161ichni jsme si ji u\\u017eili.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #222222; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\\\">Mgr. Martin C\\u00f6ger<br \\/><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":745,\"asset_id\":876,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
