('761', 'com_content.article.752', '', '2026-09-10 22:19:06', '140', '4876', 'f8d067a147150f7fdde1a58594f552c7ca289c0c', '{\"title\":\"Sout\\u011b\\u017e ve finan\\u010dn\\u00ed gramotnosti \\u2013 celost\\u00e1tn\\u00ed kolo\",\"alias\":\"soutez-ve-financni-gramotnosti-celostatni-kolo\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2022-05-15 16:35:05\",\"publish_up\":\"2022-05-15 16:35:05\",\"ordering\":177,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":false,\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":false,\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":false,\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Sout\\u011b\\u017e ve finan\\u010dn\\u00ed gramotnosti \\u2013 celost\\u00e1tn\\u00ed kolo<br \\/><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2022\\/FG.jpg\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><img src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2022\\/FG.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"768\\\" \\/><\\/span><\\/a><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>V\\u00a0p\\u00e1tek 29. dubna jsme se z\\u00fa\\u010dastnili celost\\u00e1tn\\u00edho kola sout\\u011b\\u017ee Finan\\u010dn\\u00ed gramotnosti. Do 11. ro\\u010dn\\u00edku sout\\u011b\\u017ee se zapojilo t\\u00e9m\\u011b\\u0159 21 tis\\u00edc \\u017e\\u00e1k\\u016f z\\u00a0325 \\u0161kol z\\u00a0cel\\u00e9 \\u010cesk\\u00e9 republiky. Nejd\\u0159\\u00edve jsme se zapojili do \\u0161koln\\u00edho kola, kde jsme, tedy <strong>Denisa Krej\\u010dov\\u00e1 <\\/strong>(2. ro\\u010dn\\u00edk ekonomick\\u00e9 lyceum),<strong> Jakub Jane\\u010dek a Vojt\\u011bch \\u017delezo <\\/strong>(2. ro\\u010dn\\u00edk sportovn\\u00ed management), z\\u00edskali ka\\u017ed\\u00fd kolem 20 bod\\u016f z\\u00a0mo\\u017en\\u00fdch 25. Postoupili jsme do okresn\\u00edho kola, kde se z\\u00a0n\\u00e1s stal troj\\u010dlenn\\u00fd t\\u00fdm, kter\\u00fd spole\\u010dn\\u011b pracoval na dal\\u0161\\u00edm testu. A\\u010dkoliv jsme neusp\\u011bli tak dob\\u0159e jako ve \\u0161koln\\u00edm kole, postoupili jsme d\\u00e1l, a to do krajsk\\u00e9ho kola. To u\\u017e bylo rozd\\u011blen\\u00e9 na 2 \\u010d\\u00e1sti, testovou a na tvorbu prezentace, kde jsme si museli vymyslet spole\\u010dnost s. r. o., jej\\u00ed funguj\\u00edc\\u00ed ekonomiku a dal\\u0161\\u00ed. Spole\\u010dn\\u011b jsme vymysleli t\\u00e9ma vysok\\u00e9 \\u0161koly, kter\\u00e9 se p\\u0159i prezentov\\u00e1n\\u00ed komisi velmi l\\u00edbilo.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Do celost\\u00e1tn\\u00edho kola jsme se dostali s\\u00a0n\\u00e1skokem t\\u00e9m\\u011b\\u0159 35 bod\\u016f. Konalo se v\\u00a0p\\u00e1tek 29. dubna v\\u00a0prostor\\u00e1ch \\u010cesk\\u00e9 n\\u00e1rodn\\u00ed banky, kde se se\\u0161lo celkem 14 t\\u00fdm\\u016f, jeden z\\u00a0ka\\u017ed\\u00e9ho kraje. Zad\\u00e1n\\u00edm bylo p\\u0159esv\\u011bd\\u010dit investora k\\u00a0investov\\u00e1n\\u00ed do na\\u0161\\u00ed spole\\u010dnosti, kterou jsme vytvo\\u0159ili v\\u00a0p\\u0159edchoz\\u00edm krajsk\\u00e9m kole. \\u00dakol n\\u00e1m nep\\u0159i\\u0161el slo\\u017eit\\u00fd a b\\u011bhem zadan\\u00e9 p\\u016flhodiny jsme nenarazili na \\u017e\\u00e1dn\\u00fd probl\\u00e9m.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Mezit\\u00edm co komise hodnotila na\\u0161e pr\\u00e1ce, z\\u00fa\\u010dastnili jsme se kr\\u00e1tk\\u00e9 prohl\\u00eddky \\u010cNB, kde si v\\u0161ichni mimo jin\\u00e9 mohli i pot\\u011b\\u017ekat zlatou cihlu. Pot\\u00e9 komise vyhodnotila prvn\\u00edch p\\u011bt m\\u00edst, kter\\u00fdm byly polo\\u017eeny ot\\u00e1zky a podle nich ur\\u010deno fin\\u00e1lov\\u00e9 po\\u0159ad\\u00ed.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>A\\u010dkoliv jsme mezi prvn\\u00edch p\\u011bt t\\u00fdm\\u016f nedostali, bereme celou sout\\u011b\\u017e jako velkou zku\\u0161enost a \\u00fasp\\u011bch. P\\u0159\\u00ed\\u0161t\\u00ed rok to r\\u00e1di zkus\\u00edme znovu.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Denisa Krej\\u010dov\\u00e1<\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":752,\"asset_id\":883,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('762', 'com_content.article.753', '', '2026-09-10 22:19:07', '140', '3718', '25e7a98a04f6eeb6da57a3a7473a3c39c4d0f7c9', '{\"title\":\"Exkurze \\u010cSOB\",\"alias\":\"exkurze-csob-2\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2022-05-15 16:49:28\",\"publish_up\":\"2022-05-15 16:49:28\",\"ordering\":176,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":false,\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":false,\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":false,\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Exkurze \\u010cSOB<br \\/><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2022\\/CSOB.jpg\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><img src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2022\\/CSOB.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"768\\\" \\/><\\/span><\\/a><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>V\\u00a0r\\u00e1mci p\\u0159edm\\u011btu ekonomika a \\u00fa\\u010detnictv\\u00ed jsme se vydali se studenty t\\u0159et\\u00edho ro\\u010dn\\u00edku na exkurzi do N\\u00e1chodsk\\u00e9 pobo\\u010dky \\u010cSOB, jej\\u00ed\\u017e sou\\u010d\\u00e1st\\u00ed je i call centrum.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u017d\\u00e1ci m\\u011bli tak jedine\\u010dnou p\\u0159\\u00edle\\u017eitost vid\\u011bt prostory, kam se v\\u011bt\\u0161ina z\\u00a0nich zat\\u00edm nepod\\u00edvala. Nav\\u0161t\\u00edvili jsme prostory s\\u00a0bezpe\\u010dnostn\\u00edmi schr\\u00e1nkami, speci\\u00e1ln\\u00ed m\\u00edstnosti, kde prob\\u00edhaj\\u00ed finan\\u010dn\\u00ed vklady a v\\u00fdb\\u011bry vy\\u0161\\u0161\\u00edch obnos\\u016f v\\u00a0hotovosti.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Na\\u0161i pr\\u016fvodci n\\u00e1s pot\\u00e9 provedli jednotliv\\u00fdmi odd\\u011blen\\u00edmi banky, vysv\\u011btlili n\\u00e1m, jak\\u00e9 jsou kl\\u00ed\\u010de pro d\\u011blen\\u00ed klient\\u016f. Zaj\\u00edmav\\u00e9 byly ur\\u010dit\\u011b informace o fale\\u0161n\\u00fdch bankovk\\u00e1ch a stahov\\u00e1n\\u00ed star\\u0161\\u00edch bankovek z\\u00a0ob\\u011bhu.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Exkurze pokra\\u010dovala v\\u00a0zasedac\\u00ed m\\u00edstnosti, kde byla \\u017e\\u00e1k\\u016fm p\\u0159edstavena cel\\u00e1 skupina spole\\u010dnost\\u00ed spolupracuj\\u00edc\\u00ed s\\u00a0\\u010cSOB a ve\\u0161ker\\u00e9 produkty, kter\\u00e9 nab\\u00edz\\u00ed. Nap\\u0159\\u00edklad informace o platebn\\u00edch kart\\u00e1ch, jejich v\\u00fdhod\\u00e1ch apod.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u017d\\u00e1ci tak mohli z\\u00edskat \\u0159adu nov\\u00fdch informac\\u00ed, kter\\u00e9 budou moci vyu\\u017e\\u00edt jak p\\u0159i studiu, tak v\\u00a0osobn\\u00edm \\u017eivot\\u011b.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Ing. Aneta Hrub\\u00e1<\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":753,\"asset_id\":884,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('763', 'com_content.article.754', '', '2026-09-10 22:19:08', '140', '4085', 'f6d909d56706a261c666f3010bafe03afa6d38d2', '{\"title\":\"Sportovn\\u00ed kurz 3.A\",\"alias\":\"sportovniho-kurz-3-a\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2023-10-11 18:39:31\",\"publish_up\":\"2023-10-11 18:39:31\",\"ordering\":124,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":false,\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":false,\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":false,\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Sportovn\\u00ed kurz 3.A<br \\/><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/3.A_Kurz\\/3.A_Sport_1.jpg\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/3.A_Kurz\\/3.A_Sport_1.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"600\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Ve dnech 20.-22.9.2023 se na\\u0161e t\\u0159\\u00edda 3.A z\\u00fa\\u010dastnila sportovn\\u00edho kurzu, kter\\u00fd byl z\\u00e1rove\\u0148 kurz cyklistick\\u00fd. Ve st\\u0159edu r\\u00e1no jsme se vydali na kolech do Havlovic, kde jsme byli ubytov\\u00e1ni. Po p\\u0159\\u00edjezdu n\\u00e1s pan\\u00ed kucha\\u0159ky v m\\u00edstn\\u00ed \\u0161kolce poctily vynikaj\\u00edc\\u00edm ob\\u011bdem a hned n\\u00e1sledovala sportovn\\u00ed z\\u00e1bava pod odborn\\u00fdm dohledem pana u\\u010ditele Vrabce a pan\\u00ed u\\u010ditelky P\\u00e1\\u0161mov\\u00e9. N\\u011bkte\\u0159\\u00ed z n\\u00e1s se vydali na prohl\\u00eddku are\\u00e1lu na kolob\\u011b\\u017ek\\u00e1ch, nebo vymysleli profesion\\u00e1ln\\u00ed souboj v tenise. Av\\u0161ak v\\u0161ichni dohromady jsme odehr\\u00e1li z\\u00e1pas v softballu a nau\\u010dili se jeho pravidla.<br \\/> <br \\/> Dal\\u0161\\u00ed den jsme se vydali autobusem do Pece pod Sn\\u011b\\u017ekou a lanovkou na R\\u016f\\u017eovou horu, odkud jsme vystoupali a\\u017e na samotnou Sn\\u011b\\u017eku. Zde jsme po\\u0159\\u00eddili kr\\u00e1sn\\u00e9 fotografie, pokochali se v\\u00fdhledem a n\\u00e1sledn\\u011b zdolali zapeklitou zp\\u00e1te\\u010dn\\u00ed cestu. Mnoh\\u00fdm z n\\u00e1s dala tato t\\u00fara velice zabrat. Ale p\\u0159esto nelitujeme ani minuty. Tento den byl n\\u00e1ro\\u010dn\\u00fd, ale i tak ho n\\u011bkte\\u0159\\u00ed z n\\u00e1s zakon\\u010dili turnajem na na\\u0161\\u00ed ubytovn\\u011b ve stoln\\u00edm tenise.<br \\/> <br \\/> T\\u0159et\\u00ed a posledn\\u00ed den sportovn\\u00edho kurzu jsme po vydatn\\u00e9 sn\\u00eddani vyrazili zp\\u011bt na kolech do N\\u00e1choda.<br \\/> Tato v\\u00fdprava se i p\\u0159es pochyby velice vyda\\u0159ila a t\\u011b\\u0161\\u00edme se na dal\\u0161\\u00ed podobn\\u00e9 akce.<br \\/> <br \\/> Za 3.A Vav\\u0159enov\\u00e1 Tereza<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/3.A_Kurz\\/3.A_Sport_2.jpg\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/3.A_Kurz\\/3.A_Sport_2.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"600\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":754,\"asset_id\":885,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('764', 'com_content.article.755', '', '2026-09-10 22:19:09', '140', '3753', '4fe751e346cb8baa86eaaec1c46d7df02facd5d9', '{\"title\":\"Stubai 2024\",\"alias\":\"stubai-2024\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2024-01-20 21:21:34\",\"publish_up\":\"2024-01-20 21:21:34\",\"ordering\":113,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":false,\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":false,\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":false,\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Stubai 2024<br \\/><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/Stubai\\/Stubai_1.jpg\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/Stubai\\/Stubai_1.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"600\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/Stubai\\/Stubai.jpg\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/Stubai\\/Stubai.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"600\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Ve dnech 8. - 13.1. 2024 jsme vyrazili do rakousk\\u00fdch alp. Ubytov\\u00e1ni jsme byli v kr\\u00e1sn\\u00e9m penzionu Landhuas Birgit v men\\u0161\\u00edm m\\u011bste\\u010dku Telfes im Stubai.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Hned v \\u00fater\\u00fd a ve st\\u0159edu jsme jeli ly\\u017eovat na ledovec Stubai, kde na n\\u00e1s \\u010dekalo kr\\u00e1sn\\u00e9 po\\u010das\\u00ed. Jak \\u0159\\u00edk\\u00e1 pan u\\u010ditel Chmela\\u0159, tak po\\u010das\\u00ed m\\u00e1 ka\\u017ed\\u00fd takov\\u00e9, jak\\u00e9 si zaslou\\u017e\\u00ed. Tyto dva dny n\\u00e1s trochu vy\\u010derpaly, a proto jsme ve \\u010dtvrtek vyrazili do men\\u0161\\u00edho st\\u0159ediska Steinach. I p\\u0159esto, \\u017ee st\\u0159edisko je men\\u0161\\u00ed, tak jsme si tam ly\\u017eov\\u00e1n\\u00ed u\\u017eili na jedni\\u010dku. Posledn\\u00ed den ly\\u017eov\\u00e1n\\u00ed jsme byli bl\\u00edzko na\\u0161eho ubytov\\u00e1n\\u00ed, ve st\\u0159edisku Schlick 2000. T\\u00edm, \\u017ee to byl posledn\\u00ed den, tak jsme si ho cht\\u011bli u\\u017e\\u00edt na 100 %. A tak se i stalo.\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>V sobotu r\\u00e1no jsme se u\\u017e vydali na cestu dom\\u016f, v\\u0161ichni smutn\\u00ed, \\u017ee se mus\\u00edme vr\\u00e1tit do \\u0161koly za testy, kter\\u00e9 tam na n\\u00e1s cel\\u00fd t\\u00fdden \\u010dekaly.\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Jsme r\\u00e1di, \\u017ee se nikomu nic nestalo (pokud nepo\\u010d\\u00edt\\u00e1me mod\\u0159iny). Cel\\u00fd z\\u00e1jezd si ka\\u017ed\\u00fd moc u\\u017eil a u\\u017e se t\\u011b\\u0161\\u00edme na p\\u0159\\u00ed\\u0161t\\u00ed rok.<\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":755,\"asset_id\":886,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
