lign: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">JA firmy<br \\/><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2022\\/JAfirmy.jpg\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><img src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2022\\/JAfirmy.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" \\/><\\/span><\\/a><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Studenti 3.ro\\u010dn\\u00edku si i v tomto roce vyzkou\\u0161eli, jak\\u00e9 to je usp\\u011bt s vlastn\\u00ed studentskou firmou. V\\u00fdsledky sv\\u00e9ho sna\\u017een\\u00ed a sv\\u00e9 z\\u00edskan\\u00e9 zku\\u0161enosti obhajovali na konci dubna p\\u0159ed porotou, jej\\u00ed\\u017e \\u010dlenov\\u00e9 se podnik\\u00e1n\\u00ed dlouh\\u00e1 l\\u00e9ta \\u00fasp\\u011b\\u0161n\\u011b v\\u011bnuj\\u00ed.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":758,\"asset_id\":889,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('768', 'com_content.article.759', '', '2026-09-10 22:19:13', '140', '3962', '7f7b84ff184f0e3d00f685ded2d16f9341fd25e0', '{\"title\":\"Kate\\u0159ina Jel\\u00ednkov\\u00e1 3.B - \\u00fasp\\u011bch v n\\u00e1rodn\\u00ed v\\u00fdtvarn\\u00e9 sout\\u011b\\u017ei \\u201eSv\\u011btov\\u00e9 d\\u011bdictv\\u00ed UNESCO\\\" \",\"alias\":\"katerina-jelinkova-3-b-uspech-v-narodni-vytvarne-soutezi-svetove-dedictvi-unesco\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2022-06-13 19:01:50\",\"publish_up\":\"2022-06-13 19:01:50\",\"ordering\":171,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":false,\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":false,\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":false,\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Kate\\u0159ina Jel\\u00ednkov\\u00e1 3.B - \\u00fasp\\u011bch v n\\u00e1rodn\\u00ed v\\u00fdtvarn\\u00e9 sout\\u011b\\u017ei \\u201eSv\\u011btov\\u00e9 d\\u011bdictv\\u00ed UNESCO\\\" <br \\/><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2022\\/Jelinkova.jpg\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><img src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2022\\/Jelinkova.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" \\/><\\/span><\\/a><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Na\\u0161e studentka t\\u0159et\\u00edho ro\\u010dn\\u00edku K\\u00e1\\u0165a Jel\\u00ednkov\\u00e1 se z\\u00fa\\u010dastnila v\\u00fdtvarn\\u00e9 sout\\u011b\\u017ee \\u201eSv\\u011btov\\u00e9 d\\u011bdictv\\u00ed UNESCO \\u2013 Praha, \\u010cesk\\u00fd Krumlov a Tel\\u010d\\u201c, kterou po\\u0159\\u00e1dal Sekretari\\u00e1t \\u010cesk\\u00e9 komise pro UNESCO ve spolupr\\u00e1ci s Velvyslanectv\\u00edm \\u010cR v Pa\\u0159\\u00ed\\u017ei a pa\\u0159\\u00ed\\u017eskou pobo\\u010dkou agentury CzechTourism u p\\u0159\\u00edle\\u017eitosti leto\\u0161n\\u00edho v\\u00fdro\\u010d\\u00ed 30 let zaps\\u00e1n\\u00ed historick\\u00fdch center m\\u011bst Prahy, \\u010cesk\\u00e9ho Krumlova a Tel\\u010de do Seznamu sv\\u011btov\\u00e9ho kulturn\\u00edho a p\\u0159\\u00edrodn\\u00edho d\\u011bdictv\\u00ed UNESCO. Do sout\\u011b\\u017ee se p\\u0159ihl\\u00e1silo zhruba 300 uchaze\\u010d\\u016f z cel\\u00e9 \\u010cesk\\u00e9 republiky. Porota vybrala jeden\\u00e1ct v\\u00edt\\u011bz\\u016f, u kter\\u00fdch se rozhodla neur\\u010dovat po\\u0159ad\\u00ed, a pr\\u00e1v\\u011b K\\u00e1\\u0165a byla mezi t\\u011bmito jeden\\u00e1cti nejlep\\u0161\\u00edmi. V p\\u00e1tek 3. \\u010dervna prob\\u011bhlo slavnostn\\u00ed p\\u0159ed\\u00e1n\\u00ed ocen\\u011bn\\u00ed v s\\u00eddle Sekretari\\u00e1tu \\u010cesk\\u00e9 komise pro UNESCO, v prostor\\u00e1ch Ministerstva zahrani\\u010dn\\u00edch v\\u011bc\\u00ed Praze.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>K\\u00e1t\\u011b velice gratulujeme a p\\u0159ejeme mnoho dal\\u0161\\u00edch \\u00fasp\\u011bch\\u016f!<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":759,\"asset_id\":890,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('769', 'com_content.article.760', '', '2026-09-10 22:19:14', '140', '3159', 'e2af0ddd8c4dbf9c9e75bb447009b12eea9a8916', '{\"title\":\"Exkurze 3. ro\\u010dn\\u00edku do \\u010cNB v Praze\",\"alias\":\"exkurze-3-rocniku-do-cnb-v-praze\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2022-06-21 18:30:23\",\"publish_up\":\"2022-06-21 18:30:23\",\"ordering\":170,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":false,\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":false,\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":false,\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Exkurze 3. ro\\u010dn\\u00edku do \\u010cNB v Praze<br \\/><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2022\\/CNB\\/1_postcard.jpg\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><img src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2022\\/CNB\\/1_postcard.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" \\/><\\/span><\\/a><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Ve \\u010dtvrtek 2.6.2022 nav\\u0161t\\u00edvili \\u017e\\u00e1ci 3. ro\\u010dn\\u00edku \\u010ceskou n\\u00e1rodn\\u00ed banku v Praze. Sezn\\u00e1mili se s\\u00a0histori\\u00ed banky, se stavbou historick\\u00e9 budovy. M\\u011bli mo\\u017enost vid\\u011bt trezorov\\u00e9 dve\\u0159e, kter\\u00e9 z\\u00e1rove\\u0148 slou\\u017e\\u00ed jako vstup do expozice. Zde se sezn\\u00e1mili s histori\\u00ed m\\u011bny na \\u010desk\\u00e9m \\u00fazem\\u00ed a zkusili si obt\\u011b\\u017ekat cihly r\\u016fzn\\u00fdch materi\\u00e1l\\u016f, a to od d\\u0159ev\\u011bn\\u00e9 a\\u017e po zlatou 18 kg cihlu. D\\u00e1le vid\\u011bli ochrann\\u00e9 prvky, kter\\u00e9 se nach\\u00e1z\\u00ed na dne\\u0161n\\u00edch bankovk\\u00e1ch. Prohl\\u00eddka byla spolu s\\u00a0expozic\\u00ed p\\u0159\\u00ednosem do u\\u010diva o bankovnictv\\u00ed.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u0160\\u00e1rka Mat\\u011bj\\u016f a Daniela Mar\\u0161\\u00edkov\\u00e1<br \\/>\\u017d\\u00e1kyn\\u011b 3. B<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":760,\"asset_id\":891,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
