('781', 'com_content.article.772', '', '2026-09-10 22:19:24', '140', '3561', '9ca84b8a1e2d83556e5021d4728567c033e90b75', '{\"title\":\"Kulturn\\u011bhistorick\\u00e1 exkurze 3.B - Pardubice\",\"alias\":\"kulturnehistoricka-exkurze-3-b-pardubice\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2022-09-22 18:40:12\",\"publish_up\":\"2022-09-22 18:40:12\",\"ordering\":163,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":false,\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":false,\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":false,\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Kulturn\\u011bhistorick\\u00e1 exkurze 3.B - Pardubice<br \\/><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/Pardubice.jpg\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><img src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/Pardubice.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" \\/><\\/span><\\/a><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Dne 19.9. jsme vyrazili s\\u00a0panem u\\u010ditelem Tomkem a pan\\u00ed u\\u010ditelkou Hanzlovou do centra Pardubick\\u00e9ho kraje \\u2013 do Pardubic. Nejprve jsme nav\\u0161t\\u00edvili atomov\\u00fd kryt s\\u00a0p\\u016fvodn\\u00edm autentick\\u00fdm vybaven\\u00edm. Vyzkou\\u0161eli jsme si pr\\u00e1ci telefonisty, manu\\u00e1ln\\u00ed pohon \\u010disti\\u010dky vzduchu i simulaci jadern\\u00e9ho \\u00fatoku imperialist\\u016f na Pardubice. Po velmi zaj\\u00edmav\\u00e9 prohl\\u00eddce jsme se p\\u0159esunuli na n\\u00e1dvo\\u0159\\u00ed pardubick\\u00e9ho z\\u00e1mku, kde n\\u00e1s pobavili velmi p\\u0159\\u00edtuln\\u00ed p\\u00e1vi. N\\u00e1sledn\\u011b jsme se z\\u00fa\\u010dastnili expozice Lid\\u00e9 od vedle, kde jsme si mohli vyzkou\\u0161et \\u017eivot s\\u00a0t\\u011blesn\\u00fdm posti\\u017een\\u00edm. Pot\\u00e9 n\\u00e1sledoval rozchod po Pardubic\\u00edch, kter\\u00fd jsme v\\u0161ichni vyu\\u017eili podle sebe. N\\u011bkdo vymetal n\\u00e1kupn\\u00ed centra, jin\\u00fd zase antikvari\\u00e1ty. Z\\u00a0Pardubic jsme si p\\u0159ivezli nejen z\\u00e1\\u017eitky, ale i v\\u011bcn\\u00e9 suven\\u00fdry. N\\u011bkdo oble\\u010den\\u00ed, jin\\u00fd bustu v\\u00fdznamn\\u00e9ho dikt\\u00e1tora.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>N\\u00e1v\\u0161t\\u011bva Pardubic se n\\u00e1m velice l\\u00edbila a t\\u011b\\u0161\\u00edme se na dal\\u0161\\u00ed v\\u00fdlety.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Mat\\u011bj Brou\\u010dek<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>p\\u0159edseda 3.B<\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":772,\"asset_id\":903,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('782', 'com_content.article.773', '', '2026-09-10 22:19:25', '140', '4167', '36c94e1cedfe6756cb8e86465eb2a4c1f9888a91', '{\"title\":\"Adapta\\u010dn\\u00ed pobyt 1.A\",\"alias\":\"adaptacni-pobyt-1-a\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2022-09-22 19:06:30\",\"publish_up\":\"2022-09-22 19:06:30\",\"ordering\":162,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":false,\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":false,\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":false,\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Adapta\\u010dn\\u00ed pobyt 1.A <br \\/><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/1.A_Adapt\\/1.A_1.jpg\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><img src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/1.A_Adapt\\/1.A_1.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" \\/><\\/span><\\/a><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>14.9. se \\u017e\\u00e1ci 1.A vydali na adapta\\u010dn\\u00ed pobyt na Zd\\u011b\\u0159inu. Po p\\u0159\\u00edjezdu jsme se ubytovali v chatk\\u00e1ch po 3-4 lidech. V\\u0161ichni si vybalili, zabydleli se a za\\u010dal program.<br \\/>Kv\\u016fli \\u0161patn\\u00e9mu po\\u010das\\u00ed jsme zvolili vnit\\u0159n\\u00ed aktivity, nejprve jsme hr\\u00e1li pantomimu a dal\\u0161\\u00ed spole\\u010densk\\u00e9 aktivity. Pozd\\u011bji jsme m\\u011bli ve\\u010de\\u0159i a po n\\u00ed sl\\u00edben\\u00fd voln\\u00fd \\u010das. <br \\/>Druh\\u00fd den po sn\\u00eddani jsme vyrazili na v\\u00fdlet na Osta\\u0161. Po v\\u00fd\\u0161lapu jsme si dali odpo\\u010dinek a zam\\u00ed\\u0159ili na Ko\\u010di\\u010d\\u00ed hrad. N\\u00e1sledoval zaslou\\u017een\\u00fd ob\\u011bd, po kter\\u00e9m jsme vyrazili na \\u0161ipkovanou.<br \\/>Chodili jsme po skupink\\u00e1ch a sna\\u017eili se spr\\u00e1vn\\u011b odpov\\u011bd\\u011bt na ot\\u00e1zky t\\u00fdkaj\\u00edc\\u00ed se na\\u0161eho v\\u00fdletu.<br \\/>Po n\\u00e1ro\\u010dn\\u00e9 t\\u00fa\\u0159e jsme chv\\u00edli odpo\\u010d\\u00edvali a n\\u00e1sledoval dal\\u0161\\u00ed program. Hr\\u00e1li jsme r\\u016fzn\\u00e9 teambuildingov\\u00e9 hry. Tak\\u00e9 jsme si vytv\\u00e1\\u0159eli t\\u0159\\u00eddn\\u00ed vlajku, kde jsme na pl\\u00e1tno obtiskli na\\u0161e ruce. <br \\/>Kdy\\u017e se setm\\u011blo, zalo\\u017eili jsme t\\u00e1bor\\u00e1k, kde pozd\\u011bji bylo vyhodnocen\\u00ed pobytu a nesm\\u011bla chyb\\u011bt ani kytara a p\\u00edsni\\u010dky.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Mysl\\u00edm si, \\u017ee jsme si to v\\u0161ichni u\\u017eili a ur\\u010dit\\u011b se v\\u00edce sezn\\u00e1mili.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Nikol Hospod\\u00e1\\u0159ov\\u00e1, 1.A<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/1.A_Adapt\\/1.A_2.jpg\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/1.A_Adapt\\/1.A_2.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/1.A_Adapt\\/1.A_3.jpg\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/1.A_Adapt\\/1.A_3.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":773,\"asset_id\":904,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
