('785', 'com_content.article.776', '', '2026-09-10 22:19:27', '140', '4724', '2768d32f00edb7b203806f6dcf0bb33aed3cf7e1', '{\"title\":\"Adapta\\u010dn\\u00ed kurz 1.B \",\"alias\":\"adaptacni-kurz-1-b\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2022-09-28 16:02:59\",\"publish_up\":\"2022-09-28 16:02:59\",\"ordering\":160,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":false,\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":false,\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":false,\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Adapta\\u010dn\\u00ed kurz 1.B <br \\/><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/1.B_Adapt\\/1.jpg\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><img src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/1.B_Adapt\\/1.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" \\/><\\/span><\\/a><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: left; padding-left: 60px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">Dne 12.9. jsme vlakem odjeli do \\u017d\\u010f\\u00e1ru nad Metuj\\u00ed. Ne\\u017e jsme do\\u0161li na Zd\\u011b\\u0159inu, kam se n\\u00e1m n\\u011bkter\\u00fdm cht\\u011blo v\\u00edc ne\\u017e-li pokra\\u010dovat do kopce, vyrazili jsme na Osta\\u0161. A i p\\u0159esto, \\u017ee ne v\\u0161ichni se dostali a\\u017e nahoru, jsme m\\u011bli kr\\u00e1sn\\u00fd v\\u00fdhled. V poledne jsme se ubytovali do chatek a \\u010dekali na dal\\u0161\\u00ed program dne. Za ne dlouho za\\u010dala na\\u0161e prvn\\u00ed \\u201cseznamovac\\u00ed\\u201d hra. Byli jsme rozd\\u011bleni do \\u0161esti t\\u00fdm\\u016f. Nejprve jsme dostali 6 r\\u016fzn\\u00fdch karet, ka\\u017ed\\u00e1 zaj\\u00edmav\\u011bj\\u0161\\u00ed ne\\u017e druh\\u00e1. O jedn\\u00e9 kart\\u011b jsme m\\u011bli vypr\\u00e1v\\u011bt p\\u0159\\u00edb\\u011bh a ostatn\\u00ed t\\u00fdmy uhodnout o jakou kartu se jedn\\u00e1. Druh\\u00e1 hra, kterou moc lid\\u00ed ze za\\u010d\\u00e1tku nech\\u00e1pali, byla o u\\u010ditelce Hanzlov\\u00e9. Ta n\\u00e1m na za\\u010d\\u00e1tku \\u0159ekla, \\u017ee vezme na trh do m\\u011bsta Bezi Bezo jen n\\u011bkter\\u00e9 z n\\u00e1s. Z\\u00e1le\\u017eelo na tom, co bychom si zde koupili. Hned p\\u0159i prvn\\u00edm kole odpadlo spousta lid\\u00ed. Hra m\\u011bla jen jedno pravidlo, ne\\u0159\\u00edct slovo kter\\u00e9 obsahuje \\u201ci\\u201d nebo \\u201co\\u201d. Na konec hry se dostalo jen m\\u00e1lo z n\\u00e1s. Posledn\\u00ed hra byla pantomima. Z n\\u011bkter\\u00fdch z n\\u00e1s se stali oprav\\u00e1\\u0159i aut, kucha\\u0159i, \\u010di dokonce i vysava\\u010d. Druh\\u00fd den na\\u0161eho kurzu jsme se vydali na Hv\\u011bzdu, neboli kapli Panny Marie Sn\\u011b\\u017en\\u00e9. Cesta byla dlouh\\u00e1 a ani se n\\u00e1m nepoda\\u0159ilo doj\\u00edt a\\u017e do konce. Zabloudili jsme. Tud\\u00ed\\u017e jsme byli zp\\u00e1tky rychleji, ne\\u017e jsme \\u010dekali. Ale popravd\\u011b \\u0159e\\u010deno, nikomu to zas tak nevadilo. Ve\\u010der jsme si ud\\u011blali t\\u00e1bor\\u00e1k a pou\\u0161t\\u011bli jsme si t\\u00e1borov\\u00e9 p\\u00edsn\\u011b. V den odjezdu jsme si zvolili p\\u0159edsedu a m\\u00edstop\\u0159edsedu t\\u0159\\u00eddy. Sice n\\u00e1m za\\u010dalo v polovin\\u011b cesty na n\\u00e1dra\\u017e\\u00ed pr\\u0161et, ale i p\\u0159esto jsme se dostali v po\\u0159\\u00e1dku zp\\u00e1tky do N\\u00e1choda.<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/1.B_Adapt\\/2.jpg\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><img src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/1.B_Adapt\\/2.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"671\\\" \\/><\\/span><\\/a><\\/span><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":776,\"asset_id\":907,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('786', 'com_content.article.777', '', '2026-09-10 22:19:28', '140', '4101', 'f7e76b4803b7973d34d5d62413d563ffae220e3c', '{\"title\":\"\\u00da\\u010dast na 28. zased\\u00e1n\\u00ed Valn\\u00e9ho shrom\\u00e1\\u017ed\\u011bn\\u00ed S\\u00edt\\u011b p\\u0159idru\\u017een\\u00fdch \\u0161kol UNESCO \\u2013 Liberec 19.\\u201320. z\\u00e1\\u0159\\u00ed 2022\",\"alias\":\"ucast-na-28-zasedani-valneho-shromazdeni-site-pridruzenych-skol-unesco-liberec-19-20-zari-2022\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2022-09-28 16:05:30\",\"publish_up\":\"2022-09-28 16:05:30\",\"ordering\":159,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":false,\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":false,\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":false,\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">\\u00da\\u010dast na 28. zased\\u00e1n\\u00ed Valn\\u00e9ho shrom\\u00e1\\u017ed\\u011bn\\u00ed S\\u00edt\\u011b p\\u0159idru\\u017een\\u00fdch \\u0161kol UNESCO \\u2013 Liberec 19.\\u201320. z\\u00e1\\u0159\\u00ed 2022<br \\/><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/Unesco_Liberec.jpg\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><img src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/Unesco_Liberec.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" \\/><\\/span><\\/a><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Z\\u00e1stupci na\\u0161\\u00ed \\u0161koly Mgr. Dana Jarol\\u00edmov\\u00e1 \\u0159editelka \\u0161koly a \\u0160\\u00e1rka\\u00a0Rudolfov\\u00e1 asistentka \\u0159editelky se\\u00a0 ve dnech 19. a 20. z\\u00e1\\u0159\\u00ed 2022 z\\u00fa\\u010dastnili 28. zased\\u00e1n\\u00ed Valn\\u00e9ho shrom\\u00e1\\u017ed\\u011bn\\u00ed S\\u00edt\\u011b p\\u0159idru\\u017een\\u00fdch \\u0161kol UNESCO\\u00a0v Liberci.\\u00a0 C\\u00edlem t\\u00e9to ka\\u017edoro\\u010dn\\u00ed akce je\\u00a0vyhodnocen\\u00ed \\u010dinnosti \\u010dlensk\\u00fdch \\u0161kol za uplynul\\u00fd \\u0161koln\\u00ed rok, projedn\\u00e1n\\u00ed tematick\\u00fdch priorit na n\\u00e1sleduj\\u00edc\\u00ed obdob\\u00ed, a tak\\u00e9 vz\\u00e1jemn\\u00e1 v\\u00fdm\\u011bna zku\\u0161enost\\u00ed a informac\\u00ed. ACADEMIA MERCURII je \\u010dlenskou \\u0161kolou UNESCO ji\\u017e od roku 2001.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><strong style=\\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; font-family: \'Open Sans\', arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; margin: 0px; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; color: #404040; text-align: justify;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":777,\"asset_id\":908,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('787', 'com_content.article.778', '', '2026-09-10 22:19:28', '140', '5152', 'ff2eab772fee0d9a7f8b3fb58b8578871bae4d95', '{\"title\":\"Kulturn\\u011bhistorick\\u00e1 exkurze 3.B - Praha\",\"alias\":\"kulturnehistoricka-exkurze-3-b-praha\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2022-10-02 18:21:03\",\"publish_up\":\"2022-10-02 18:21:03\",\"ordering\":155,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":false,\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":false,\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":false,\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Kulturn\\u011bhistorick\\u00e1 exkurze 3.B - Praha<br \\/><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/3.B_Praha\\/1.jpg\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><img src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/3.B_Praha\\/1.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" \\/><\\/span><\\/a><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>V\\u00fdlet 3. B do Prahy<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>V\\u00a0\\u00fater\\u00fd 27. 9. 2022 jsme vyrazili s\\u00a0panem u\\u010ditelem Tomkem a pan\\u00ed u\\u010ditelkou Galbovou na v\\u00fdlet do na\\u0161eho hlavn\\u00edho m\\u011bsta \\u2013 do Prahy. Prvn\\u00edm bodem programu byl p\\u0159esun z\\u00a0hlavn\\u00edho n\\u00e1dra\\u017e\\u00ed tramvaj\\u00ed k\\u00a0lanovce na Pet\\u0159\\u00edn. I p\\u0159es nep\\u0159\\u00edli\\u0161 p\\u011bkn\\u00e9 po\\u010das\\u00ed byl z lanovky n\\u00e1dhern\\u00fd v\\u00fdhled na Hrad\\u010dany. Pod rozhlednou Pet\\u0159\\u00edn jsme nav\\u0161t\\u00edvili zrcadlov\\u00e9 bludi\\u0161t\\u011b a m\\u00edstnost s\\u00a0r\\u016fzn\\u011b zak\\u0159iven\\u00fdmi zrcadly, kter\\u00e1 n\\u00e1m poskytla p\\u0159\\u00edle\\u017eitost k\\u00a0po\\u0159\\u00edzen\\u00ed legra\\u010dn\\u00edch fotografi\\u00ed. Pak u\\u017e n\\u00e1sledoval v\\u00fdstup na samotnou rozhlednu. N\\u011bkolik z\\u00a0n\\u00e1s se kv\\u016fli nep\\u0159\\u00edzniv\\u00e9mu po\\u010das\\u00ed rozhodlo po\\u010dkat na ostatn\\u00ed dole pod rozhlednou. Zde jsme n\\u00e1sledn\\u011b po\\u0159\\u00eddili spole\\u010dnou fotografii a vyrazili jsme plnou parou kolem Strahovsk\\u00e9ho kl\\u00e1\\u0161tera k\\u00a0Pra\\u017esk\\u00e9mu hradu. Kdy\\u017e jsme vid\\u011bli frontu u kontroly, rozhodli jsme se, \\u017ee si hrad prohl\\u00e9dneme rad\\u011bji zpoza plotu. Dal\\u0161\\u00edm c\\u00edlem bylo Starom\\u011bstsk\\u00e9 n\\u00e1m\\u011bst\\u00ed. M\\u011bli jsme \\u0161t\\u011bst\\u00ed a vid\\u011bli jsme Starom\\u011bstsk\\u00fd orloj ve 13. hodin v\\u00a0pln\\u00e9 kr\\u00e1se. N\\u00e1sledoval p\\u0159esun na V\\u00e1clavsk\\u00e9 n\\u00e1m\\u011bst\\u00ed, kde n\\u00e1s \\u010dekal rozchod. Ten jsme ka\\u017ed\\u00fd vyu\\u017eili dle sv\\u00e9ho uv\\u00e1\\u017een\\u00ed. K\\u00a0na\\u0161\\u00ed velk\\u00e9 radosti si tentokr\\u00e1te nikdo bustu dikt\\u00e1tora dom\\u016f neodvezl.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>I p\\u0159es de\\u0161tiv\\u00e9 po\\u010das\\u00ed se n\\u00e1m v\\u00fdlet velice l\\u00edbil a t\\u011b\\u0161\\u00edme se na dal\\u0161\\u00ed podobn\\u00e9 akce.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Mat\\u011bj Brou\\u010dek<br \\/> p\\u0159edseda 3. B<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/3.B_Praha\\/2.jpg\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/3.B_Praha\\/2.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><strong style=\\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; font-family: \'Open Sans\', arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; margin: 0px; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; color: #404040; text-align: justify;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":778,\"asset_id\":909,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('788', 'com_content.article.779', '', '2026-09-10 22:19:29', '140', '4449', 'bdf7532e8472787493019d183b15f922521bf098', '{\"title\":\"Ly\\u017ea\\u0159sk\\u00fd kurz 2023\",\"alias\":\"lyzarsky-kurz-2023\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2023-03-14 19:42:12\",\"publish_up\":\"2023-03-14 19:42:12\",\"ordering\":140,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":false,\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":false,\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":false,\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Ly\\u017ea\\u0159sk\\u00fd kurz 2023<br \\/><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/Lyz.kurz\\/1.JPG\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" \\/><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Dne 12.2. 2023 jsme spole\\u010dn\\u011b 2.A a 2.B vyrazili na ly\\u017ea\\u0159sk\\u00fd kurz do Zdobnice v Orlick\\u00fdch hor\\u00e1ch. Jel s n\\u00e1mi pan u\\u010ditel Sr\\u0161e\\u0148 mlad\\u0161\\u00ed, pan u\\u010ditel Vrabec a pan\\u00ed u\\u010ditelka \\u0160r\\u016ftkov\\u00e1. Okolo 17 hodiny jsme m\\u011bli sraz na chat\\u011b Hrade\\u010danka, kde jsme cel\\u00fd t\\u00fdden bydleli. Ka\\u017ed\\u00fd jsme se tam dopravili samostatn\\u011b, rozlou\\u010dili se s rodi\\u010di a za\\u010dali si u\\u017e\\u00edvat ly\\u017ea\\u0159sk\\u00fd kurz. V pond\\u011bl\\u00ed jsme odstartovali n\\u00e1\\u0161 ka\\u017edodenn\\u00ed ritu\\u00e1l. R\\u00e1no jsme vstali, \\u0161li jsme na sn\\u00eddani a od 9 hodin jsme \\u0161li ly\\u017eovat. Na p\\u0159\\u00e1n\\u00ed pana u\\u010ditele Vrabce jsme byli v\\u017edy prvn\\u00ed na svahu. Ly\\u017eovali jsme asi do 11:30 a pak jsme \\u0161li na ob\\u011bd. Po ob\\u011bd\\u011b n\\u00e1s \\u010dekal poledn\\u00ed klid a pak znovu ly\\u017eov\\u00e1n\\u00ed. Odpoledne n\\u00e1m rychle uteklo a u\\u017e jsme \\u0161li na ve\\u010de\\u0159i. Ka\\u017ed\\u00fd ve\\u010der jsme m\\u011bli kr\\u00e1tk\\u00e9 prezentace ohledn\\u011b ly\\u017eov\\u00e1n\\u00ed, kter\\u00e9 si pro n\\u00e1s p\\u0159ipravili studenti sportovn\\u00edho managementu a my se dozv\\u011bd\\u011bli spoustu nov\\u00fdch informac\\u00ed. Ka\\u017ed\\u00fd den byl pestr\\u00fd a sv\\u00fdm zp\\u016fsobem jinak zaj\\u00edmav\\u00fd. V p\\u00e1tek 17.2. 2023 jsme \\u0161li proch\\u00e1zkou vr\\u00e1tit ski pasy a balili si kufry dom\\u016f. Po ob\\u011bd\\u011b prob\\u011bhlo zhodnocen\\u00ed kurzu a odpoledne si pro n\\u00e1s jezdili nat\\u011b\\u0161en\\u00ed rodi\\u010de. Po\\u010das\\u00ed bylo p\\u011bkn\\u00e9 a m\\u011bli jsme i \\u0161t\\u011bst\\u00ed na sn\\u00edh. V\\u0161ichni se bu\\u010f zdokonalili nebo nau\\u010dili na snowboardu \\u010di ly\\u017e\\u00edch. Mysl\\u00edm si, \\u017ee ka\\u017ed\\u00fd si z \\u201ely\\u017e\\u00e1ku\\u201d p\\u0159ivezl spoustu vzpom\\u00ednek.<br \\/> <br \\/> Za t\\u0159\\u00eddu 2.B, Ag\\u00e1ta Hub\\u00e1lkov\\u00e1.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/Lyz.kurz\\/2.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" \\/><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/Lyz.kurz\\/3.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" \\/><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":779,\"asset_id\":910,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('789', 'com_content.article.780', '', '2026-09-10 22:19:30', '140', '2667', '9472be568db677e43e2888cb15ce5adc30916bf0', '{\"title\":\"Studentsk\\u00e9 firmy - akce \\\"sva\\u010dinky\\\"\",\"alias\":\"studentske-firmy-akce-svacinky\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2022-10-05 19:53:08\",\"publish_up\":\"2022-10-05 19:53:08\",\"ordering\":157,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":false,\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":false,\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":false,\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Studentsk\\u00e9 firmy - akce \\\"sva\\u010dinky\\\"<br \\/><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/svacinky.jpg\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/svacinky.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>A je to tady!!! V na\\u0161\\u00ed \\u0161kole se op\\u011bt konaj\\u00ed \\\"SVA\\u010cINKY\\\". Tentokr\\u00e1t si pro n\\u00e1s dobroty ke sva\\u010din\\u011b p\\u0159ipravili studenti t\\u0159et\\u00edho ro\\u010dn\\u00edku. V\\u0161e, co bylo v nab\\u00eddce, nejen skv\\u011ble vypadalo, ale hlavn\\u011b \\u00fa\\u017easn\\u011b chutnalo.\\u00a0V\\u00fdt\\u011b\\u017eek z t\\u00e9to akce studenti pou\\u017eij\\u00ed jako z\\u00e1kladn\\u00ed kapit\\u00e1l k v\\u00fdrob\\u011b produkt\\u016f sv\\u00e9 studentsk\\u00e9 firmy.\\u00a0<\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":780,\"asset_id\":911,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('790', 'com_content.article.781', '', '2026-09-10 22:19:31', '140', '3180', 'db83f267ab4c4275a47c118574015ae535fed5d0', '{\"title\":\"Po stop\\u00e1ch opevn\\u011bn\\u00ed\",\"alias\":\"vylet-do-odolova\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2022-10-09 16:54:50\",\"publish_up\":\"2022-10-09 16:54:50\",\"ordering\":156,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":false,\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":false,\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":false,\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Po stop\\u00e1ch opevn\\u011bn\\u00ed<br \\/><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/Odolov.jpg\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/Odolov.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u017d\\u00e1ci 1. A se vydali 23. 9. na v\\u00fdlet do Odolova \\u201e po stop\\u00e1ch zrady\\u201c V\\u0161echno za\\u010dalo na autobusov\\u00e9m n\\u00e1dra\\u017e\\u00ed v N\\u00e1chod\\u011b, odkud jsme jeli autobusem do c\\u00edle na\\u0161\\u00ed cesty. Museli jsme jednou p\\u0159estupovat v Bat\\u0148ovic\\u00edch. Na m\\u00edsto jsme p\\u0159ijeli ve \\u010dtvrt na deset. Nejd\\u0159\\u00edve jsme si prohl\\u00e9dli Pam\\u00e1tn\\u00edk osvobozen\\u00ed, a potom jsme \\u0161li na dalekou cestu, dlouhou asi 13 km, plnou bunkr\\u016f. M\\u011bli jsme s sebou dva pr\\u016fvodce, kte\\u0159\\u00ed n\\u00e1m poutav\\u011b vysv\\u011btlili historii pohrani\\u010dn\\u00edch opevn\\u011bn\\u00ed. N\\u011bkter\\u00e9 bunkry jsme si mohli prohl\\u00e9dnout i zevnit\\u0159. B\\u011bhem na\\u0161i prima proch\\u00e1zky jsme na\\u0161li i p\\u00e1r hub. Cel\\u00fd v\\u00fdlet jsme ukon\\u010dili v Hronov\\u011b. Tato akce byla zaj\\u00edmav\\u00e1 t\\u00edm, \\u017ee jsme spojili p\\u0159\\u00edjemn\\u00e9 s u\\u017eite\\u010dn\\u00fdm, tzn. proch\\u00e1zku s nabyt\\u00edm nov\\u00fdch v\\u011bdomost\\u00ed.<\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":781,\"asset_id\":912,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('791', 'com_content.article.782', '', '2026-09-10 22:19:31', '140', '3178', '9ad8641b41ef805c9fce18047b33aa8dc09f8d9e', '{\"title\":\"Projekt \\\"Moje t\\u011blo\\\" - M\\u0160 B\\u0159ezinova a studenti 3.B\",\"alias\":\"projekt-moje-telo-ms-brezinova-a-studenti-3-b\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2022-10-13 21:00:04\",\"publish_up\":\"2022-10-13 21:00:04\",\"ordering\":154,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":false,\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":false,\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":false,\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Projekt \\\"Moje t\\u011blo\\\" - M\\u0160 B\\u0159ezinova a studenti 3.B <br \\/><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/skolka\\/1.jpg\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/skolka\\/2.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>11.10. p\\u0159ipravili studenti 3.B oboru cestovn\\u00ed ruch pod veden\\u00edm pana u\\u010ditele Mgr. Martina Vrabce projekt pro M\\u0160 B\\u0159ezinova. Jednalo se o workshop, kde se \\u0161kolkov\\u00e9 d\\u011bti nau\\u010dily nov\\u00e9 v\\u011bdomosti od na\\u0161ich student\\u016f na t\\u00e9ma \\\"Moje t\\u011blo\\\". Na\\u0161i \\u017e\\u00e1ci si p\\u0159ipravili n\\u011bkolik stanovi\\u0161\\u0165, jak ve sv\\u00e9 vlastn\\u00ed t\\u0159\\u00edd\\u011b, tak v p\\u0159\\u00edrodov\\u011bdn\\u00e9 laborato\\u0159i, kde byly pro d\\u011bti p\\u0159ipraveny n\\u00e1zorn\\u00e9 \\u00fakoly. D\\u011bti si tak\\u00e9 prohl\\u00e9dly \\u0161kolu a posadily se do lavic,\\u00a0zkusily\\u00a0si b\\u00fdt na chvilku st\\u0159edo\\u0161kol\\u00e1ky. V\\u0161em se projekt moc l\\u00edbil.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/skolka\\/1.jpg\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/skolka\\/1.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"671\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":782,\"asset_id\":913,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
