('797', 'com_content.article.788', '', '2026-09-10 22:19:36', '140', '4613', '6a758840671250325208c1386a962e0d7a839a83', '{\"title\":\"Adapta\\u010dn\\u00ed a vyrovn\\u00e1vac\\u00ed kurz 2. B a 3. B v Jizersk\\u00fdch hor\\u00e1ch\",\"alias\":\"adaptacni-a-vyrovnavaci-kurz-2-b-a-3-b-v-jizerskych-horach\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2022-11-03 19:20:03\",\"publish_up\":\"2022-11-03 19:20:03\",\"ordering\":153,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":false,\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":false,\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":false,\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Adapta\\u010dn\\u00ed a vyrovn\\u00e1vac\\u00ed kurz 2. B a 3. B v Jizersk\\u00fdch hor\\u00e1ch<br \\/><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/2.B+3.B\\/1.jpg\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/2.B+3.B\\/1.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>I kdy\\u017e po\\u010das\\u00ed je ji\\u017e zcela podzimn\\u00ed, vyrazili jsme s panem u\\u010ditelem Chmela\\u0159em, panem u\\u010ditelem Tomkem a pan\\u00ed u\\u010ditelkou \\u0160r\\u016ftkovou do Jizersk\\u00fdch hor na adapta\\u010dn\\u00ed kurz spole\\u010dn\\u011b s 2. B. Hned prvn\\u00ed den jsme nav\\u0161t\\u00edvili skl\\u00e1rny v Harrachov\\u011b.\\u00a0 Po prohl\\u00eddce, n\\u00e1kupu skla a ob\\u011bd\\u011b jsme i p\\u0159es de\\u0161tiv\\u00e9 po\\u010das\\u00ed zam\\u00ed\\u0159ili k Mumlavsk\\u00fdm vodop\\u00e1d\\u016fm. N\\u00e1sleduj\\u00edc\\u00edho dne, tedy v \\u00fater\\u00fd, jsme za\\u010dali zoologickou zahradu v Liberci. Pot\\u00e9 jsme se zastavili v Obchodn\\u00edm centru Nisa, kde jsme poob\\u011bdvali a tak\\u00e9 nakoupili n\\u011bjak\\u00e9 ty dobroty, ale i knihy. Doslova vrcholem dne byl vys\\u00edla\\u010d na Je\\u0161t\\u011bdu. Na po\\u010das\\u00ed jsme m\\u011bli tentokr\\u00e1t v\\u011bt\\u0161\\u00ed \\u0161t\\u011bst\\u00ed, a dostalo se n\\u00e1m tak impozantn\\u00edho v\\u00fdhledu na cel\\u00e9 bl\\u00edzk\\u00e9 i vzd\\u00e1len\\u00e9 okol\\u00ed. Ve st\\u0159edu na n\\u00e1s \\u010dekal v\\u00fd\\u0161lap na nejvy\\u0161\\u0161\\u00ed vrchol Jizersk\\u00fdch hor na horu Smrk. I p\\u0159es nep\\u0159\\u00edstupn\\u00fd ter\\u00e9n jsme se k autobusu vr\\u00e1tili v\\u0161ichni ve zdrav\\u00ed. Cestou k penzionu jsme se zastavili u poutn\\u00edho m\\u00edsta Hejnice a v l\\u00e1zn\\u00edch Libverda. \\u010ctvrtek byl ve znamen\\u00ed sportu. Dopoledne jsme se v\\u011bnovali sportovn\\u00edm aktivit\\u00e1m u penzionu, odpoledne jsme zav\\u00edtali do plaveck\\u00e9ho baz\\u00e9nu v Jablonci nad Nisou. V\\u00a0p\\u00e1tek r\\u00e1no jsme se nasn\\u00eddali a vydali jsme se k\\u00a0domovu.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Adapta\\u010dn\\u00ed kurz se n\\u00e1m velice l\\u00edbil a t\\u011b\\u0161\\u00edme se na dal\\u0161\\u00ed akce.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Mat\\u011bj Brou\\u010dek<br \\/>p\\u0159edseda 3. B<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/2.B+3.B\\/2.jpg\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/2.B+3.B\\/2.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/2.B+3.B\\/basnicky.jpg\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/2.B+3.B\\/basnicky.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/span><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":788,\"asset_id\":919,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('798', 'com_content.article.789', '', '2026-09-10 22:19:37', '140', '7337', '50b50a08ca1b147430b9cf4d0471bf595fa1585e', '{\"title\":\"V\\u00fdm\\u011bnn\\u00fd pobyt se \\u0161kolou v Appleby (UK)\",\"alias\":\"vymenny-pobyt-se-skolou-v-appleby-uk\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2022-11-03 19:36:26\",\"publish_up\":\"2022-11-03 19:36:26\",\"ordering\":152,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":false,\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":false,\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":false,\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">V\\u00fdm\\u011bnn\\u00fd pobyt se \\u0161kolou v Appleby (UK)<br \\/><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/Appelby\\/1.jpg\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/Appelby\\/1.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>N\\u00e1chod \\u2013 Appleby Exchange 2022<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Ve \\u010dtvrtek 20. 11. jsme v\\u00a0N\\u00e1chod\\u011b v Raisov\\u011b ulici p\\u0159iv\\u00edtali 8 student\\u016f z\\u00a0m\\u011bste\\u010dka Appleby na severu Anglie. Za\\u010dal t\\u00edm tak n\\u00e1\\u0161 spole\\u010dn\\u00fd program v\\u00a0r\\u00e1mci v\\u00fdm\\u011bnn\\u00e9ho pobytu. Hned v\\u00a0p\\u00e1tek r\\u00e1no jsme za\\u010dali prohl\\u00eddkou \\u0161koly. Pro britsk\\u00e9 p\\u0159\\u00e1tele jsme tak\\u00e9 p\\u0159ipravili prezentace o na\\u0161\\u00ed \\u0161kole, o N\\u00e1chod\\u011b a o \\u010cesk\\u00e9 republice, oni si pro n\\u00e1s nachystali prezentaci o m\\u011bste\\u010dku Appleby a samoz\\u0159ejm\\u011b o slavn\\u00e9m britsk\\u00e9m n\\u00e1rodn\\u00edm parku Lake District. Hned pot\\u00e9 jsme vlakem vyrazili do Adr\\u0161pa\\u0161sko-Teplick\\u00fdch skal. V\\u0161em se n\\u00e1m moc l\\u00edbily skaln\\u00ed \\u00fatvary dopln\\u011bn\\u00e9 podzimn\\u00edm list\\u00edm. P\\u00e1te\\u010dn\\u00ed ve\\u010der jsme pak tr\\u00e1vili ka\\u017ed\\u00fd po sv\\u00e9m, co\\u017e n\\u00e1m dalo mo\\u017enost procvi\\u010dit si angli\\u010dtinu a pohostit britskou delegaci tradi\\u010dn\\u00edmi \\u010desk\\u00fdmi j\\u00eddly, jako je sv\\u00ed\\u010dkov\\u00e1 na smetan\\u011b \\u010di \\u0159\\u00edzek. V\\u00a0sobotu n\\u00e1s \\u010dekala stov\\u011b\\u017eat\\u00e1 Praha. Cel\\u00fdm na\\u0161\\u00edm hlavn\\u00edm m\\u011bstem n\\u00e1s provedla b\\u00fdval\\u00e1 \\u017ea\\u010dka na\\u0161\\u00ed \\u0161koly, Darina. Prohl\\u00eddka m\\u011bsta byla velmi poutav\\u00e1 a l\\u00edbila se p\\u0159edev\\u0161\\u00edm britsk\\u00fdm n\\u00e1v\\u0161t\\u011bvn\\u00edk\\u016fm. Na z\\u00e1v\\u011br na\\u0161eho spole\\u010dn\\u00e9ho programu p\\u0159ipadla prohl\\u00eddka N\\u00e1chodsk\\u00e9ho z\\u00e1mku, kterou jsem vedl j\\u00e1. I kdy\\u017e jsem se sv\\u00fdm v\\u00fdkonem nebyl spokojen, dostalo se mi mnoha vl\\u00eddn\\u00fdch slov ze strany britsk\\u00fdch p\\u0159\\u00e1tel.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>V\\u00fdm\\u011bnn\\u00fd pobyt n\\u00e1m umo\\u017enil nejen procvi\\u010dit si a vylep\\u0161it znalost anglick\\u00e9ho jazyka, ale tak\\u00e9 naj\\u00edt spoustu nov\\u00fdch p\\u0159\\u00e1tel. Kdy\\u017e nade\\u0161el \\u010das rozlou\\u010den\\u00ed, kdekdo m\\u011bl slzu na kraj\\u00ed\\u010dku.<br \\/>U\\u017e se moc t\\u011b\\u0161\\u00edme na b\\u0159ezen, kdy se zase v\\u0161ichni setk\\u00e1me. Tentokr\\u00e1te v\\u0161ak na britsk\\u00e9 p\\u016fd\\u011b, v\\u00a0Appleby.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Mat\\u011bj Brou\\u010dek<br \\/>hrd\\u00fd z\\u00fa\\u010dastn\\u011bn\\u00fd<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"color: #222222; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/Appelby\\/2.jpg\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/Appelby\\/2.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/Appelby\\/3.jpg\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/Appelby\\/3.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/Appelby\\/4.jpg\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/Appelby\\/4.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Studenti z\\u00a0Appleby:<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>There wasn\\u2019t a moment I didn\\u2019t enjoy!\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0I am very glad that I took part in the exchange as it gave me the opportunity to travel to the Czech Republic and see and experience it in a way that a tourist wouldn\'t by being with a family who lives there. I got the opportunity to see some amazing places I would never have thought of going to visit.\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><br \\/> I look forward to seeing all the Czech students again and showing them our area of the country\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>I\\u2019ve tried new foods, met and learnt completely new and different people and gained confidence in travelling abroad.\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Brilliant, loving and homely environment!\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0I made many new friends over my stay and have a deeper understanding of countries outside of the UK.\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Despite the language barrier, I was received with kindness from my hosts who had never even met me.\\u00a0\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>I think I have a wider view of the world and have experienced the way of life in a town and learned how to live with different people.\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>I have gained some more confidence as I was staying with people I had never met before and managed to communicate despite a language barrier.\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>I enjoyed myself so much and met some lovely people who were amazing!\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":789,\"asset_id\":920,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
