\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Kulturn\\u011b historick\\u00e1 prohl\\u00eddka m\\u011bsta Prahy (Cestovn\\u00ed ruch 1.B)<br \\/><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/Praha_1.B.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" \\/><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-size: 10pt;\\\">T\\u0159\\u00edda 1.B obor cestovn\\u00ed ruch, dne 20.12.2022 uskute\\u010dnila v na\\u0161em hlavn\\u00edm m\\u011bst\\u011b kulturn\\u011b historickou prohl\\u00eddku. B\\u011bhem t\\u00e9to n\\u00e1v\\u0161t\\u011bvy Prahy jsme zav\\u00edtali na Pet\\u0159\\u00edn, ke Strahovsk\\u00e9mu kl\\u00e1\\u0161teru, k Pra\\u017esk\\u00e9mu hradu, do Nerudovy ulice, na Karl\\u016fv most a na Starom\\u011bstsk\\u00e9 n\\u00e1m\\u011bst\\u00ed. Po\\u010das\\u00ed n\\u00e1m p\\u0159\\u00e1lo a tak\\u00e9 d\\u00edky v\\u00e1no\\u010dn\\u00ed atmosf\\u00e9\\u0159e jsme si n\\u00e1\\u0161 v\\u00fdlet moc u\\u017eili.<br \\/> \\u017e\\u00e1ci 1.B<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":804,\"asset_id\":935,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('814', 'com_content.article.805', '', '2026-09-10 22:19:51', '140', '4140', 'd2d333749043ba37b37527f8b0d2e19e8ae82c0b', '{\"title\":\"Ly\\u017ea\\u0159sk\\u00fd z\\u00e1jezd - Rakousko, Stubai\",\"alias\":\"lyzarsky-zajezd-rakousko-stubai\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2023-01-23 16:55:47\",\"publish_up\":\"2023-01-23 16:55:47\",\"ordering\":144,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":false,\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":false,\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":false,\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Ly\\u017ea\\u0159sk\\u00fd z\\u00e1jezd - Rakousko, Stubai<br \\/><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/Stubai\\/1.jpg\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/Stubai\\/1.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/Stubai\\/2.jpg\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/Stubai\\/2.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/Stubai\\/3.jpg\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/Stubai\\/3.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>V\\u00a0t\\u00fddnu od 09. 01. do 14. 01.2023 jsme se autobusem vydali sm\\u011br Rakousk\\u00fd Telfes. Ne\\u0161lo jen o ly\\u017eov\\u00e1n\\u00ed, kter\\u00e9 bylo \\u00fa\\u017easn\\u00e9, ale i se sp\\u0159\\u00e1telit s\\u00a0ostatn\\u00edmi, nejen ze sv\\u00e9 t\\u0159\\u00eddy. Jeliko\\u017e jsme na \\u0161kole prvn\\u00edm rokem, jsme r\\u00e1di za nov\\u00e9 zku\\u0161enosti a pozn\\u00e1n\\u00ed. Po\\u010das\\u00ed nebylo prvn\\u00ed den \\u00fapln\\u011b ide\\u00e1ln\\u00ed, ale dal\\u0161\\u00ed dny se n\\u00e1m u\\u017e uk\\u00e1zalo slun\\u00ed\\u010dko\\u00a0 a prav\\u00e1 ly\\u017eova\\u010dka mohla za\\u010d\\u00edt. Nav\\u0161t\\u00edvili jsme obrovsk\\u00fd a modern\\u00ed are\\u00e1l Stubai Gletcher, men\\u0161\\u00ed\\u00a0 st\\u0159edisko Schlick a okouzluj\\u00edc\\u00ed are\\u00e1l Axamer Lizum.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Kr\\u00e1sn\\u00e9 dlouh\\u00e9 carvingov\\u00e9 oblouky vyst\\u0159\\u00eddalo blbnut\\u00ed v pra\\u0161anu a snowparku. Po celodenn\\u00ed ly\\u017eova\\u010dce jsme relaxovali v hotelov\\u00e9 saun\\u011b a baz\\u00e9nu. Posledn\\u00ed den jsme si u\\u017e pouze lehce u\\u017e\\u00edvali posledn\\u00edch p\\u00e1r j\\u00edzd a kr\\u00e1sn\\u011b unaveni po cel\\u00e9m t\\u00fddnu relaxovali. Ubytov\\u00e1n\\u00ed bylo moc fajn a sn\\u00eddan\\u011b luxusn\\u00ed.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u017d\\u00e1ci z\\u00a01. A d\\u011bkuj\\u00ed za p\\u0159\\u00edle\\u017eitost, \\u017ee jsme mohli vyrazit\\u00a0 a u\\u017e\\u00edt si kr\\u00e1sn\\u00fd t\\u00fdden na hor\\u00e1ch, p\\u0159\\u00ed\\u0161t\\u00ed rok ur\\u010dit\\u011b pojedeme r\\u00e1di\\u00a0 zas.<\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":805,\"asset_id\":936,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('815', 'com_content.article.806', '', '2026-09-10 22:19:51', '140', '1552', 'e99b8c59d310604689b53d609dbad73f61a19fc3', '{\"title\":\"Voln\\u00e9 pozice\",\"alias\":\"volne-pozice\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":8,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2023-02-02 19:07:43\",\"publish_up\":\"2023-02-02 19:07:43\",\"ordering\":4,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAl