style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">D\\u011bjepisn\\u00e1 olympi\\u00e1da.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Den 17. ledna se \\u017e\\u00e1ci 3. ro\\u010dn\\u00edku Ji\\u0159\\u00ed Havel, Mat\\u011bj Brou\\u010dek a Adam Burdych z\\u00fa\\u010dastnili okresn\\u00edho kola d\\u011bjepisn\\u00e9 olympi\\u00e1dy, leto\\u0161n\\u00edm t\\u00e9matem byla Studen\\u00e1 v\\u00e1lka. V\\u00a0konkurenci gymnazist\\u016f obsadili p\\u011bkn\\u00e9 6., 7. a 8. m\\u00edsto. V\\u0161ichni se za\\u0159adili mezi \\u00fasp\\u011b\\u0161n\\u00e9 \\u0159e\\u0161itele (tzn. m\\u011bli v\\u00edce, ne\\u017e 60 %).<br \\/>\\u017d\\u00e1k\\u016fm d\\u011bkujeme za reprezentaci \\u0161koly.\\u00a0<\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":808,\"asset_id\":939,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
