('827', 'com_content.article.818', '', '2026-09-10 22:19:57', '140', '4952', '3048dc3af231633d3c783298288cb8cd9645653b', '{\"title\":\"Veletrh CR v Praze 2023\",\"alias\":\"veletrh-cr-v-praze-2023\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2023-04-06 19:54:11\",\"publish_up\":\"2023-04-06 19:54:11\",\"ordering\":141,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":false,\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":false,\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":false,\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Veletrh CR v Praze 2023<br \\/><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/Holiday World.jpg\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/Holiday World.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>V\\u00a0p\\u00e1tek 17. b\\u0159ezna 2023 jsme se pod taktovkou pana u\\u010ditele Chmela\\u0159e a pan\\u00ed u\\u010ditelky Galbov\\u00e9 vydali do pra\\u017esk\\u00e9ho v\\u00fdstavi\\u0161t\\u011b Expo v\\u00a0Let\\u0148anech, kde prob\\u00edhal 31. ro\\u010dn\\u00edk mezin\\u00e1rodn\\u00edch veletrh\\u016f cestovn\\u00edho ruchu a region\\u00e1ln\\u00ed turistiky, kter\\u00fd na\\u0161e \\u0161kola pravideln\\u011b nav\\u0161t\\u011bvuje ji\\u017e n\\u011bkolik let. Veletrhu se \\u00fa\\u010dastnili studenti 1. -3. ro\\u010dn\\u00edku oboru cestovn\\u00ed ruch.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>R\\u00e1no jsme vyjeli autobusem z\\u00a0N\\u00e1choda a k\\u00a0v\\u00fdstavi\\u0161ti dorazili okolo des\\u00e1t\\u00e9. Po vstupu do samotn\\u00e9ho are\\u00e1lu jsme se mohli setkat zhruba s\\u00a0230 st\\u00e1nky cestovn\\u00edch agentur, cestovn\\u00edch kancel\\u00e1\\u0159\\u00ed, r\\u016fznorod\\u00fdch zem\\u00ed, kraj\\u016f \\u010di m\\u011bst. D\\u00e1le jme mohli vid\\u011bt p\\u0159edn\\u00e1\\u0161ky cestovatel\\u016f, dobrodruh\\u016f a fotograf\\u016f v r\\u00e1mci cestovatelsk\\u00e9ho festivalu Kolem sv\\u011bta, ud\\u00edlen\\u00ed presti\\u017en\\u00edho ocen\\u011bn\\u00ed turistick\\u00fdch produkt\\u016f a slu\\u017eeb\\u00a0Velk\\u00e1 cena cestovn\\u00edho ruchu,\\u00a0anketa Kraj m\\u00e9ho srdce,\\u00a0mapuj\\u00edc\\u00ed m\\u00edru popularity kraj\\u016f \\u010cR.\\u00a0Veletrh se konal soub\\u011b\\u017en\\u011b s 14. v\\u00fdstavou obytn\\u00fdch automobil\\u016f a karavan\\u016f\\u00a0FOR CARAVAN\\u00a0a 6. v\\u00fdstavou lod\\u00ed a vodn\\u00edch sport\\u016f\\u00a0FOR BOAT.\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 Na v\\u00fdstav\\u011b jsme potom str\\u00e1vili 4 hodiny, co\\u017e byla adekv\\u00e1tn\\u00ed doba k\\u00a0nav\\u0161t\\u00edven\\u00ed v\\u0161ech st\\u00e1nk\\u016f a z\\u00edsk\\u00e1n\\u00ed cenn\\u00fdch informac\\u00ed, prospekt\\u016f \\u010di reklamn\\u00edch p\\u0159edm\\u011bt\\u016f, od pl\\u00e1t\\u011bn\\u00e9 ta\\u0161ky a\\u017e po zubn\\u00ed kart\\u00e1\\u010dky. Leto\\u0161n\\u00ed veletrh byl velmi dob\\u0159e organizovan\\u00fd a strukturovan\\u00fd, tak\\u017ee nebylo t\\u011b\\u017ek\\u00e9 se v\\u00a0hal\\u00e1ch zorientovat.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Po samotn\\u00e9 v\\u00fdstav\\u011b jsme se vydali do n\\u00e1kupn\\u00edho centra \\u010cern\\u00fd most, kde jsme m\\u011bli zhruba hodinovou p\\u0159est\\u00e1vku na ob\\u010derstven\\u00ed a dal\\u0161\\u00ed p\\u0159\\u00edpadn\\u00e9 n\\u00e1kupy. A tak jsme se s\\u00a0pln\\u00fdmi pl\\u00e1t\\u011bn\\u00fdmi ta\\u0161kami prospekt\\u016f, obohaceni o nov\\u00e9 informace, vr\\u00e1tili okolo 19:00 do N\\u00e1choda.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 Celou akci bych hodnotila velmi pozitivn\\u011b a mysl\\u00edm si, \\u017ee pro n\\u00e1s byla velk\\u00fdm p\\u0159\\u00ednosem.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Anna Hlad\\u00edkov\\u00e1<br \\/> studentka III. B<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":818,\"asset_id\":949,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('828', 'com_content.article.819', '', '2026-09-10 22:19:57', '140', '5275', '975f9677cee2b0e3c0852b5d4d74134e6ddbeec2', '{\"title\":\"Appleby \\u2013 N\\u00e1chod Exchange 2023\",\"alias\":\"appleby-nachod-exchange-2023\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2023-04-06 19:57:42\",\"publish_up\":\"2023-04-06 19:57:42\",\"ordering\":139,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":false,\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":false,\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":false,\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Appleby \\u2013 N\\u00e1chod Exchange 2023<br \\/><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/App\\/1.jpg\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/App\\/1.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/span><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/App\\/2.jpg\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/App\\/2.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"600\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>V\\u00a0\\u0159\\u00edjnu jsme v\\u00a0N\\u00e1chod\\u011b p\\u0159iv\\u00edtali studenty z\\u00a0Velk\\u00e9 Brit\\u00e1nie. Nyn\\u00ed kone\\u010dn\\u011b nastal \\u010das se s\\u00a0nimi znovu setkat, tentokr\\u00e1t v\\u0161ak na britsk\\u00e9 p\\u016fd\\u011b. Dnem D pro n\\u00e1s bylo pond\\u011bl\\u00ed 20. b\\u0159ezna, kdy jsme v\\u00a09.45 odlet\\u011bli z\\u00a0Prahy do Manchesteru. I p\\u0159es komplikace s\\u00a0anglick\\u00fdmi vlaky jsme se dostali na m\\u00edsto ur\\u010den\\u00ed, do m\\u011bste\\u010dka Appleby-in-Westmorland na severu Anglie, je\\u0161t\\u011b p\\u0159ed z\\u00e1padem Slunce. U zdej\\u0161\\u00ed \\u0161koly jsme se kone\\u010dn\\u011b po n\\u011bkolika m\\u011bs\\u00edc\\u00edch setkali s\\u00a0na\\u0161imi britsk\\u00fdmi p\\u0159\\u00e1teli. Setk\\u00e1n\\u00ed to bylo opravdu srde\\u010dn\\u00e9. V\\u00a0budov\\u011b \\u0161koly jsme spole\\u010dn\\u011b posva\\u010dili dort. Pak u\\u017e jsme se rozd\\u011blili a ka\\u017ed\\u00fd se sv\\u00fdm zahrani\\u010dn\\u00edm par\\u0165\\u00e1kem tr\\u00e1vil prvn\\u00ed ve\\u010der ve Spojen\\u00e9m kr\\u00e1lovstv\\u00ed. V\\u00a0\\u00fater\\u00fd jsme se z\\u00fa\\u010dastnili vyu\\u010dov\\u00e1n\\u00ed. Byli jsme na hodin\\u00e1ch psychologie, angli\\u010dtiny a fyziky. Dalo n\\u00e1m to p\\u0159\\u00edle\\u017eitost porovnat \\u010desk\\u00fd \\u0161koln\\u00ed syst\\u00e9m s\\u00a0t\\u00edm britsk\\u00fdm. Ve\\u00a0st\\u0159edu jsme vyrazili do n\\u00e1rodn\\u00edho parku Lake District, nep\\u0159\\u00edli\\u0161 daleko od Appleby. V\\u00a0tomto n\\u00e1rodn\\u00edm parku se n\\u00e1m naskytly n\\u00e1dhern\\u00e9 v\\u00fdhledy nejen na slavn\\u00e1 jezera, ale tak\\u00e9 na kr\\u00e1snou anglickou krajinu obecn\\u011b. Ve \\u010dtvrtek jsme nav\\u0161t\\u00edvili jedno z\\u00a0nejkr\\u00e1sn\\u011bj\\u0161\\u00edch anglick\\u00fdch m\\u011bst \\u2013 York. V\\u00a0tomto staroanglick\\u00e9m m\\u011bst\\u011b jsme vid\\u011bli nejslavn\\u011bj\\u0161\\u00ed m\\u00edsta a tak\\u00e9 vikingsk\\u00e9 muzeum Jorvik.\\u00a0 V\\u00a0p\\u00e1tek byla atmosf\\u00e9ra daleko pochmurn\\u011bj\\u0161\\u00ed ne\\u017e v\\u00a0p\\u0159edchoz\\u00edch dnech. Nastal op\\u011bt \\u010das se rozlou\\u010dit. U\\u017e te\\u010f ale v\\u00edme, \\u017ee toto setk\\u00e1n\\u00ed nebylo posledn\\u00ed, a na\\u0161e vz\\u00e1jemn\\u00e9 p\\u0159\\u00e1telstv\\u00ed je na cel\\u00fd \\u017eivot. P\\u0159ed odletem jsme je\\u0161t\\u011b nav\\u0161t\\u00edvili m\\u011bsto Leeds. P\\u0159i zp\\u00e1te\\u010dn\\u00edm letu se n\\u00e1m do cesty p\\u0159ipletla bou\\u0159e, kter\\u00e1 pro n\\u011bkter\\u00e9 z\\u00a0n\\u00e1s ud\\u011blala z\\u00a0b\\u011b\\u017en\\u00e9ho letu adrenalinov\\u00fd z\\u00e1\\u017eitek.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Pobyt ve Velk\\u00e9 Brit\\u00e1nii jsme si u\\u017eili a t\\u011b\\u0161\\u00edme na dal\\u0161\\u00ed setk\\u00e1n\\u00ed s\\u00a0na\\u0161imi p\\u0159\\u00e1teli.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Chceme tak\\u00e9 pod\\u011bkovat pan\\u00ed \\u0159editelce Mgr. Jarol\\u00edmov\\u00e9 za organizaci cel\\u00e9ho v\\u00fdm\\u011bnn\\u00e9ho pobytu.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Mat\\u011bj Brou\\u010dek<br \\/>\\u017e\\u00e1k 3. B<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":819,\"asset_id\":950,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
