('835', 'com_content.article.826', '', '2026-09-10 22:20:00', '140', '3180', 'd4631d08f16c5b432088c0b4b9bb9900a8a862b9', '{\"title\":\"M\\u0160 Al\\u0161ova - projekt \\\"Na\\u0161e t\\u011blo\\\"\",\"alias\":\"ms-alsova-projekt-nase-telo\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2023-05-24 15:41:49\",\"publish_up\":\"2023-05-24 15:41:49\",\"ordering\":136,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":false,\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":false,\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":false,\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">M\\u0160 Al\\u0161ova - projekt \\\"Na\\u0161e t\\u011blo\\\"<br \\/><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/Skolka\\/2.jpg\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/Skolka\\/2.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"600\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Studenti 3. A oboru Ekonomick\\u00e9 lyceum a Sportovn\\u00ed management pod veden\\u00edm pana u\\u010ditele Mgr. Martina Vrabce p\\u0159ipravili projekt pro M\\u0160 Al\\u0161ova. Jednalo se o workshop, kde se \\u0161kolkov\\u00e9 d\\u011bti nau\\u010dily nov\\u00e9 v\\u011bdomosti od na\\u0161ich student\\u016f na t\\u00e9ma \\\"Moje t\\u011blo\\\". Na\\u0161i \\u017e\\u00e1ci si p\\u0159ipravili n\\u011bkolik stanovi\\u0161\\u0165, jak ve t\\u0159\\u00edd\\u011b, tak v p\\u0159\\u00edrodov\\u011bdn\\u00e9 laborato\\u0159i, kde byly pro d\\u011bti p\\u0159ipraveny n\\u00e1zorn\\u00e9 \\u00fakoly. D\\u011bti si tak\\u00e9 prohl\\u00e9dly \\u0161kolu, posadily se do lavic a zkusily si b\\u00fdt na chvilku st\\u0159edo\\u0161kol\\u00e1ky. V\\u0161em se projekt moc l\\u00edbil.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/Skolka\\/1.jpg\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/Skolka\\/1.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"600\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/span><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":826,\"asset_id\":957,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('836', 'com_content.article.827', '', '2026-09-10 22:20:01', '140', '3936', '4ceca4beffc80cfe4a88dd2c90d9461d8a69f7fb', '{\"title\":\"V\\u00fdjezdov\\u00e9 praxe 3.B\",\"alias\":\"vyjezdove-praxe-3-b\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2023-05-28 17:18:04\",\"publish_up\":\"2023-05-28 17:18:04\",\"ordering\":135,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":false,\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":false,\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":false,\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">V\\u00fdjezdov\\u00e9 praxe 3.B<br \\/><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/3.B_praxe.jpg\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/3.B_praxe.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Pardubice<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>12.4. jsme v r\\u00e1mci v\\u00fdjezdov\\u00fdch prax\\u00ed zav\\u00edtali do m\\u011bsta pern\\u00edku \\u2013 Pardubic. Zastavili jsme se nap\\u0159\\u00edklad u Enteria areny, kde s\\u00eddl\\u00ed m\\u00edstn\\u00ed hokejov\\u00fd klub HC Dynamo Pardubice, na Pern\\u0161t\\u00fdnsk\\u00e9m n\\u00e1m\\u011bst\\u00ed, u Automatick\\u00fdch ml\\u00fdn\\u016f a na\\u0161i prohl\\u00eddku jsme zakon\\u010dili v Tyr\\u0161ov\\u00fdch sadech u Pardubick\\u00e9ho z\\u00e1mku. Po\\u010das\\u00ed se velice vyvedlo a o to v\\u00edce jsme si tuto praxi u\\u017eili. Druhou prax\\u00ed byla ta ve Dvo\\u0159e Kr\\u00e1lov\\u00e9, kde se sice po\\u010das\\u00ed nevyvedlo a kv\\u016fli kvalit\\u011b \\u010desk\\u00fdch autobusov\\u00fdch spole\\u010dnost\\u00ed se n\\u011bkte\\u0159\\u00ed nemohli dostavit, o to v\\u00edce ale vynikly v\\u00fdkony na\\u0161ich spolu\\u017ea\\u010dek, kter\\u00e9 i p\\u0159es tyto nep\\u0159\\u00edjemnosti pr\\u016fvodcov\\u00e1n\\u00ed skv\\u011ble zvl\\u00e1dly a dok\\u00e1zaly, \\u017ee spr\\u00e1vn\\u00e9ho pr\\u016fvodce nic nerozhod\\u00ed. M\\u00edstem t\\u0159et\\u00ed i \\u010dtvrt\\u00e9 v\\u00fdjezdov\\u00e9 praxe se stal Hradec Kr\\u00e1lov\\u00e9. V Na\\u0161em krajsk\\u00e9m m\\u011bst\\u011b jsme d\\u00edky dv\\u011bma prax\\u00edm poznali ka\\u017ed\\u00fd kout ka\\u017ed\\u00e9ho n\\u00e1m\\u011bst\\u00ed a v\\u0161echna zaj\\u00edmav\\u00e1 m\\u00edsta. Mohu jmenovat v\\u0161em zn\\u00e1mou B\\u00edlou v\\u011b\\u017e, \\u010cPP ar\\u00e9nu, \\u017di\\u017ekovy sady, \\u2026 a tak d\\u00e1le. Na obou prax\\u00edch po\\u010das\\u00ed vy\\u0161lo a v\\u0161ichni jsme si je moc u\\u017eili. P\\u00e1t\\u00fdm m\\u00edstem kon\\u00e1n\\u00ed v\\u00fdjezdov\\u00e9 praxe bude na\\u0161e hlavn\\u00ed m\\u011bsto \\u2013 Praha. Co si pro n\\u00e1s spolu\\u017e\\u00e1ci p\\u0159iprav\\u00ed? Nechme se p\\u0159ekvapit a na shledanou na podzim.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Mat\\u011bj Brou\\u010dek <br \\/>P\\u0159edseda 3.B<\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":827,\"asset_id\":958,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('837', 'com_content.article.828', '', '2026-09-10 22:20:01', '140', '4357', 'a73567b68ac04fb4f0235fa625e83d98cd1d9882', '{\"title\":\" Praxe sportovn\\u00edho managementu \\u2013 n\\u00e1bor mal\\u00fdch fotbalist\\u016f\",\"alias\":\"praxe-sportovniho-managementu\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2023-05-28 17:30:07\",\"publish_up\":\"2023-05-28 17:30:07\",\"ordering\":133,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":false,\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":false,\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":false,\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"> Praxe sportovn\\u00edho managementu \\u2013 n\\u00e1bor mal\\u00fdch fotbalist\\u016f<br \\/><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/SM_praxe\\/1.jpg\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/SM_praxe\\/1.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"600\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Dne 24. 5. 2023 se na\\u0161e t\\u0159\\u00edda 2. A - oboru Sportovn\\u00ed management pod\\u00edlela, v\\u00a0r\\u00e1mci prax\\u00ed, na n\\u00e1boru nov\\u00fdch \\u010dlen\\u016f fotbalov\\u00e9ho t\\u00fdmu SK \\u010cerven\\u00fd Kostelec. Praxe prob\\u00edhala na zdej\\u0161\\u00edm nov\\u011b zrekonstruovan\\u00e9m h\\u0159i\\u0161ti.<br \\/>Po des\\u00e1t\\u00e9 hodin\\u011b na m\\u00edsto postupn\\u011b dorazilo p\\u0159es 100 d\\u011bt\\u00ed z\\u00a0okoln\\u00edch mate\\u0159sk\\u00fdch \\u0161kol. D\\u011bti se postupn\\u011b st\\u0159\\u00eddaly na stanovi\\u0161t\\u00edch, kter\\u00e1 jsme jim p\\u0159ipravili. Bylo u nich vid\\u011bt, i p\\u0159es nep\\u0159\\u00edze\\u0148 po\\u010das\\u00ed, velik\\u00e9 nad\\u0161en\\u00ed a z\\u00e1pal do aktivit, z\\u00a0\\u010deho\\u017e m\\u00e1me radost. Jsme vd\\u011b\\u010dni za p\\u0159\\u00edle\\u017eitost pracovat s\\u00a0takto mal\\u00fdmi d\\u011btmi.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Za 2. A<br \\/>Tereza Vav\\u0159enov\\u00e1 a Tom\\u00e1\\u0161 Rotter<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Studenti 1. A Jakub Sv\\u00edcenec, Ad\\u00e9la Pohlov\\u00e1 a Krist\\u00fdna Hot\\u00e1rkov\\u00e1 se se studenty\\u00a0druh\\u00e9ho ro\\u010dn\\u00edku z\\u00fa\\u010dastnili fotbalov\\u00e9ho n\\u00e1boru v\\u00a0\\u010cerven\\u00fdm Kostelci. Organiz\\u00e1torem byl fotbalov\\u00fd tren\\u00e9r Ji\\u0159\\u00ed \\u0158\\u00edha. Na to, \\u017ee po\\u010das\\u00ed moc nevy\\u0161lo, tak jsme si to s\\u00a0d\\u011btmi u\\u017eili pln\\u00fdmi dou\\u0161ky. Byla to skv\\u011bl\\u00e1 zku\\u0161enost, kter\\u00e1 n\\u00e1m dodala mnoho zku\\u0161enost\\u00ed a dovednost\\u00ed, jak pracovat s\\u00a0d\\u011btmi.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Za 1. A<br \\/>Jakub Sv\\u00edcenec, Ad\\u00e9la Pohlov\\u00e1 a Krist\\u00fdna Hot\\u00e1rkov\\u00e1<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/SM_praxe\\/2.jpg\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/SM_praxe\\/2.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"600\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/SM_praxe\\/3.jpg\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2023\\/SM_praxe\\/3.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"600\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":828,\"asset_id\":959,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
