('855', 'com_content.article.846', '', '2026-09-10 22:20:21', '140', '3251', '67cb5c7dc6be0ed5d6c5070a99dc403fae015d6b', '{\"title\":\"P\\u0159espoln\\u00ed b\\u011bh\",\"alias\":\"prespolni-beh-2\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2023-10-14 18:09:18\",\"publish_up\":\"2023-10-14 18:09:18\",\"ordering\":122,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":false,\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":false,\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":false,\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">P\\u0159espoln\\u00ed b\\u011bh<br \\/><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/Beh.jpg\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/Beh.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"600\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>V\\u00a0\\u00fater\\u00fd 3. 10. 2023 se na\\u0161e studentky a studenti z Academia Mercurii z\\u00fa\\u010dastnili okresn\\u00edho kola v p\\u0159espoln\\u00edm b\\u011bhu v\\u00a0Polici nad Metuj\\u00ed. P\\u011bkn\\u00e9 po\\u010das\\u00ed, dobr\\u00e1 n\\u00e1lada, ale hlavn\\u011b skv\\u011bl\\u00e9 b\\u011b\\u017eeck\\u00e9 v\\u00fdkony chlapc\\u016f sta\\u010dily na prvn\\u00ed m\\u00edsto a postup do krajsk\\u00e9ho kola. A tak jsme v\\u00a0p\\u00e1tek, ve stejn\\u00fd t\\u00fdden, vyrazili dod\\u00e1vkou v\\u00a0brzk\\u00fdch rann\\u00edch hodin\\u00e1ch za doprovodu pan\\u00ed u\\u010ditelky Je\\u017ekov\\u00e9 na krajsk\\u00e9 fin\\u00e1le do Ji\\u010d\\u00edna. Z\\u00e1vod se n\\u00e1m moc nepovedl, ale i tak si mysl\\u00edm, \\u017ee na\\u0161e v\\u00fdkony byly na hranici na\\u0161ich mo\\u017enost\\u00ed.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>D\\u011bkujeme \\u0161kole za za\\u0159\\u00edzen\\u00ed pohodov\\u00e9 dopravy s\\u00a0panem Brichem.<br \\/>Za b\\u011b\\u017eeck\\u00fd t\\u00fdm: Bornov\\u00e1 Michaela, \\u0158\\u00edhov\\u00e1 Krist\\u00fdna, Hosnedlov\\u00e1 Linda, Fejov\\u00e1 Viktorie, Buben\\u00ed\\u010dek Jan, Hlad\\u00edk Jakub, Nagy Adam, Rotter Tom\\u00e1\\u0161, Kulda Filip, Gois Filip<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Tom\\u00e1\\u0161 Rotter 3.A<\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":846,\"asset_id\":977,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('856', 'com_content.article.847', '', '2026-09-10 22:20:22', '140', '3163', '67269ee0add1a20b1106b0fb46400cef403d0e05', '{\"title\":\"Prohl\\u00eddka n\\u00e1chodsk\\u00e9ho z\\u00e1mku\",\"alias\":\"spolecna-prohlidku-nachodskeho-zamku\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2023-10-14 18:17:58\",\"publish_up\":\"2023-10-14 18:17:58\",\"ordering\":121,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":false,\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":false,\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":false,\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Prohl\\u00eddka n\\u00e1chodsk\\u00e9ho z\\u00e1mku<br \\/><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/Zamek.jpg\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/Zamek.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"600\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Dne 10.10. t\\u0159\\u00edda 1.B. obor cestovn\\u00ed ruch absolvovala svoji prvn\\u00ed spole\\u010dnou prohl\\u00eddku n\\u00e1chodsk\\u00e9ho z\\u00e1mku. Z\\u00e1meckou expozic\\u00ed je provedl student\\u00a0\\u010dtvrt\\u00e9ho ro\\u010dn\\u00edku Jirka Havel a studentka druh\\u00e9ho ro\\u010dn\\u00edku Anna \\u010conkov\\u00e1. Jednalo se o uk\\u00e1zkovou pr\\u016fvodcovskou \\u010dinnost, kde se studenti vy\\u0161\\u0161\\u00edch ro\\u010dn\\u00edk\\u016f sna\\u017eili p\\u0159edat sv\\u00e9 znalosti a dovednosti za\\u010d\\u00ednaj\\u00edc\\u00edm student\\u016fm prvn\\u00edho ro\\u010dn\\u00edku. Ti se taj\\u016fm pr\\u016fvodoc\\u00e1v\\u00e1n\\u00ed teprve budou u\\u010dit a odborn\\u00e9 praxe na hradech a z\\u00e1mc\\u00edch na n\\u011b \\u010dekaj\\u00ed v\\u00a0jarn\\u00edch m\\u011bs\\u00edc\\u00edch tohoto \\u0161koln\\u00edho roku.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>P\\u0159ejeme jim mnoho \\u00fasp\\u011bch\\u016f!<br \\/>Vyu\\u010duj\\u00edc\\u00ed odborn\\u00fdch p\\u0159edm\\u011bt\\u016f cestovn\\u00edho ruchu Igor Chmela\\u0159 a Mgr. Judita Jir\\u00e1skov\\u00e1 Galbov\\u00e1<\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":847,\"asset_id\":978,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('857', 'com_content.article.848', '', '2026-09-10 22:20:22', '140', '3199', '5331021f1f17e2c6503a1de1f50bfea594c76b97', '{\"title\":\"Erasmus Day \",\"alias\":\"erasmus-day\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2023-10-14 18:23:30\",\"publish_up\":\"2023-10-14 18:23:30\",\"ordering\":120,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":false,\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":false,\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":false,\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Erasmus Day <br \\/><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/ErasmusD.jpg\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/ErasmusD.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"600\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Na\\u0161e \\u0161kole se aktivn\\u011b zapojuje do projekt\\u016f ERASMUS+ a to jak v\\u00a0projektech ur\\u010den\\u00fdch \\u017e\\u00e1k\\u016fm, tak tak\\u00e9 pro podporu vzd\\u011bl\\u00e1v\\u00e1n\\u00ed u\\u010ditel\\u016f.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Z\\u00a0tohoto d\\u016fvodu jsme se p\\u0159ipojili k\\u00a0t\\u00e9to mezin\\u00e1rodn\\u00ed aktivit\\u011b a uspo\\u0159\\u00e1dali jsme pro na\\u0161e \\u017e\\u00e1ky prezentace, kde star\\u0161\\u00ed \\u017e\\u00e1ci sd\\u00edleli sv\\u00e9 zku\\u0161enosti a z\\u00e1\\u017eitky pr\\u00e1v\\u011b z\\u00a0program\\u016f ERASMUS+ s\\u00a0mlad\\u0161\\u00edmi \\u017e\\u00e1ky, kte\\u0159\\u00ed je\\u0161t\\u011b tuto mo\\u017enost nevyzkou\\u0161eli. K\\u00a0n\\u00e1m do \\u0161koly tak\\u00e9 p\\u0159i\\u0161li zahrani\\u010dn\\u00ed vysoko\\u0161kol\\u00e1ci, kte\\u0159\\u00ed tento rok p\\u016fsob\\u00ed v\\u00a0\\u010cesku, pr\\u00e1v\\u011b v\\u00a0r\\u00e1mci ERASMUS+, a vyu\\u010duj\\u00ed angli\\u010dtinu \\u010di sv\\u016fj rodn\\u00fd jazyk na n\\u00e1chodsk\\u00fdch \\u0161kol\\u00e1ch. Tito studenti sezn\\u00e1mili na\\u0161e 4. ro\\u010dn\\u00edky s\\u00a0mo\\u017enost\\u00ed vycestovat po maturit\\u011b do zahrani\\u010d\\u00ed v\\u00a0r\\u00e1mci tohoto projektu.<\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":848,\"asset_id\":979,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
