\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":849,\"asset_id\":980,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('859', 'com_content.article.850', '', '2026-09-10 22:20:23', '140', '3388', '12574c87f14dda4784541d939922c0b20d9c569f', '{\"title\":\"Pr\\u016fvodcovsk\\u00e1 \\u010dinnost 4.B - Praha \",\"alias\":\"pruvodcovska-cinnost-4-b-praha\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2023-10-22 13:54:21\",\"publish_up\":\"2023-10-22 13:54:21\",\"ordering\":119,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":false,\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":false,\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":false,\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Pr\\u016fvodcovsk\\u00e1 \\u010dinnost 4.B - Praha <br \\/><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/Praha_4.B.jpg\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/Praha_4.B.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"600\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>V\\u00a0\\u00fater\\u00fd 10. 10. 2023 jsme pod dohledem pana u\\u010ditele Chmela\\u0159e a pana u\\u010ditele Tomka vyrazili do na\\u0161eho hlavn\\u00edho m\\u011bsta \\u2013 do Prahy. \\u017d\\u00e1ci 4. B n\\u00e1s v\\u00a0r\\u00e1mci v\\u00fdjezdov\\u00e9 praxe provedli t\\u00edmto kr\\u00e1sn\\u00fdm m\\u011bstem, kter\\u00e9 dokonale kombinuje starod\\u00e1vnou architekturu s\\u00a0tou sou\\u010dasnou. Po\\u010das\\u00ed n\\u00e1m vych\\u00e1zelo, co\\u017e jen umocnilo cel\\u00fd z\\u00e1\\u017eitek. Na\\u0161e exkurze za\\u010dala na pra\\u017esk\\u00e9m hlavn\\u00edm n\\u00e1dra\\u017e\\u00ed. N\\u00e1sledovalo V\\u00e1clavsk\\u00e9 a Jungmannovo n\\u00e1m\\u011bst\\u00ed. Pro\\u0161li jsme kolem N\\u00e1rodn\\u00edho divadla, p\\u0159es Most Legi\\u00ed a\\u017e ke zdi Johna Lennona. Vystoupali jsme po schodech a\\u017e k\\u00a0Pra\\u017esk\\u00e9mu hradu, kde jsme mohli vid\\u011bt st\\u0159\\u00edd\\u00e1n\\u00ed str\\u00e1\\u017e\\u00ed. Zlat\\u00e1 uli\\u010dka n\\u00e1s zavedla k\\u00a0budov\\u011b sen\\u00e1tu, odkud jsme \\u0161li do samotn\\u00e9ho centra Prahy. Exkurze byla zakon\\u010dena na N\\u00e1m\\u011bst\\u00ed Republiky.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>D\\u011bkujeme \\u017e\\u00e1k\\u016fm 4. B za kr\\u00e1snou prohl\\u00eddku stov\\u011b\\u017eat\\u00e9 Prahy. <br \\/> Mat\\u011bj Brou\\u010dek 4.B<\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":850,\"asset_id\":981,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
