\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">25.3. - Jedeme pro Seb\\u00edka<br \\/><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">dne 25. 3. se na na\\u0161\\u00ed \\u0161kole uskute\\u010dn\\u00ed charitativn\\u00ed akce pro Sebastiana, kde si \\u017e\\u00e1ci vyzkou\\u0161\\u00ed j\\u00edzdu na bezbari\\u00e9rov\\u00fdch trena\\u017e\\u00e9rech a dozv\\u00ed se mnoho informac\\u00ed o sportu handicapovan\\u00fdch sportovc\\u016f.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/Sebik.jpg\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/Sebik.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"600\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":863,\"asset_id\":994,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('873', 'com_content.article.864', '', '2026-09-10 22:20:29', '140', '3235', '5c930f550ce5a7f097da15749791edc9e45c5c01', '{\"title\":\"Jedeme pro Seb\\u00edka\",\"alias\":\"jedeme-pro-sebika\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2024-04-03 18:32:23\",\"publish_up\":\"2024-04-03 18:32:23\",\"ordering\":109,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":false,\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":false,\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":false,\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Jedeme pro Seb\\u00edka<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/Sebik\\/1.jpg\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/Sebik\\/1.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"600\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/Sebik\\/2.jpg\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/Sebik\\/2.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"600\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Dne 25. 3. se na na\\u0161\\u00ed \\u0161kole Academia Mercurii uskute\\u010dnila charitativn\\u00ed akce pro Sebasti\\u00e1na po\\u0159\\u00e1dan\\u00e1 ve spolupr\\u00e1ci s\\u00a0Active Handy Nov\\u00e1 nad\\u011bje a Cesta za snem. \\u017d\\u00e1ci si vyzkou\\u0161eli j\\u00edzdu na bezbari\\u00e9rov\\u00fdch trena\\u017e\\u00e9rech, na kter\\u00fdch ujeli neuv\\u011b\\u0159iteln\\u00fdch 100,4 km. Pro Sebastiana tak \\u201evyjeli\\u201c 35\\u00a0000 K\\u010d na rehabilita\\u010dn\\u00ed pobyt v\\u00a0P\\u0159\\u00edbrami, kter\\u00fd mu ur\\u010dit\\u011b pom\\u016f\\u017ee k\\u00a0lep\\u0161\\u00ed pohyblivosti. Studenti Sportovn\\u00edho managementu se z\\u00fa\\u010dastnili besedy s\\u00a0voz\\u00ed\\u010dk\\u00e1\\u0159em He\\u0159manem a Pavlem. Hovo\\u0159ili nejen o tom, jak v\\u00a0kr\\u00e1tk\\u00e9 chvilce m\\u016f\\u017eete skon\\u010dit na voz\\u00edku, ale i o psychice a o \\u017eivot\\u011b s\\u00a0handicapem.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>V\\u0161em moc d\\u011bkuji!<br \\/> Monika \\u0160r\\u016ftkov\\u00e1<\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":864,\"asset_id\":995,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('874', 'com_content.article.865', '', '2026-09-10 22:20:30', '140', '3238', 'd7f5c5bbf60459417667ccce792352de5ecd8851', '{\"title\":\"Z\\u00e1klady trestn\\u00ed odpov\\u011bdnosti - p\\u0159edn\\u00e1\\u0161ka P\\u010cR\",\"alias\":\"zaklady-trestni-odpovednosti-prednaska-pcr\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2024-04-12 07:06:58\",\"publish_up\":\"2024-04-12 07:06:58\",\"ordering\":108,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":false,\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":false,\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":false,\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Z\\u00e1klady trestn\\u00ed odpov\\u011bdnosti - p\\u0159edn\\u00e1\\u0161ka P\\u010cR<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/Odpovednost.jpg\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/Odpovednost.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"600\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Dne 4.4.2024 nav\\u0161t\\u00edvil n\\u00e1chodsk\\u00fd policejn\\u00ed preventista por. Miroslav Mervart druh\\u00fd ro\\u010dn\\u00edk na Academia Mercurii. P\\u0159edn\\u00e1\\u0161ku v\\u011bnoval preventista z\\u00e1klad\\u016fm trestn\\u00ed odpov\\u011bdnosti. Na pozad\\u00ed dobr\\u00e9 n\\u00e1lady se poda\\u0159ilo probrat v\\u00e1\\u017en\\u00e9 v\\u011bci t\\u00fdkaj\\u00edc\\u00ed se rozd\\u011blen\\u00ed typ\\u016f protipr\\u00e1vn\\u00edch jedn\\u00e1n\\u00ed na p\\u0159estupky a trestn\\u00e9 \\u010diny, ale tak\\u00e9 informace, jak je policist\\u00e9 v praxi \\u0159e\\u0161\\u00ed. Studenti byli aktivn\\u00ed, nav\\u00edc m\\u011bli mo\\u017enost si i hledat v trestn\\u00edm z\\u00e1kon\\u011b \\u010di p\\u0159\\u00edmo na webu v mobilu jednotliv\\u00e1 ustanoven\\u00ed, pokusili se kvalifikovat i na praktick\\u00e9m p\\u0159\\u00edkladu. Na z\\u00e1v\\u011br se n\\u011bkolik student\\u016f informovalo na podm\\u00ednky p\\u0159ijet\\u00ed k Policii \\u010cR.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>por. Mgr. Miroslav Mervart<br \\/> n\\u00e1chodsk\\u00fd policejn\\u00ed preventista<\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":865,\"asset_id\":996,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('875', 'com_content.article.866', '', '2026-09-10 22:20:30', '140', '3633', 'b56fb8f1942652cfdfd4bbf428da7aac65733332', '{\"title\":\"Holiday World Praha 2024\",\"alias\":\"holiday-world-praha-2024\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2024-04-12 07:19:41\",\"publish_up\":\"2024-04-12 07:19:41\",\"ordering\":107,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":false,\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":false,\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":false,\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Holiday World Praha 2024<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/Holiday\\/1.jpg\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/Holiday\\/1.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"600\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/Holiday\\/2.jpg\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/Holiday\\/2.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"600\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Mezin\\u00e1rodn\\u00ed veletrh cestovn\\u00edho ruchu a region\\u00e1ln\\u00ed turistiky HOLIDAY WORLD &amp; REGION WORLD je nejv\\u00fdznamn\\u011bj\\u0161\\u00ed akc\\u00ed sv\\u00e9ho druhu nejen v\\u00a0\\u010cesk\\u00e9 republice, ale i v\\u00a0regionu st\\u0159edn\\u00ed Evropy. Veletrh prob\\u011bhl ve dnech 15. - 17. 3. 2024 v\\u00a0prostor\\u00e1ch let\\u0148ansk\\u00e9ho v\\u00fdstavi\\u0161t\\u011b PVA EXPO PRAHA\\u00a0v\\u00a0soub\\u011bhu s\\u00a0veletrhem For Caravan &amp; For Boats.<br \\/>Pod veden\\u00edm pana u\\u010ditele Igora Chmela\\u0159e a pan\\u00ed u\\u010ditelky Mgr. Judity Jir\\u00e1skov\\u00e9 Galbov\\u00e9 se \\u017e\\u00e1ci 1. a\\u017e 4. ro\\u010dn\\u00edku z\\u00fa\\u010dastnili tohoto unik\\u00e1tn\\u00edho veletrhu cestovn\\u00edho ruchu.<br \\/>Exkurze prob\\u00edhala v pohodov\\u00e9m duchu a \\u017e\\u00e1ci m\\u011bli mo\\u017enost si prohl\\u00e9dnout st\\u00e1nky z r\\u016fzn\\u00fdch kout\\u016f sv\\u011bta a st\\u00e1nky jak \\u010desk\\u00fdch, tak zahrani\\u010dn\\u00edch cestovn\\u00edch kancel\\u00e1\\u0159\\u00ed.<br \\/>Sou\\u010d\\u00e1st\\u00ed veletrhu byla tak\\u00e9 studentsk\\u00e1 sout\\u011b\\u017e \\u201eZpropaguj sv\\u00e9 m\\u011bsto\\u201c, kter\\u00e9 se z\\u00fa\\u010dastnily na\\u0161e dva vybran\\u00e9 t\\u00fdmy.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Igor Chmela\\u0159<br \\/> u\\u010ditel odborn\\u00fdch p\\u0159edm\\u011bt\\u016f<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":866,\"asset_id\":997,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('876', 'com_content.article.867', '', '2026-09-10 22:20:31', '140', '3935', 'efec7dc6a40dec2a56c168b490a9bfcc1f5fb729', '{\"title\":\"Ly\\u017ea\\u0159sk\\u00fd v\\u00fdcvik 2.A - Havlova bouda, Pec pod Sn\\u011b\\u017ekou\",\"alias\":\"lyzarsky-vycvik-2-a-havlova-bouda-pec-pod-snezkou\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2024-04-12 07:28:36\",\"publish_up\":\"2024-04-12 07:28:36\",\"ordering\":106,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":false,\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":false,\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":false,\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Ly\\u017ea\\u0159sk\\u00fd v\\u00fdcvik 2.A - Havlova bouda, Pec pod Sn\\u011b\\u017ekou<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/Lyzak_2.A.jpg\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/Lyzak_2.A.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"600\\\" \\/><\\/a><br \\/>\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Dne 17.3. 2024 se t\\u0159\\u00edda 2.A vydala spole\\u010dn\\u011b s\\u00a0na\\u0161\\u00ed pan\\u00ed t\\u0159\\u00eddn\\u00ed u\\u010ditelkou Lenkou Krulichovou, panem u\\u010ditelem Vrabcem a pan\\u00ed u\\u010ditelkou Ulichovou na ly\\u017ea\\u0159sk\\u00fd v\\u00fdcvik do Pece pod Sn\\u011b\\u017ekou. N\\u00e1\\u0161 v\\u00fdcvik zah\\u00e1jila cesta autobusem z\\u00a0N\\u00e1choda. P\\u0159i p\\u0159\\u00edjezdu jsme si vylo\\u017eili v\\u011bci a pan spr\\u00e1vce n\\u00e1m svezl v\\u011bci na chatu. Na n\\u00e1s bylo zdolat tamn\\u00ed kopec, kter\\u00fd byl pro n\\u011bkter\\u00e9 \\u010dleny pos\\u00e1dky velkou p\\u0159ek\\u00e1\\u017ekou. V\\u0161ichni jsme se ale nakonec na Havlovu boudu dostali. Po ve\\u010de\\u0159i jsme dostali obs\\u00e1hlou p\\u0159edn\\u00e1\\u0161ku o pravidlech na svahu od pana Vrabce. Prvn\\u00ed den byl pro v\\u0161echny rozkouk\\u00e1vac\\u00ed, ale ka\\u017ed\\u00fdm dnem jsme se zlep\\u0161ovali nebo zdokonalovali techniku ly\\u017eov\\u00e1n\\u00ed nebo snowbordov\\u00e1n\\u00ed. V\\u0161ichni jsme se rozjezdili na sjezdovce Javor a pot\\u00e9 ti zdatn\\u011bj\\u0161\\u00ed p\\u0159e\\u0161li po p\\u00e1r dnech na prud\\u0161\\u00ed sjezdovku Bramberk, kter\\u00e1 byla obohacena o m\\u00edstn\\u00ed bufet. Pan Vrabec n\\u00e1s m\\u00edsty nat\\u00e1\\u010del a Alex s\\u00a0Martinem mu pom\\u00e1hali a vznikla z\\u00a0toho tak velice vtipn\\u00e1 videa. Po\\u010das\\u00ed n\\u00e1m vy\\u0161lo ka\\u017ed\\u00fd den hezk\\u00e9, tak jak pan Vrabec p\\u0159edpov\\u011bd\\u011bl. V\\u0161ichni jsme si ly\\u017ea\\u0159sk\\u00fd kurz \\u00a0velmi u\\u017eili a i p\\u0159es p\\u00e1r p\\u00e1d\\u016f na n\\u011bj budeme vzpom\\u00ednat s\\u00a0\\u00fasm\\u011bvem na tv\\u00e1\\u0159i.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Magdal\\u00e9na K\\u0159i\\u010dkov\\u00e1 2.A<\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":867,\"asset_id\":998,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('877', 'com_content.article.868', '', '2026-09-10 22:20:31', '140', '3654', '2b8b7bd53ddd101caa846473774476b0a08ceeda', '{\"title\":\"Osv\\u011btim - pozn\\u00e1vac\\u00ed z\\u00e1jezd\",\"alias\":\"osvetim-poznavaci-zajezd\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2024-04-18 16:21:26\",\"publish_up\":\"2024-04-18 16:21:26\",\"ordering\":105,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":false,\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":false,\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":false,\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Osv\\u011btim - pozn\\u00e1vac\\u00ed z\\u00e1jezd<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/Osvetim.jpg\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/Osvetim.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"600\\\" \\/><\\/a><br \\/>\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Dne 2. 4. 2024 se uskute\\u010dnil pozn\\u00e1vac\\u00ed z\\u00e1jezd do koncentra\\u010dn\\u00edho t\\u00e1bora\\u00a0Osv\\u011btim - Auschwitz.<br \\/> V\\u0161ichni \\u00fa\\u010dastn\\u00edci tohoto z\\u00e1jezdu m\\u011bli mo\\u017enost prohl\\u00e9dnout si jak koncentra\\u010dn\\u00ed t\\u00e1bor Auschwitz I., tak i vyhlazvac\\u00ed t\\u00e1bor Auschwitz II. -\\u00a0 Birkenau.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Osv\\u011btim (n\\u011bmecky Auschwitz, polsky O\\u015bwi\\u0119cim) je asi \\u010dty\\u0159tis\\u00edcov\\u00e9 m\\u011bste\\u010dko v\\u00a0ji\\u017en\\u00edm Polsku. Za druh\\u00e9 sv\\u011btov\\u00e9 v\\u00e1lky bylo pohlceno rozp\\u00ednaj\\u00edc\\u00ed se n\\u011bmeckou \\u201e\\u0158\\u00ed\\u0161\\u00ed\\u201c. Br\\u00e1na t\\u00e1bora s n\\u00e1pisem \\\"Arbeit macht frei\\\" (pr\\u00e1ce osvobozuje) je\\u00a0dnes nejzn\\u00e1m\\u011bj\\u0161\\u00edm symbolem\\u00a0Auschwitz.<br \\/> Birkenau polsky Brzezinka\\u00a0je vesnice p\\u0159ibli\\u017en\\u011b 3 kilometry od m\\u011bsta Osv\\u011btim. B\\u011bhem druh\\u00e9 sv\\u011btov\\u00e9 v\\u00e1lky byla vesnice anektov\\u00e1na T\\u0159et\\u00ed \\u0159\\u00ed\\u0161\\u00ed a p\\u0159ejmenov\\u00e1na na Birkemau. Na jej\\u00edm \\u00fazem\\u00ed od \\u0159\\u00edjna 1941 vyrostl nacistick\\u00fd vyhlazovac\\u00ed t\\u00e1bor\\u00a0Auschwitz - Birkenau, resp. jeho v\\u00fdstavba Auschwitz II - Birkenau. Obyvatelstvo B\\u0159ezinky bylo vys\\u00eddleno a domy byly p\\u0159estav\\u011bny nebo rozebr\\u00e1ny a pou\\u017eity pro pot\\u0159eby t\\u00e1bora.<br \\/> Zde jsme si v\\u0161ichni uv\\u011bdomili hr\\u016fzy 2. sv\\u011btov\\u00e9 v\\u00e1lky.<\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":868,\"asset_id\":999,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('878', 'com_content.article.869', '', '2026-09-10 22:20:32', '140', '2928', 'ed457e5de59bf8025d928c92164ae08e70dd8a49', '{\"title\":\"Rychlovka na Karlov\\u011b most\\u011b a bojovka na Kamp\\u011b - 2.B\",\"alias\":\"rychlovka-na-karlove-moste-a-bojovka-na-kampe-2-b\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2024-04-22 17:51:59\",\"publish_up\":\"2024-04-22 17:51:59\",\"ordering\":104,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Rychlovka na Karlov\\u011b most\\u011b a bojovka na Kamp\\u011b - 2.B<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/Praha.jpg\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/Praha.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"600\\\" \\/><\\/a><br \\/>\\u00a0The trip to Prague was nice. We got to know much interesting information. The tour guide was very kind to us. We played a game during the tour. We were answering different questions. For every correct answer we got one coin or one diamond. We liked the route because we were going over the Charles Bridge and we saw many interesting buildings. The route ended in Kampa Park where we played another game. We were running around the park and getting other interesting information. The best part was when we could touch the babies\\u00b4 asses. After the game we counted the coins and the diamonds, and we said our goodbyes. It was very nice, and we learnt a lot of information.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Tom\\u00e1\\u0161 H., Viki F., Dominika G.<\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":869,\"asset_id\":1000,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('879', 'com_content.article.870', '', '2026-09-10 22:20:32', '140', '6723', '655994af95f9325d57a439bfde7751239bbb148b', '{\"title\":\"Obhajoby studentsk\\u00fdch firem \",\"alias\":\"obhajoby-studentskych-firem\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2024-04-22 18:00:08\",\"publish_up\":\"2024-04-22 18:00:08\",\"ordering\":103,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Obhajoby studentsk\\u00fdch firem <\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/Firmy\\/Firma.jpg\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/Firmy\\/Firma.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"600\\\"><\\/a><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/Firmy\\/Firma_2.jpg\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/Firmy\\/Firma_2.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"600\\\"><\\/a><br>\\u00a0<span style=\\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">V\\u00a0tomto \\u0161koln\\u00edm roce 3. ro\\u010dn\\u00edky studijn\\u00edch obor\\u016f Cestovn\\u00ed ruch a Ekonomick\\u00e9 lyceum zalo\\u017eily studentsk\\u00e9 firmy v\\u00a0programu Junior Achievement (JA) a to pod veden\\u00edm pan\\u00ed u\\u010ditelky J.Galbov\\u00e9 a S.Sharplesov\\u00e9. C\\u00edlem tohoto projektu je propojit teoretick\\u00e9 znalosti z\\u00edskan\\u00e9 z\\u00a0v\\u00fduky s\\u00a0t\\u011bmi praktick\\u00fdmi. Studenti si pod veden\\u00edm u\\u010ditel\\u016f zalo\\u017eili studentsk\\u00e9 firmy na z\\u00e1klad\\u011b pr\\u016fzkumu trhu a podnikatelsk\\u00e9ho z\\u00e1m\\u011bru. Rozd\\u011blili si funkce ve sv\\u00fdch firm\\u00e1ch a vydali se na cestu podnik\\u00e1n\\u00ed. V\\u00a0prosinci 2023 se z\\u00fa\\u010dastnili veletrhu studentsk\\u00fdch firem JA v\\u00a0Hradci Kr\\u00e1lov\\u00e9. B\\u011bhem \\u0161koln\\u00edho roku zrealizovali n\\u011bkolik prodejn\\u00edch akc\\u00ed, d\\u00edky kter\\u00fdm v\\u0161echny firmy ukon\\u010dily svoji \\u010dinnost v zisku. V\\u00a0t\\u00e9to chv\\u00edli maj\\u00ed studentsk\\u00e9 firmy za sebou<span style=\\\"mso-spacerun: yes;\\\">\\u00a0 <\\/span>sv\\u00e9 prezentace spojen\\u00e9 s obhajobou p\\u0159ed hodnot\\u00edc\\u00ed komis\\u00ed a to i v anglick\\u00e9m jazyce. Do konce \\u0161koln\\u00edho roku je\\u0161t\\u011b studenty \\u010dek\\u00e1 pr\\u00e1ce na hospod\\u00e1\\u0159sk\\u00e9 uz\\u00e1v\\u011brce, vypracov\\u00e1n\\u00ed v\\u00fdro\\u010dn\\u00ed zpr\\u00e1vy a likvidace firem. P\\u0159\\u00ed\\u0161t\\u00ed \\u0161koln\\u00ed rok bude zah\\u00e1jen t\\u00edm, \\u017ee leto\\u0161n\\u00ed absolventi p\\u0159edaj\\u00ed sv\\u00e9 zku\\u0161enosti dal\\u0161\\u00edm student\\u016fm, kter\\u00e9 zalo\\u017een\\u00ed a realizace studentsk\\u00fdch firme teprve \\u010dek\\u00e1.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Toto byly leto\\u0161n\\u00ed studentsk\\u00e9 firmy:<br><\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\\\"><strong style=\\\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\\\">MR.SCRUBS<br><\\/strong><\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\\\"><em style=\\\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal;\\\">\\u201eNebu\\u010f srab, kup si n\\u00e1\\u0161 scrub\\u201c<br><\\/em><\\/span><span style=\\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">(t\\u011blov\\u00fd scrub, scrub na rty)<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\\\"><strong style=\\\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\\\">NATURAL ORIGINALS<br><\\/strong><\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\\\"><em style=\\\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal;\\\">\\u201eS na\\u0161\\u00ed sladkost\\u00ed, zmiz\\u00ed v\\u00e1m starosti\\u201c<br><\\/em><\\/span><span style=\\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">(d\\u017eemy, cookies, o\\u0159echy v medu, PB balls)<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\\\"><strong style=\\\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\\\">MERKUROVY SVA\\u010cINKY<br><\\/strong><\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\\\"><em style=\\\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal;\\\">\\u201eSta\\u010d\\u00ed Merkurovi o j\\u00eddlo napsat a radost\\u00ed bude\\u0161 hopsat\\u201c<br><\\/em><\\/span><span style=\\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">(sva\\u010dinky)<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\\\"><strong style=\\\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\\\">N\\u00c1RAMKY ARMELLA<br><\\/strong><\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\\\"><em style=\\\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal;\\\">\\u201eElegance po ruce\\u201c<br><\\/em><\\/span><span style=\\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">(n\\u00e1ramky z\\u00a0kor\\u00e1lk\\u016f)<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":870,\"asset_id\":1001,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('880', 'com_content.article.871', '', '2026-09-10 22:20:33', '140', '5074', 'f34069fc0ebb3e379e98cb464a913aa8507fc62e', '{\"title\":\"Odborn\\u00e9 praxe Cestovn\\u00edho ruchu - 2.B a 3.B\",\"alias\":\"odborne-praxe-cestovniho-ruchu-3-b\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2024-04-26 17:57:45\",\"publish_up\":\"2024-04-26 17:57:45\",\"ordering\":102,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Odborn\\u00e9 praxe Cestovn\\u00edho ruchu - 3.B<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/prx.jpg\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/prx.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"600\\\"><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"text-align: justify; line-height: 13.8pt; background: white;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">V<span style=\\\"font-size: 14px;\\\"> r\\u00e1mci v\\u00fdjezdn\\u00ed praxe t\\u0159\\u00eddy 2.B oboru Cestovn\\u00ed ruch jsme v\\u00a0posledn\\u00edch dvou t\\u00fddnech nav\\u0161t\\u00edvili m\\u011bsta Trutnov, Nov\\u00e9 M\\u011bsto nad Metuj\\u00ed, N\\u00e1chod a Rychnov nad Kn\\u011b\\u017enou. Sou\\u010d\\u00e1st\\u00ed t\\u00e9to praxe nebylo jen prov\\u00e1zen\\u00ed od na\\u0161ich spolu\\u017e\\u00e1k\\u016f, ale tak\\u00e9 vytvo\\u0159en\\u00ed itiner\\u00e1\\u0159e, harmonogramu a excerp\\u010dn\\u00edho l\\u00edstku. Tuto formu jsme za\\u017eili poprv\\u00e9 a u\\u017e se t\\u011b\\u0161\\u00edme na dal\\u0161\\u00ed prohl\\u00eddky p\\u0159\\u00ed\\u0161t\\u00ed rok, proto\\u017ee n\\u00e1m to dalo nejen mnoho nov\\u00fdch zku\\u0161enost\\u00ed, ale tak\\u00e9 jsme se dozv\\u011bd\\u011bli nov\\u00e9 informace a m\\u011bli jsme mo\\u017enost nav\\u0161t\\u00edvit m\\u011bsta v\\u00a0okol\\u00ed.<br><\\/span><\\/span><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">S\\u00e1ra a Nella, 2.B<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 150%; background: white;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 150%; background: white;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: \'Arial\', sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 14px;\\\">Sou\\u010d\\u00e1st\\u00ed t\\u0159et\\u00edho ro\\u010dn\\u00edku odborn\\u00fdch prax\\u00ed Cestovn\\u00edho ruchu jsou tak\\u00e9 v\\u00fdjezdn\\u00ed praxe, tentokr\\u00e1t u\\u017e ale do v\\u011bt\\u0161\\u00edch m\\u011bst. B\\u011bhem dubna jsme nav\\u0161t\\u00edvili Jarom\\u011b\\u0159 a Josefov, Broumov, Dv\\u016fr Kr\\u00e1lov\\u00e9 nad Labem, Pardubice a Hradec Kr\\u00e1lov\\u00e9. Je\\u0161t\\u011b ne\\u017e jsme se do m\\u011bst vydali, tak na\\u0161i spolu\\u017e\\u00e1ci, kte\\u0159\\u00ed dan\\u00e9 m\\u011bsto prov\\u00e1zeli, si museli ud\\u011blat p\\u0159\\u00edpravu (nap\\u0159. harmonogram \\u010di excerp\\u010dn\\u00ed l\\u00edstky). Tyto v\\u00fdjezdn\\u00ed praxe u\\u017e pro n\\u00e1s novinkou nebyly, p\\u0159esto jsme se nau\\u010dili n\\u011bco nov\\u00e9ho a u\\u017eite\\u010dn\\u00e9ho. Jako posledn\\u00ed m\\u011bsto, kter\\u00e9 na podzim nav\\u0161t\\u00edv\\u00edme v r\\u00e1mci v\\u00fdjezdn\\u00edch prax\\u00ed, bude na\\u0161e hlavn\\u00ed m\\u011bsto - Praha. Jeliko\\u017e to jsou na\\u0161e posledn\\u00ed praxe, kdy prov\\u00e1d\\u00edme m\\u011bsta, tak jsme si to moc u\\u017eili a doufejme, \\u017ee jsme si to i po\\u0159\\u00e1dn\\u011b p\\u0159ipravili k maturit\\u011b na p\\u0159\\u00ed\\u0161t\\u00ed rok.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family: \'Arial\', sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 14px;\\\"> <br><\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family: \'Arial\', sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 14px;\\\">Stella Ruprechtov\\u00e1 3.B<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":871,\"asset_id\":1002,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('881', 'com_content.article.872', '', '2026-09-10 22:20:33', '140', '3604', '21e0ee4d7dbf2792e2db848746a24b544af0541c', '{\"title\":\"UNESCO - projektov\\u00fd t\\u00fdden\",\"alias\":\"unesco-projektovy-tyden\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2024-04-26 18:48:16\",\"publish_up\":\"2024-04-26 18:48:16\",\"ordering\":101,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">UNESCO - projektov\\u00fd t\\u00fdden<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/UNESCO.jpg\\\"><img style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/UNESCO.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"600\\\" \\/><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<table style=\\\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 99.9695%;\\\" border=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<tbody>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td style=\\\"width: 14.0279%;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/td>\\r\\n<td style=\\\"width: 14.0279%;\\\"><video controls=\\\"controls\\\" width=\\\"300\\\" height=\\\"150\\\">\\r\\n<source src=\\\"images\\/video\\/2024\\/Hate Speech.mp4\\\" type=\\\"video\\/mp4\\\" \\/><\\/video><\\/td>\\r\\n<td style=\\\"width: 14.0279%;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/td>\\r\\n<td style=\\\"width: 14.0279%;\\\"><video controls=\\\"controls\\\" width=\\\"300\\\" height=\\\"150\\\">\\r\\n<source src=\\\"images\\/video\\/2024\\/UNESCO Bed\\u0159ich Smetana.mp4\\\" type=\\\"video\\/mp4\\\" \\/><\\/video><\\/td>\\r\\n<td style=\\\"width: 14.0279%;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/td>\\r\\n<td style=\\\"width: 14.0279%;\\\"><video controls=\\\"controls\\\" width=\\\"300\\\" height=\\\"150\\\">\\r\\n<source src=\\\"images\\/video\\/2024\\/UNESCO WATER 2024.mp4\\\" type=\\\"video\\/mp4\\\" \\/><\\/video><\\/td>\\r\\n<td style=\\\"width: 14.0264%;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody>\\r\\n<\\/table>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Jako \\u010dlensk\\u00e1 \\u0161kola s\\u00edt\\u011b \\u0161kol UNESCO jsme uskute\\u010dnili n\\u00e1\\u0161 projektov\\u00fd t\\u00fdden. V\\u00a0r\\u00e1mci tohoto projektu byly pro na\\u0161e studenty p\\u0159ipraveny prezentace, kter\\u00e9 povedli vybran\\u00ed \\u017e\\u00e1ci a p\\u0159edstavili dan\\u00e1 t\\u00e9mata UNESCO pro tento rok:<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Hate speech a medi\\u00e1ln\\u00ed v\\u00fdchova<br \\/>200. v\\u00fdro\\u010d\\u00ed narozen\\u00ed Bed\\u0159icha Smetany<br \\/>Voda\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":872,\"asset_id\":1003,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('882', 'com_content.article.873', '', '2026-09-10 22:20:34', '140', '6138', '51e18e3c35d8830901a12f80c4cdbccfd52b2e25', '{\"title\":\"ERASMUS+ metodick\\u00e9 kurzy pro u\\u010ditele\",\"alias\":\"erasmus-metodicke-kurzy-pro-ucitele\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2024-03-30 16:16:04\",\"publish_up\":\"2024-03-30 18:15:32\",\"ordering\":100,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">ERASMUS+ metodick\\u00e9 kurzy pro u\\u010ditele<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/Erasmus.jpg\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/Erasmus.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"600\\\"><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 12px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Pro obdob\\u00ed \\u010derven 2023 a\\u017e listopad 2024 byl na\\u0161\\u00ed \\u0161kole ACADEMIA MERCURII schv\\u00e1len projekt ERASMUS+ s\\u00a0n\\u00e1zvem <em style=\\\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal;\\\">\\u201eRozvoj kompetenc\\u00ed u\\u010ditel\\u016f \\u2013 kl\\u00ed\\u010d k evropsk\\u00e9 \\u0161kole 21. stolet\\u00ed\\u201c.<\\/em> C\\u00edlem tohoto projektu je zapojen\\u00ed na\\u0161\\u00ed \\u0161koly do mezin\\u00e1rodn\\u00ed spolupr\\u00e1ce v\\u00a0oblasti vys\\u00edl\\u00e1n\\u00ed \\u017e\\u00e1k\\u016f na pracovn\\u00ed st\\u00e1\\u017ee do zahrani\\u010d\\u00ed tak, aby \\u017e\\u00e1ci zv\\u00fd\\u0161ili svou konkurence schopnost na evropsk\\u00e9m trhu pr\\u00e1ce. V prvn\\u00ed f\\u00e1zi projektu se projekt zam\\u011b\\u0159uje na zv\\u00fd\\u0161en\\u00ed jazykov\\u00fdch a metodick\\u00fdch kompetenc\\u00ed na\\u0161ich vyu\\u010duj\\u00edc\\u00edch. Projekt odstartoval v\\u00fdjezdem Mgr. Dany Jarol\\u00edmov\\u00e9 \\u0159editelky \\u0161koly na metodick\\u00fd kurz <em style=\\\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal;\\\">Project Based Learning<\\/em> do Dublinu (Irsko) a byl n\\u00e1sledov\\u00e1n Mgr. Ivanou \\u0160imkovou koordin\\u00e1torkou projektu ERASMUS+ do Valety (Malta) na metodick\\u00fd kurz <em style=\\\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal;\\\">Advanced Digital Technology in the Classroom.<\\/em><\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 12px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\"><em style=\\\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal;\\\">Advanced Digital Technology in the Classroom<\\/em> je metodick\\u00fd kurz, kter\\u00fd aktualizuje v\\u011bdomosti u\\u010ditele v oblasti e-learningu tak, aby vyu\\u010duj\\u00edc\\u00ed um\\u011bl maxim\\u00e1ln\\u011b vyu\\u017e\\u00edvat<span style=\\\"mso-spacerun: yes;\\\">\\u00a0 <\\/span>potenci\\u00e1l sv\\u00fdch student\\u016f v oblasti IT a stal se tak prost\\u0159edkem k nejlep\\u0161\\u00edm vzd\\u011bl\\u00e1vac\\u00edm v\\u00fdsledk\\u016fm. Pomoc\\u00ed praktick\\u00fdch cvi\\u010den\\u00ed se u\\u010ditel\\u00e9 nau\\u010dili, jak vytvo\\u0159it interaktivn\\u00ed hodiny za pou\\u017eit\\u00ed z\\u00e1kladn\\u00edch, ale i pokro\\u010dil\\u00fdch funkc\\u00ed online n\\u00e1stroj\\u016f a aplikac\\u00ed. Nau\\u010dili se tak\\u00e9 hodnotit validitu t\\u011bchto n\\u00e1stroj\\u016f a zv\\u00e1\\u017eit jejich p\\u0159\\u00ednos a potencion\\u00e1ln\\u00ed \\u00faskal\\u00ed.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\"><em style=\\\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/em><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 12px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\"><em style=\\\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal;\\\">Project Based Learning<\\/em> je tak\\u00e9 metodick\\u00fd kurz pro u\\u010ditele, jeho\\u017e zaveden\\u00edm ve v\\u00fduce se zvy\\u0161uje kompetence student\\u016f v\\u00a0oblasti \\u0159e\\u0161en\\u00ed probl\\u00e9m\\u016f, jejich komunika\\u010dn\\u00edch schopnost\\u00ed a vyu\\u017e\\u00edv\\u00e1n\\u00ed IT technologi\\u00ed. Jedn\\u00e1 se o kompetence, kter\\u00e9 studenti tolik pot\\u0159ebuj\\u00ed pro pr\\u00e1ci na projektech a p\\u0159i mezin\\u00e1rodn\\u00ed spolupr\\u00e1ci.<span style=\\\"mso-spacerun: yes;\\\">\\u00a0 <\\/span>Pro studenty m\\u00e1 tento zp\\u016fsob veden\\u00ed v\\u00fduky i nad\\u010dasov\\u00fd c\\u00edl a to je zv\\u00fd\\u0161en\\u00ed jejich konkurence schopnosti na trhu pr\\u00e1ce.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 12px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Mgr. Dana Jarol\\u00edmov\\u00e1<br><\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">\\u0159editelka \\u0161koly<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":873,\"asset_id\":1004,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('883', 'com_content.article.874', '', '2026-09-10 22:20:34', '140', '4259', '1adbb764f65d157adced738be92a5a299e6aa1d0', '{\"title\":\"ERASMUS+ - st\\u00ednov\\u00e1n\\u00ed Madrid\",\"alias\":\"erasmus-stinovani-madrid\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2024-03-30 20:16:44\",\"publish_up\":\"2024-03-30 20:16:53\",\"ordering\":99,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">ERASMUS+ - st\\u00ednov\\u00e1n\\u00ed Madrid<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/Madrid.jpg\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/Madrid.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"600\\\"><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">V\\u00a0\\u0159\\u00edjnu 2023 na\\u0161e \\u0161kola uskute\\u010dnila 2. \\u010d\\u00e1st projektu ERASMUS+ <em style=\\\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal;\\\">\\u201eRozvoj kompetenc\\u00ed u\\u010ditel\\u016f \\u2013 kl\\u00ed\\u010d k evropsk\\u00e9 \\u0161kole 21. stolet\\u00ed\\u201c.<\\/em> Tentokr\\u00e1t se jednalo o st\\u00ednov\\u00e1n\\u00ed (Job Shadowing) na \\u0161pan\\u011blsk\\u00e9 st\\u0159edn\\u00ed \\u0161kole IES JOAQUIN TURINA v\\u00a0Madridu. T\\u0159i na\\u0161i u\\u010ditel\\u00e9 ciz\\u00edch jazyk\\u016f, vyu\\u010duj\\u00edc\\u00ed anglick\\u00fd jazyk a \\u0161pan\\u011blsk\\u00fd jazyk, chodili na n\\u00e1slechy v\\u00fduky anglick\\u00e9ho jazyka, ale i dal\\u0161\\u00edch ciz\\u00edch jazyk\\u016f a tak\\u00e9 do v\\u00fduky p\\u0159edm\\u011bt\\u016f v\\u00a0anglick\\u00e9m jazyce. Toto bilingvn\\u00ed gymn\\u00e1zium m\\u00e1 s\\u00a0v\\u00fdukou b\\u011b\\u017en\\u00fdch p\\u0159edm\\u011bt\\u016f v\\u00a0anglick\\u00e9m jazyce mnohalet\\u00e9 zku\\u0161enosti a 90% student\\u016f spole\\u010dn\\u011b s dosa\\u017eenou maturitou z\\u00edsk\\u00e1 na konci sv\\u00e9ho studia tak\\u00e9 certifik\\u00e1t cambridgesk\\u00e9 zkou\\u0161ky bu\\u010f na \\u00farovni B2 nebo C1. Tyto n\\u00e1slechy v\\u00fduky tj. \\u201est\\u00ednov\\u00e1n\\u00ed\\u201c byly pro na\\u0161e vyu\\u010duj\\u00edc\\u00ed velmi p\\u0159\\u00ednosn\\u00e9 a to i proto, \\u017ee realizace cambridgesk\\u00fdch zkou\\u0161ek je na\\u0161\\u00edm c\\u00edlem a r\\u00e1di bychom je od \\u0161koln\\u00edho roku 2024\\/2025 zprost\\u0159edkov\\u00e1vali pro na\\u0161e studenty p\\u0159\\u00edmo v\\u00a0na\\u0161\\u00ed \\u0161kole.<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 12px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 12px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Dana Jarol\\u00edmov\\u00e1<br><\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">\\u0159editelka \\u0161koly<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":874,\"asset_id\":1005,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('884', 'com_content.article.875', '', '2026-09-10 22:20:35', '140', '3339', '29c1d75ecdeac4b4aec0808ec78acbd6d83b2dad', '{\"title\":\"Cambridgesk\\u00e9 zkou\\u0161ky p\\u0159\\u00edmo v na\\u0161\\u00ed \\u0161kole\",\"alias\":\"cambridgeske-zkousky-primo-v-nasi-skole\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2024-05-14 17:32:12\",\"publish_up\":\"2024-05-14 17:32:12\",\"ordering\":98,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Cambridgesk\\u00e9 zkou\\u0161ky p\\u0159\\u00edmo v na\\u0161\\u00ed \\u0161kole<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/Academia Mercurii logo hR.jpg\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/Academia Mercurii logo hR.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"636\\\"><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Stali jsme se partnerskou \\u0161kolou jazykov\\u00e9 \\u0161koly Evropsk\\u00e9 vzd\\u011bl\\u00e1vac\\u00ed centrum v Hradci Kr\\u00e1lov\\u00e9. Na\\u0161i studenti, ale i ve\\u0159ejnost budou moci skl\\u00e1dat Cambridgesk\\u00e9 zkou\\u0161ky p\\u0159\\u00edmo v na\\u0161\\u00ed \\u0161kole a to ji\\u017e v p\\u0159\\u00ed\\u0161t\\u00edm \\u0161koln\\u00edm roce 2024\\/2025. V r\\u00e1mci spolupr\\u00e1ce bude pro na\\u0161e studenty organizov\\u00e1na jak p\\u0159\\u00edprava na zkou\\u0161ky, tak tak\\u00e9 zkou\\u0161ky nane\\u010disto. V\\u011b\\u0159\\u00edme, \\u017ee tato ud\\u00e1lost posune v\\u00fduku anglick\\u00e9ho jazyka na na\\u0161\\u00ed \\u0161kole op\\u011bt o krok d\\u00e1l.<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-fareast-language: CS;\\\">Dana Jarol\\u00edmov\\u00e1<br><\\/span><span style=\\\"mso-fareast-language: CS;\\\">\\u0159editelka \\u0161koly<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<div>\\u00a0<\\/div>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":875,\"asset_id\":1006,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
