or\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul id=\\\"md_attachments_td\\\" class=\\\"composer-attachments\\\" style=\\\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; list-style: none; width: 1080.44px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(237, 243, 247); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><\\/ul>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/dokumenty\\/2024\\/Prijimacky\\/Tabulka_VYHODNOCEN\\u00cd_CR_po\\u0159ad\\u00ed-P\\u0158IJAT-NEP\\u0158IJAT-\\u0160KOLA-WEB.pdf\\\">Tabulka VYHODNOCEN\\u00cd CR<\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/dokumenty\\/2024\\/Prijimacky\\/Tabulka_VYHODNOCEN\\u00cd_EL_po\\u0159ad\\u00ed-P\\u0158IJAT-NEP\\u0158IJAT-\\u0160KOLA-WEB.pdf\\\">Tabulka VYHODNOCEN\\u00cd EL<\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/dokumenty\\/2024\\/Prijimacky\\/Tabulka_VYHODNOCEN\\u00cd_EL-SM_po\\u0159ad\\u00ed-P\\u0158IJAT-NEP\\u0158IJAT-\\u0160KOLA-WEB.pdf\\\">Tabulka VYHODNOCEN\\u00cd EL-SM<\\/a><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":876,\"asset_id\":1007,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('886', 'com_content.article.877', '', '2026-09-10 22:20:36', '140', '3433', 'fcca3a7d80a38fa57cf5f89e2396b1c55f606c87', '{\"title\":\"Odborn\\u00e9 praxe cestovn\\u00edho ruchu - pr\\u016fvodcovsk\\u00e1 \\u010dinnost\",\"alias\":\"odborne-praxe-cestovniho-ruchu-pruvodcovska-cinnost\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2024-05-23 15:51:04\",\"publish_up\":\"2024-05-23 15:51:04\",\"ordering\":97,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Odborn\\u00e9 praxe cestovn\\u00edho ruchu - pr\\u016fvodcovsk\\u00e1 \\u010dinnost<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/Praxe.jpg\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/Praxe.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"600\\\"><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Na\\u0161i studenti cestovn\\u00edho ruchu pos\\u00edlaj\\u00ed pozdravy z pr\\u00e1v\\u011b prob\\u00edhaj\\u00edc\\u00edch odborn\\u00fdch prax\\u00ed na hradech a z\\u00e1mc\\u00edch po cel\\u00e9 \\u010desk\\u00e9 republice, zde konkr\\u00e9tn\\u011b ze z\\u00e1mk\\u016f: Lednice, Lemberk, Ro\\u017emberk, T\\u0159ebo\\u0148, \\u017dleby a Nov\\u00e9 M\\u011bsto nad Metuj\\u00ed. Na t\\u011bchto prax\\u00edch\\u00a0na\\u0161i studenti od 1. do 3. ro\\u010dn\\u00edku prov\\u00e1z\\u00ed\\u00a0n\\u00e1v\\u0161t\\u011bvn\\u00edky\\u00a0interi\\u00e9ry i exteri\\u00e9ry hrad\\u016f, z\\u00e1mk\\u016f a tak\\u00e9 nap\\u0159\\u00edklad pevnost\\u00ed \\u010di kl\\u00e1\\u0161ter\\u016f. D\\u00e9lka praxe je minim\\u00e1ln\\u011b t\\u0159i t\\u00fddny, av\\u0161ak mnoho na\\u0161ich student\\u016f je na prax\\u00edch cel\\u00fd m\\u011bs\\u00edc.<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Na\\u0161im praktikant\\u016fm dr\\u017e\\u00edme palce a p\\u0159ejeme jim a\\u0165 je pro n\\u011b jejich praxe jak p\\u0159\\u00ednosn\\u00e1, tak a\\u0165 si ji tak\\u00e9 u\\u017eij\\u00ed!<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":877,\"asset_id\":1008,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
