('889', 'com_content.article.880', '', '2026-09-10 22:20:37', '140', '4009', '780be6cae5a482679191e23113188675a4794dc1', '{\"title\":\"Kurz pro instruktory FITNESS \",\"alias\":\"licence-fitness-instruktora-pro-nase-studenty\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2024-06-30 15:45:05\",\"publish_up\":\"2024-06-30 15:45:05\",\"ordering\":96,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Kurz pro instruktory FITNESS <\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/Fit_instruktor.jpg\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/Fit_instruktor.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"600\\\"><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Ve dnech 17. - 21. \\u010dervna uspo\\u0159\\u00e1dala na\\u0161e \\u0161kola kurz pro z\\u00edsk\\u00e1n\\u00ed FITNESS licenc\\u00ed pro na\\u0161e studenty.<span style=\\\"mso-spacerun: yes;\\\">\\u00a0 <\\/span>Kurz pro n\\u00e1s zrealizovalo vzd\\u011bl\\u00e1vac\\u00ed st\\u0159edisko BP SPORT s.r.o. Licenci z\\u00edskalo celkem 17 student\\u016f a to od 2. do 4. ro\\u010dn\\u00edku. I kdy\\u017e byl kurz p\\u016fvodn\\u011b p\\u0159ipraven pro studenty oboru Sportovn\\u00ed management, z\\u00fa\\u010dastnilo se ho i p\\u00e1r sportovn\\u011b zalo\\u017een\\u00fdch z\\u00e1jemc\\u016f z\\u00a0\\u0159ad Ekonomick\\u00e9ho lycea. Vedouc\\u00ed kurzu byla pan\\u00ed Mgr. Lucie \\u0160ormov\\u00e1, kter\\u00e9 touto cestou moc d\\u011bkujeme.<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\"><em style=\\\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal;\\\">Hodnocen\\u00ed kurz Mgr. \\u0160ormov\\u00e9:<br><\\/em><em style=\\\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal;\\\">\\u201eBylo mi pot\\u011b\\u0161en\\u00edm u v\\u00e1s pracovat. Studenti byli velmi aktivn\\u00ed a jejich projeven\\u00fd z\\u00e1jem o tuto oblast vytvo\\u0159il velmi p\\u0159\\u00edjemnou atmosf\\u00e9ru. \\u201e<\\