lass=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">M\\u016f\\u017ee\\u0161 podnikat<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/MP.jpg\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/MP.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"600\\\"><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; background: white;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; font-family: \'Arial\', sans-serif; color: black;\\\">Dne 12. 6. se v\\u00a0na\\u0161\\u00ed \\u0161kole uskute\\u010dnil vzd\\u011bl\\u00e1vac\\u00ed program \\\"M\\u016f\\u017ee\\u0161 podnikat\\\". Studenti t\\u0159\\u00eddy 2. A studijn\\u00edch obor\\u016f Ekonomick\\u00e9 lyceum a Sportovn\\u00ed management m\\u011bli mo\\u017enost vyslechnout podnikatelsk\\u00e9 p\\u0159\\u00edb\\u011bhy pana Ji\\u0159\\u00edho Volence a pana Jana \\u0160koln\\u00edka. Oba p\\u00e1nov\\u00e9 dok\\u00e1zali vt\\u00e1hnout na\\u0161e studenty do diskuze a uk\\u00e1zali jim, \\u017ee s dostatkem trp\\u011blivosti a vytrvalosti, lze dos\\u00e1hnout v\\u00edc, ne\\u017e je na prvn\\u00ed pohled z\\u0159ejm\\u00e9.<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":887,\"asset_id\":1018,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('897', 'com_content.article.888', '', '2026-09-10 22:20:41', '140', '5128', '9ba6c157291218354f181dc3de7328ce095766c1', '{\"title\":\"D\\u011btsk\\u00e1 animace pro n\\u00e1chodsk\\u00e9 \\u0161kolky\",\"alias\":\"detska-animace-pro-nachodske-skolky\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2024-06-26 17:12:59\",\"publish_up\":\"2024-06-26 17:12:49\",\"ordering\":88,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">D\\u011btsk\\u00e1 animace pro n\\u00e1chodsk\\u00e9 \\u0161kolky<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/MP.jpg\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/Skolky\\/1.skolky.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"600\\\"><\\/a><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/Skolky\\/2.skolky.jpg\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/Skolky\\/2.skolky.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"600\\\"><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; background: white;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; font-family: \'Arial\', sans-serif; color: black;\\\">Ve dnech 24. - 26. \\u010dervna studenti na\\u0161\\u00ed \\u0161koly ze t\\u0159\\u00edd 1. B, 2. B a 3. B oboru cestovn\\u00ed ruch p\\u0159ipravili d\\u011btskou animaci pro n\\u00e1chodsk\\u00e9 \\u0161kolky. Jednalo se o mate\\u0159skou \\u0161kolu B\\u0159ezinova, Al\\u0161ova a Havl\\u00ed\\u010dkova - Plhov. Pro \\u201e\\u0161kolkov\\u00e9\\u201c d\\u011bti bylo nachyst\\u00e1no dev\\u011bt nau\\u010dn\\u00fdch stanovi\\u0161\\u0165, kde ka\\u017ed\\u00fd koutek p\\u0159edstavoval jeden st\\u00e1t. Zem\\u011b byly vybr\\u00e1ny podle jazyk\\u016f, kter\\u00e9 se na na\\u0161\\u00ed \\u0161kole vyu\\u010duj\\u00ed, a p\\u0159id\\u00e1ny byly dal\\u0161\\u00ed \\u010dty\\u0159i zem\\u011b, kter\\u00e9 jsou pro d\\u011bti atraktivn\\u00ed. Jednalo se o zem\\u011b: \\u010cesk\\u00e1 republika, Anglie, N\\u011bmecko, \\u0160pan\\u011blsko, Francie, It\\u00e1lie, Polsko, USA a Japonsko. Studenti na\\u0161\\u00ed \\u0161koly si pro d\\u011bti p\\u0159ipravili r\\u016fzn\\u00e9 pom\\u016fcky, se\\u00a0kter\\u00fdmi pak dan\\u00e9 zem\\u011b p\\u0159edstavili. \\u00a0Tento projekt m\\u011bl op\\u011bt velk\\u00fd \\u00fasp\\u011bch jak na stran\\u011b mate\\u0159sk\\u00fdch \\u0161kol, tak na stran\\u011b na\\u0161\\u00ed st\\u0159edn\\u00ed \\u0161koly. Setk\\u00e1n\\u00ed t\\u011bchto dvou generac\\u00ed a vz\\u00e1jemn\\u00e9 p\\u0159ed\\u00e1v\\u00e1n\\u00ed informac\\u00ed bylo velk\\u00fdm z\\u00e1\\u017eitkem pro v\\u0161echny z\\u00fa\\u010dastn\\u011bn\\u00e9. Tuto akci jsme uspo\\u0159\\u00e1dali ji\\u017e \\u010dtvrt\\u00fdm rokem a stala se tak na\\u0161\\u00ed tradi\\u010dn\\u00ed aktivitou pro studenty cestovn\\u00edho ruchu.<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; background: white;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; font-family: \'Arial\', sans-serif; color: black;\\\">V\\u0161em z\\u00fa\\u010dastn\\u011bn\\u00fdm d\\u011bkujeme a t\\u011b\\u0161\\u00edme se op\\u011bt na p\\u0159\\u00ed\\u0161t\\u00ed \\u0161koln\\u00ed rok!<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; background: white;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; font-family: \'Arial\', sans-serif; color: black;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"margin: 0cm; background: white;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; font-family: \'Arial\', sans-serif; color: black;\\\">Igor Chmela\\u0159 a Mgr. Judita Jir\\u00e1skov\\u00e1 Galbov\\u00e1<br>vyu\\u010duj\\u00edc\\u00ed odborn\\u00fdch p\\u0159edm\\u011bt\\u016f cestovn\\u00edho ruchu<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; background: white;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; font-family: \'Arial\', sans-serif; color: black;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":888,\"asset_id\":1019,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('898', 'com_content.article.889', '', '2026-09-10 22:20:41', '140', '4019', 'e3827ee52bbc80216d59c606919716d6efc22884', '{\"title\":\"Beseda s Davidem Posp\\u00ed\\u0161ilem\",\"alias\":\"beseda-s-davidem-pospisilem\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2024-06-29 20:03:50\",\"publish_up\":\"2024-06-29 20:03:43\",\"ordering\":87,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Beseda s Davidem Posp\\u00ed\\u0161ilem<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/Besada.jpg\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2024\\/Besada.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"600\\\"><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"text-align: justify; background: white;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5);\\\">Dne 27. 6. nav\\u0161t\\u00edvil na\\u0161i \\u0161kolu David Posp\\u00ed\\u0161il, b\\u00fdval\\u00fd hokejov\\u00fd hr\\u00e1\\u010d a nyn\\u00ed zn\\u00e1m\\u00fd koment\\u00e1tor televizn\\u00edch hokejov\\u00fdch p\\u0159enos\\u016f<span style=\\\"mso-no-proof: yes;\\\">.<\\/span> Se studenty, ne jen Sportovn\\u00edho managementu, uspo\\u0159\\u00e1dal besedu, kde se d\\u00edky jeho velk\\u00fdm zku\\u0161enostem v oblasti aktivn\\u00edho sportu diskutovalo o motivaci ke sportu, o p\\u0159\\u00e1telstv\\u00edch a emoc\\u00edch ve sportovn\\u00edm sv\\u011bt\\u011b, ale tak\\u00e9 o intenzit\\u011b vrcholov\\u00fdch tr\\u00e9nink\\u016f a o mnoha jin\\u00fdch t\\u00e9matech a z\\u00e1\\u017eitc\\u00edch. Dal\\u0161\\u00edmi kapitolami pak bylo, jak komentov\\u00e1n\\u00ed z\\u00e1pas\\u016f, se kter\\u00fdm m\\u00e1 David Posp\\u00ed\\u0161il bohat\\u00e9 zku\\u0161enosti, tak tak\\u00e9 jeho hereck\\u00e1 kari\\u00e9ra.<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"text-align: justify; background: white;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5);\\\">Besedu s panem Posp\\u00ed\\u0161ilem n\\u00e1m zprost\\u0159edkoval pan starosta Jan Birke, kter\\u00fd se tak\\u00e9 osobn\\u011b ujmul cel\\u00e9ho moderov\\u00e1n\\u00ed.<br><\\/span><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5);\\\">Ob\\u011bma p\\u00e1n\\u016fm t\\u00edmto moc d\\u011bkujeme za v\\u00fdjime\\u010dn\\u00fd z\\u00e1\\u017eitek \\u2013 moc si toho v\\u00e1\\u017e\\u00edme!<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; background: white;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; font-family: \'Arial\', sans-serif; color: black;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":889,\"asset_id\":1020,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
