('921', 'com_content.article.912', '', '2026-09-10 22:20:51', '140', '4284', '6374d9df6cd6281698f708fd06d07a23f2dee0d3', '{\"title\":\" Veletrh studentsk\\u00fdch firem\",\"alias\":\"veletrh-studentskych-firem-2\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2025-01-07 19:24:31\",\"publish_up\":\"2025-01-07 19:24:31\",\"ordering\":74,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"> Veletrh studentsk\\u00fdch firem<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2025\\/JAfirma.jpg\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2025\\/JAfirma.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"600\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Ji\\u017e tradi\\u010dn\\u011b se v prosinci konal Veletrh JA studentsk\\u00fdch firem v Hradci Kr\\u00e1lov\\u00e9. Cel\\u00e1 akce se konala ve VIP z\\u00f3n\\u011b Mal\\u0161ovick\\u00e9ho fotbalov\\u00e9ho stadionu. Na\\u0161e \\u0161kola se \\u00fa\\u010dastnila s p\\u011bti studentsk\\u00fdmi firmami. V\\u0161echny firmy se sna\\u017eily usp\\u011bt v jednotliv\\u00fdch sout\\u011b\\u017en\\u00edch kategori\\u00edch v konkurenci v\\u00edce jak 40 dal\\u0161\\u00edch studentsk\\u00fdch firem nejen z \\u010cesk\\u00e9 republiky. Cel\\u00e1 akce je skv\\u011blou zku\\u0161enost\\u00ed a mo\\u017enost\\u00ed porovn\\u00e1n\\u00ed se se sv\\u00fdmi vrstevn\\u00edky. <\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">V sout\\u011b\\u017en\\u00edm kl\\u00e1n\\u00ed se se p\\u0159edstavily tyto firmy \\u2013 MercuriiGo po\\u0159\\u00e1daj\\u00edc\\u00ed jednodenn\\u00ed z\\u00e1jezdy pro studenty, Crunchy Bites vyr\\u00e1b\\u011bj\\u00edc\\u00ed zdrav\\u00e9 mls\\u00e1n\\u00ed, SUSHA nab\\u00edzej\\u00edc\\u00ed su\\u0161enky a pe\\u010den\\u00e9 \\u010daje, Luminous je studentsk\\u00e1 firma, kter\\u00e1 vyr\\u00e1b\\u00ed sv\\u00ed\\u010dky a Aroma Clean nab\\u00edz\\u00ed dezinfekci na ruce. <\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Sou\\u010d\\u00e1st\\u00ed veletrhu byly prezentace jednotliv\\u00fdch firem, sout\\u011b\\u017e o nejlep\\u0161\\u00edho prodejce, o nejlep\\u0161\\u00ed logo, slogan a p\\u0159edm\\u011bt podnik\\u00e1n\\u00ed. Jednou z nejn\\u00e1ro\\u010dn\\u011bj\\u0161\\u00edch sout\\u011b\\u017en\\u00edch discipl\\u00edn byla diskuse s investorem, kter\\u00e1 prob\\u00edhala v anglick\\u00e9m jazyce. V t\\u00e9to kategorii byli na\\u0161i studenti velmi \\u00fasp\\u011b\\u0161n\\u00ed \\u2013 Anna \\u010conkov\\u00e1 z firmy SUSHA z\\u00edskala kr\\u00e1sn\\u00e9 2. m\\u00edsto. V celkov\\u00e9m hodnocen\\u00ed firmy jako celek, se nejl\\u00e9pe um\\u00edstila MercuriiGo, kter\\u00e1 z\\u00edskala 15. m\\u00edsto.\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":912,\"asset_id\":1043,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('922', 'com_content.article.913', '', '2026-09-10 22:20:52', '140', '3074', '7d7f1b22b6b041d2df7d0eea2ebffb3952c45a8e', '{\"title\":\"V\\u00e1no\\u010dn\\u00ed trhy Wroclaw\",\"alias\":\"vanocni-trhy-wroclaw-3\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2025-01-07 19:37:00\",\"publish_up\":\"2025-01-07 19:37:00\",\"ordering\":73,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"> V\\u00e1no\\u010dn\\u00ed trhy Wroclaw<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2025\\/Wroclaw.jpg\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2025\\/Wroclaw.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"600\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">V\\u00e1no\\u010dn\\u00ed atmosf\\u00e9ra a v\\u016fn\\u011b pern\\u00ed\\u010dk\\u016f, pe\\u010den\\u00fdch ka\\u0161tan\\u016f, \\u010di sva\\u0159en\\u00e9ho v\\u00edna, to neodmysliteln\\u011b pat\\u0159\\u00ed k v\\u00e1no\\u010dn\\u00edm trh\\u016fm, a proto i letos na\\u0161e \\u0161kola uspo\\u0159\\u00e1dala z\\u00e1jezd na v\\u00e1no\\u010dn\\u00ed trhy do Wroclawi, kter\\u00fd se uskute\\u010dnil 13. 12. 2024. Trhy nab\\u00edzej\\u00ed jedine\\u010dn\\u00fd v\\u00e1no\\u010dn\\u00ed sortiment, kulin\\u00e1\\u0159sk\\u00e9 speciality, ale tak\\u00e9 bohat\\u00fd kulturn\\u00ed program. Wroclaw je n\\u00e1dhern\\u00e9 historick\\u00e9 m\\u011bsto, kter\\u00e9 m\\u00e1 kouzelnou atmosf\\u00e9ru v adventn\\u00edm \\u010dase. V\\u0161e jsme si s dobrou n\\u00e1ladou a zimn\\u00edm po\\u010das\\u00ed moc u\\u017eili.\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":913,\"asset_id\":1044,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('923', 'com_content.article.914', '', '2026-09-10 22:20:52', '140', '3864', '1c49948796abfb0073218409aad821d9e3a07579', '{\"title\":\"\\u010cesk\\u00e1 n\\u00e1rodn\\u00ed banka - 3.A a 3.B\",\"alias\":\"ceska-narodni-banka-3-a-a-3-b\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2025-01-07 19:44:02\",\"publish_up\":\"2025-01-07 19:44:02\",\"ordering\":72,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"> \\u010cesk\\u00e1 n\\u00e1rodn\\u00ed banka - 3.A a 3.B<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2025\\/CNB.jpg\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2025\\/CNB.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"600\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">N\\u00e1v\\u0161t\\u011bva \\u010cesk\\u00e9 n\\u00e1rodn\\u00ed banky - 3. ro\\u010dn\\u00edky <\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">\\u010cesk\\u00e1 n\\u00e1rodn\\u00ed banka (\\u010cNB) je kl\\u00ed\\u010dovou instituc\\u00ed, kter\\u00e1 ovliv\\u0148uje chod \\u010desk\\u00e9 ekonomiky. Na\\u0161e p\\u0159edv\\u00e1no\\u010dn\\u00ed n\\u00e1v\\u0161t\\u011bva t\\u00e9to budovy, nach\\u00e1zej\\u00edc\\u00ed se v centru Prahy, n\\u00e1m nab\\u00eddla jedine\\u010dn\\u00fd pohled na funkce a v\\u00fdznam centr\\u00e1ln\\u00ed banky. Vstupn\\u00ed hala \\u010cNB n\\u00e1s okouzlila svou kr\\u00e1snou architekturou a bohatou histori\\u00ed. Sou\\u010d\\u00e1st\\u00ed n\\u00e1v\\u0161t\\u011bvy byla interaktivn\\u00ed expozice, kter\\u00e1 n\\u00e1m umo\\u017enila vyzkou\\u0161et si ov\\u011b\\u0159ov\\u00e1n\\u00ed pravosti bankovek nebo pochopit z\\u00e1klady m\\u011bnov\\u00e9 politiky. Tak\\u00e9 jsme se dozv\\u011bd\\u011bli jak ovliv\\u0148uje inflaci, kurzy m\\u011bn a finan\\u010dn\\u00ed stabilitu zem\\u011b. Praktick\\u00e9 \\u00fakoly a simulace p\\u0159ibl\\u00ed\\u017eily pr\\u00e1ci centr\\u00e1ln\\u00ed banky a uk\\u00e1zaly, jak\\u00fd vliv m\\u00e1 na ka\\u017edodenn\\u00ed \\u017eivot lid\\u00ed. Tato prohl\\u00eddka se n\\u00e1m velmi l\\u00edbila a r\\u00e1di bychom v budoucnu nav\\u0161t\\u00edvili tak\\u00e9 prohl\\u00eddku prostor\\u016f trezoru. <\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">(Nikol Hospod\\u00e1\\u0159ov\\u00e1, 3. A)\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":914,\"asset_id\":1045,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('924', 'com_content.article.915', '', '2026-09-10 22:20:53', '140', '3138', '3dd18ee66ee2db27d619e5894a350af6e8fdd09c', '{\"title\":\"Krajsk\\u00e9 kolo ekonomick\\u00e9 olympi\\u00e1dy\",\"alias\":\"krajske-kolo-ekonomicke-olympiady-2\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2025-01-14 17:49:53\",\"publish_up\":\"2025-01-14 17:49:53\",\"ordering\":71,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Krajsk\\u00e9 kolo ekonomick\\u00e9 olympi\\u00e1dy<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2025\\/EKO.jpg\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2025\\/EKO.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"600\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Dne 8. ledna 2025 se vybran\\u00ed studenti na\\u0161\\u00ed \\u0161koly z\\u00fa\\u010dastnili krajsk\\u00e9ho kola ekonomick\\u00e9 olympi\\u00e1dy. Jedn\\u00e1 se o presti\\u017en\\u00ed sout\\u011b\\u017e pro st\\u0159edo\\u0161kol\\u00e1ky, kter\\u00e1 podporuje z\\u00e1jem mlad\\u00fdch lid\\u00ed o ekonomii a rozv\\u00edj\\u00ed analytick\\u00e9 my\\u0161len\\u00ed. Sout\\u011b\\u017en\\u00ed kl\\u00e1n\\u00ed prob\\u011bhlo mezi mlad\\u00fdmi ekonomy z cel\\u00e9ho Kr\\u00e1lov\\u00e9hradeck\\u00e9ho kraje. Na\\u0161i \\u0161kolu reprezentovali Sofiia Badaieva ze 3.A a Anton\\u00edn Vik z 1.B. <\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">D\\u011bkujeme za v\\u00fdbornou reprezentaci \\u0161koly a p\\u0159ejeme jim mnoho dal\\u0161\\u00edch \\u00fasp\\u011bch\\u016f.\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":915,\"asset_id\":1046,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
