s\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Na\\u0161e prvn\\u00ed Cambridgesk\\u00e9 zkou\\u0161ky<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2025\\/CB.jpg\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2025\\/CB.jpg\\\" width=\\\"700\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">10. 2. 2025 byl den, kdy se na na\\u0161\\u00ed \\u0161kole poprv\\u00e9 v historii konaly Cambridgesk\\u00e9 zkou\\u0161ky. Ostr\\u00fdm zkou\\u0161k\\u00e1m p\\u0159edch\\u00e1zely testy zku\\u0161ebn\\u00ed 25. 11. 2024, studenti si tedy\\u00a0mohli na z\\u00e1klad\\u011b sv\\u00fdch v\\u00fdsledk\\u016f rozmyslet, kdo z nich k ostr\\u00e9mu testov\\u00e1n\\u00ed p\\u016fjde. Zkou\\u0161ek nane\\u010disto se celkem z\\u00fa\\u010dastnilo 32 \\u017e\\u00e1k\\u016f, z \\u010deho\\u017e bylo 20 na zkou\\u0161ku First \\u00farovn\\u011b B2 a 12 na zkou\\u0161ku Advanced \\u00farovn\\u011b C1. Ostr\\u00fdch zkou\\u0161ek se ve fin\\u00e1le z\\u00fa\\u010dastnilo 22 student\\u016f, 17 zkou\\u0161ky First\\u00a0a 5 zkou\\u0161ky Advanced. V\\u00fdbornou zpr\\u00e1vou je, \\u017ee v\\u0161ichni studenti zkou\\u0161ku slo\\u017eili. V\\u0161em gratulujeme!<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Dana Jarol\\u00edmov\\u00e1<br><\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">\\u0159editelka \\u0161koly<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":925,\"asset_id\":1056,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('935', 'com_content.article.926', '', '2026-09-10 22:20:58', '140', '4097', '5488cd3e0f0c6a6e028d370371c8f7b0f39d81ab', '{\"title\":\"HOLIDAY WORLD - veletrh cestovn\\u00edho ruchu 2025\",\"alias\":\"holiday-world-veletrh-cestovniho-ruchu-2025\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2025-03-29 17:39:24\",\"publish_up\":\"2025-03-29 17:39:24\",\"ordering\":63,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">HOLIDAY WORLD - veletrh cestovn\\u00edho ruchu 2025<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2025\\/HW.jpg\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2025\\/HW.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Mezin\\u00e1rodn\\u00ed veletrh cestovn\\u00edho ruchu a region\\u00e1ln\\u00ed turistiky HOLIDAY WORLD &amp; REGION WORLD se uskute\\u010dnil ve dnech\\u00a014.\\u00a0- 16.\\u00a0b\\u0159ezna 2025\\u00a0op\\u011bt v are\\u00e1lu PVA EXPO Let\\u0148any, pod taktovkou po\\u0159adatelsk\\u00e9 spole\\u010dnosti ABF. Jedn\\u00e1 se o nejv\\u00fdznamn\\u011bj\\u0161\\u00ed akci sv\\u00e9ho druhu nejen v\\u00a0\\u010cesk\\u00e9 republice, ale i v\\u00a0regionu st\\u0159edn\\u00ed Evropy.<\\/span><br><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Pod veden\\u00edm pana u\\u010ditele Igora Chmela\\u0159e a pan\\u00ed u\\u010ditelky Mgr. Judity Jir\\u00e1skov\\u00e9 Galbov\\u00e9 se \\u017e\\u00e1ci 1. a\\u017e 4. ro\\u010dn\\u00edku z\\u00fa\\u010dastnili tohoto unik\\u00e1tn\\u00edho veletrhu cestovn\\u00edho ruchu.<\\/span><br><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Studenti si m\\u011bli mo\\u017enost prohl\\u00e9dnout st\\u00e1nky cestovn\\u00edch kancel\\u00e1\\u0159\\u00ed z r\\u016fzn\\u00fdch kout\\u016f sv\\u011bta, \\u010desk\\u00fdch i zahrani\\u010dn\\u00edch. Sou\\u010d\\u00e1st\\u00ed veletrhu byla tak\\u00e9 studentsk\\u00e1 sout\\u011b\\u017e \\u201eZpropaguj sv\\u00e9 m\\u011bsto\\u201c, kter\\u00e9 se z\\u00fa\\u010dastnil i n\\u00e1\\u0161 \\u0161koln\\u00ed t\\u00fdm, kter\\u00fd propagoval v\\u00edkend v\\u00a0Hradci Kr\\u00e1lov\\u00e9. Cel\\u00e1 akce byla velice informa\\u010dn\\u011b p\\u0159\\u00ednosn\\u00e1 a obohatila n\\u00e1s v\\u0161echny ve vyu\\u010dovan\\u00e9m oboru Cestovn\\u00ed ruch.<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Igor Chmela\\u0159<\\/span><br><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">u\\u010ditel odborn\\u00fdch p\\u0159edm\\u011bt\\u016f<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":926,\"asset_id\":1057,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('936', 'com_content.article.927', '', '2026-09-10 22:20:58', '140', '3182', '738236e3f6a422dcc9d27b65c150cd9085daa14d', '{\"title\":\"Ly\\u017ea\\u0159sk\\u00fd v\\u00fdcvik 2.A\",\"alias\":\"lyzarsky-vycvik-2-a\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2025-03-29 17:37:18\",\"publish_up\":\"2025-03-29 17:37:18\",\"ordering\":62,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Ly\\u017ea\\u0159sk\\u00fd v\\u00fdcvik 2.A<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2025\\/LZ_2.jpg\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2025\\/LZ_2.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"600\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Prvn\\u00ed b\\u0159eznov\\u00fd t\\u00fdden byl ve znamen\\u00ed ly\\u017ea\\u0159sk\\u00e9ho kurzu t\\u0159\\u00eddy 2.A v Peci pod Sn\\u011b\\u017ekou. V\\u00fdborn\\u00e9 z\\u00e1zem\\u00ed s kvalitn\\u00ed stravou a hlavn\\u011b kr\\u00e1sn\\u00fdm po\\u010das\\u00edm a skv\\u011bl\\u00fdmi sn\\u011bhov\\u00fdmi podm\\u00ednkami, p\\u0159isp\\u011blo k pod\\u00e1v\\u00e1n\\u00ed v\\u00fdborn\\u00fdch ly\\u017ea\\u0159sk\\u00fdch v\\u00fdkon\\u016f, jak na ly\\u017e\\u00edch, tak na snowboardu.<br><\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Za t\\u0159\\u00eddu 2.A d\\u011bkujeme pedagog\\u016fm a person\\u00e1lu Havlovy chaty za kr\\u00e1sn\\u011b str\\u00e1ven\\u00e9 ly\\u017ea\\u0159sk\\u00e9 dny v t\\u0159\\u00eddn\\u00ed part\\u011b.\\u00a0\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">T\\u0159\\u00edda 2.A\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":927,\"asset_id\":1058,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('937', 'com_content.article.928', '', '2026-09-10 22:20:58', '140', '2876', 'e317e67c9fbeefc944291725bfe7547289c0e2f1', '{\"title\":\"Studenti 1.A a 1.B v akci \\\"Ukli\\u010fme \\u010cesko\\\"\",\"alias\":\"studenti-1-a-a-1-b-v-akci-uklidme-cesko\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2025-04-17 18:00:01\",\"publish_up\":\"2025-04-17 18:00:01\",\"ordering\":60,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Studenti 1.A a 1.B v akci \\\"Ukli\\u010fme \\u010cesko\\\"<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2025\\/Uklid.jpg\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2025\\/Uklid.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"600\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Na\\u0161i studenti 1.A a 1.B se 11. 4. 2025 z\\u00fa\\u010dastnili pod veden\\u00edm sv\\u00e9ho t\\u0159\\u00eddn\\u00edho u\\u010ditele Ing. Jana Sr\\u0161n\\u011b celost\\u00e1tn\\u00ed akce Ukli\\u010fme \\u010cesko. \\u00daklidu odpadk\\u016f se v\\u011bnovali hlavn\\u011b v okol\\u00ed n\\u00e1chodsk\\u00e9ho z\\u00e1mku. Budeme doufat, \\u017ee uklizen\\u00e9 prost\\u0159ed\\u00ed vydr\\u017e\\u00ed co nejd\\u00e9le a n\\u00e1v\\u0161t\\u011bvn\\u00edci tak uvid\\u00ed n\\u00e1\\u0161 kr\\u00e1sn\\u00fd N\\u00e1chod v tom nejlep\\u0161\\u00edm sv\\u011btle.<br><\\/span><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":928,\"asset_id\":1059,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('938', 'com_content.article.929', '', '2026-09-10 22:20:59', '140', '3008', '34e426e14132bb0e8c87f6bc4248a629165deccc', '{\"title\":\"Exkurze 2.A do \\u010disti\\u010dky odpadn\\u00edch vod v Bra\\u017eci\",\"alias\":\"exkurze-2-a-do-cisticky-odpadnich-vod-v-brazci\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2025-04-17 18:06:28\",\"publish_up\":\"2025-04-17 18:06:28\",\"ordering\":59,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Exkurze 2.A do \\u010disti\\u010dky odpadn\\u00edch vod v Bra\\u017eci<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2025\\/Cisticka.jpg\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2025\\/Cisticka.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"600\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Ekologicko - biologick\\u00e1 exkurze 2.A do \\u010disti\\u010dky odpadn\\u00edch vod v N\\u00e1chod\\u011b - Bra\\u017eci. Sledovali jsme zaj\\u00edmavou a dlouhou cestu zne\\u010di\\u0161t\\u011bn\\u00e9 vody na\\u0161ich dom\\u00e1cnost\\u00ed a\\u017e k jej\\u00edmu \\u00fapln\\u00e9mu vy\\u010di\\u0161t\\u011bn\\u00ed. <br><\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Dozv\\u011bd\\u011bli jsme se, \\u017ee kl\\u00ed\\u010dov\\u00fdmi hr\\u00e1\\u010di p\\u0159i procesu \\u010di\\u0161t\\u011bn\\u00ed jsou p\\u0159\\u00e1telsk\\u00e9 bakterie, kter\\u00e9 jsou schopn\\u00e9 zbavit vodu o 99% ne\\u010distot.\\u00a0<br><\\/span><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":929,\"asset_id\":1060,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('939', 'com_content.article.930', '', '2026-09-10 22:20:59', '140', '6553', '1e16f6c5485c82ecb20a3fca60eb779b9715337c', '{\"title\":\" Amsterdam - Antverpy - Cambridge - Lond\\u00fdn --> pozn\\u00e1vac\\u00ed z\\u00e1jezd\",\"alias\":\"amsterdam-antverpy-cambridge-londyn-poznavaci-zajezd\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2025-04-17 18:16:30\",\"publish_up\":\"2025-04-17 18:16:30\",\"ordering\":58,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"> Amsterdam - Antverpy - Cambridge - Lond\\u00fdn --&gt; pozn\\u00e1vac\\u00ed z\\u00e1jezd<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2025\\/Anglie\\/1.jpg\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2025\\/Anglie\\/1.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"600\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2025\\/Anglie\\/2.jpg\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2025\\/Anglie\\/2.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"600\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2025\\/Anglie\\/3.jpg\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2025\\/Anglie\\/3.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"600\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Od 10. do 15. dubna se na\\u0161e \\u0161kola vydala na nezapomenuteln\\u00fd pozn\\u00e1vac\\u00ed z\\u00e1jezd do Anglie. Cestu jsme si zpest\\u0159ili dv\\u011bma kr\\u00e1sn\\u00fdmi zast\\u00e1vkami \\u2013 v Nizozemsku a Belgii.<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Po prvn\\u00ed noci str\\u00e1ven\\u00e9 v autobusu jsme za sv\\u00edt\\u00e1n\\u00ed dorazili do slune\\u010dn\\u00e9ho Amsterdamu. Pro\\u0161li jsme se centrem m\\u011bsta a u\\u017eili si p\\u0159\\u00edjemnou proj\\u00ed\\u017e\\u010fku lod\\u00ed po kan\\u00e1lech. Siln\\u00fdm z\\u00e1\\u017eitkem byla n\\u00e1v\\u0161t\\u011bva muzea Anny Frankov\\u00e9 \\u2013 \\u017eidovsk\\u00e9 d\\u00edvky, kter\\u00e1 b\\u011bhem nacistick\\u00e9 okupace psala den\\u00edk pln\\u00fd emoc\\u00ed, my\\u0161lenek a nad\\u011bje. Jej\\u00ed p\\u0159\\u00edb\\u011bh se hluboce dotkl n\\u00e1s v\\u0161ech.<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">N\\u00e1sleduj\\u00edc\\u00ed den jsme zav\\u00edtali do belgick\\u00fdch Antverp, kde n\\u00e1s uchv\\u00e1tila kr\\u00e1sa hlavn\\u00edho vlakov\\u00e9ho n\\u00e1dra\\u017e\\u00ed. N\\u011bkte\\u0159\\u00ed z n\\u00e1s nav\\u0161t\\u00edvili i zdej\\u0161\\u00ed majest\\u00e1tn\\u00ed katedr\\u00e1lu Panny Marie. Pot\\u00e9 jsme pokra\\u010dovali do francouzsk\\u00e9ho Calais, odkud jsme se trajektem p\\u0159epravili do Velk\\u00e9 Brit\\u00e1nie.<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">V Anglii jsme se ubytovali v hostitelsk\\u00fdch rodin\\u00e1ch, se kter\\u00fdmi jsme str\\u00e1vili p\\u0159\\u00edjemn\\u00e9 ve\\u010dery. Na\\u0161\\u00ed prvn\\u00ed zast\\u00e1vkou byl nult\\u00fd poledn\\u00edk v Greenwichi. Krom\\u011b kr\\u00e1sn\\u00e9 observato\\u0159e jsme se zde mohli kochat i \\u00fachvatn\\u00fdmi v\\u00fdhledy na cel\\u00fd Lond\\u00fdn. Ten sam\\u00fd den jsme nav\\u0161t\\u00edvili tak\\u00e9 proslul\\u00e9 univerzitn\\u00ed m\\u011bsto Cambridge, kde jsme si prohl\\u00e9dli v\\u00fdznamnou kapli King\'s College a n\\u011bkte\\u0159\\u00ed z n\\u00e1s zav\\u00edtali i do m\\u00edstn\\u00edch muze\\u00ed zoologie nebo archeologie.<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">N\\u00e1sleduj\\u00edc\\u00ed den jsme se vydali do centra Lond\\u00fdna, kde jsme v\\u00fdlet zah\\u00e1jili \\u00fa\\u017easnou plavbou po Tem\\u017ei. D\\u00edky na\\u0161\\u00ed skv\\u011bl\\u00e9 pan\\u00ed pr\\u016fvodkyni jsme nep\\u0159i\\u0161li o \\u017e\\u00e1dnou v\\u00fdznamnou pam\\u011btihodnost. Vid\\u011bli jsme Big Ben, Tower Bridge \\u010di Buckinghamsk\\u00fd pal\\u00e1c. Na zn\\u00e1m\\u00e9m Trafalgarsk\\u00e9m n\\u00e1m\\u011bst\\u00ed jsme obdivovali nejen divadeln\\u00ed oblast West End, ale tak\\u00e9 sochy Mr. Beana nebo medv\\u00eddka Paddingtona, se kter\\u00fdmi jsme se r\\u00e1di vyfotili.<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Ze z\\u00e1jezdu jsme se vr\\u00e1tili pln\\u00ed kr\\u00e1sn\\u00fdch vzpom\\u00ednek, nov\\u00fdch poznatk\\u016f a p\\u0159edev\\u0161\\u00edm z\\u00e1\\u017eitk\\u016f, na kter\\u00e9 budeme je\\u0161t\\u011b dlouho vzpom\\u00ednat. D\\u011bkujeme za tuto skv\\u011blou p\\u0159\\u00edle\\u017eitost a u\\u017e te\\u010f se t\\u011b\\u0161\\u00edme na dal\\u0161\\u00ed z\\u00e1jezd!<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Za Academia Mercurii \\u2013 Mat\\u011bj Petr, \\u017e\\u00e1k 1.B.<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":930,\"asset_id\":1061,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('940', 'com_content.article.931', '', '2026-09-10 22:21:00', '140', '2966', 'bc71f3ebed7051d9af81acfa15af68eaad51b9a8', '{\"title\":\"D\\u011bjepisn\\u00e1 exkurze Tutanchamon Praha - 1.B\",\"alias\":\"dejepisna-exkurze-tutanchamon-praha-1-b\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2025-04-22 19:09:37\",\"publish_up\":\"2025-04-22 19:09:37\",\"ordering\":57,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">D\\u011bjepisn\\u00e1 exkurze Tutanchamon Praha - 1.B<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2025\\/TCH.jpg\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2025\\/TCH.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"600\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">V \\u00fater\\u00fd 8. dubna nav\\u0161t\\u00edvila t\\u0159\\u00edda 1. B v\\u00fdstavu Tutanchamon na pra\\u017esk\\u00e9m V\\u00fdstavi\\u0161ti na Letn\\u00e9. Studenti vid\\u011bli poh\\u0159ebn\\u00ed komory a poklady tohoto faraona, kter\\u00e9 byly uspo\\u0159\\u00e1dan\\u00e9 p\\u0159esn\\u011b tak, jak je p\\u0159ed v\\u00edce ne\\u017e 100 lety objevil archeolog Howard Carter. D\\u00edky audiopr\\u016fvodci jsme se dozv\\u011bd\\u011bli spoustu zaj\\u00edmav\\u00fdch informac\\u00ed o starov\\u011bk\\u00e9m Egypt\\u011b za vl\\u00e1dy Tutanchamona, co\\u017e n\\u00e1m skv\\u011ble doplnilo v\\u00fduku d\\u011bjepisu v tomto \\u0161koln\\u00edm roce.<br><\\/span><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":931,\"asset_id\":1062,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('941', 'com_content.article.932', '', '2026-09-10 22:21:00', '140', '3889', 'be1a6d166b38dbdcc39c7a3d428678dd3289912e', '{\"title\":\"Beseda s basketbalistkou Veronikou \\u0160\\u00edpovou\",\"alias\":\"beseda-s-basketbalistkou-veronikou-sipovou\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2025-05-01 18:40:07\",\"publish_up\":\"2025-05-01 18:40:07\",\"ordering\":56,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Beseda s basketbalistkou Veronikou \\u0160\\u00edpovou<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2025\\/Basket.jpg\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2025\\/Basket.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"600\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">V pond\\u011bl\\u00ed 28. dubna se na na\\u0161\\u00ed \\u0161kole konala beseda s basketbalistkou Veronikou \\u0160\\u00edpovou, \\u010deskou reprezentantkou a hr\\u00e1\\u010dkou USK Praha, \\u010derstvou v\\u00edt\\u011bzkou \\u010desk\\u00e9 i evropsk\\u00e9 ligy. Besedy se z\\u00fa\\u010dastnili \\u017e\\u00e1ci sportovn\\u00edho managementu 1. a\\u017e 3. ro\\u010dn\\u00edku.\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">B\\u011bhem setk\\u00e1n\\u00ed jsme si pov\\u00eddali nejen o basketbalu, ale tak\\u00e9 o d\\u016fle\\u017eitosti vzd\\u011bl\\u00e1n\\u00ed, p\\u0159echodu z profesion\\u00e1ln\\u00ed sportovn\\u00ed kari\\u00e9ry do civiln\\u00edho \\u017eivota a o osobn\\u00edch zku\\u0161enostech ze sportovn\\u00edho i studijn\\u00edho prost\\u0159ed\\u00ed. Veronika je z\\u00e1rove\\u0148 studentkou vysok\\u00e9 \\u0161koly, a tak mohla \\u017e\\u00e1k\\u016fm p\\u0159ibl\\u00ed\\u017eit, jak skloubit vrcholov\\u00fd sport se studiem.\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">P\\u0159ivezla tak\\u00e9 uk\\u00e1zat sv\\u00e9 zlat\\u00e9 medaile z \\u010desk\\u00e9 i evropsk\\u00e9 ligy.\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Po skon\\u010den\\u00ed besedy z\\u016fstala Veronika i na posledn\\u00ed hodinu se \\u017e\\u00e1ky 3.A, kdy si s nimi \\u010d\\u00e1st hodiny pov\\u00eddala a pot\\u00e9 si spole\\u010dn\\u011b zahr\\u00e1li basketbal.\\u00a0<br><\\/span><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":932,\"asset_id\":1063,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0');
