('943', 'com_content.article.934', '', '2026-09-10 22:21:57', '140', '4872', '953cbe6ab17ee1e2df4f0d9130a8baa78a55e87a', '{\"title\":\" Projektov\\u00fd den t\\u0159\\u00eddy 1.A k mezin\\u00e1rodn\\u00edmu roku ochrany ledovc\\u016f\",\"alias\":\"projektovy-den-tridy-1-a-k-mezinarodnimu-roku-ochrany-ledovcu\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2025-05-21 13:20:56\",\"publish_up\":\"2025-05-21 13:20:56\",\"ordering\":54,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"> Projektov\\u00fd den t\\u0159\\u00eddy 1.A k mezin\\u00e1rodn\\u00edmu roku ochrany ledovc\\u016f<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2025\\/Ledovce.jpg\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2025\\/Ledovce.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"600\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Ve t\\u0159\\u00edd\\u011b 1.A jsme se b\\u011bhem projektov\\u00e9ho dne pono\\u0159ili do t\\u00e9matu, kter\\u00e9 je st\\u00e1le aktu\\u00e1ln\\u011bj\\u0161\\u00ed \\u2013 t\\u00e1n\\u00ed ledovc\\u016f. Na za\\u010d\\u00e1tku jsme absolvovali osobnostn\\u00ed test, kter\\u00fd n\\u00e1m pomohl rozd\\u011blit se do t\\u0159\\u00ed t\\u00fdm\\u016f podle na\\u0161ich p\\u0159irozen\\u00fdch talent\\u016f \\u2013 \\u0159e\\u010d, psan\\u00ed a grafika.\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">T\\u00fdm grafik\\u016f se postaral o vizu\\u00e1ln\\u00ed str\\u00e1nku projektu \\u2013 vytvo\\u0159il velkou n\\u00e1st\\u011bnnou mapu sv\\u011bta, na kter\\u00e9 barevn\\u00fdmi zna\\u010dkami vyzna\\u010dil ledovce podle jejich stavu (zdrav\\u00fd, ohro\\u017een\\u00fd, zanikl\\u00fd). Spodn\\u00ed \\u010d\\u00e1st n\\u00e1st\\u011bnky pak v\\u011bnovali vyhl\\u00e1\\u0161en\\u00e9 \\u0161koln\\u00ed v\\u00fdzv\\u011b, o kter\\u00e9 se dozv\\u00edte n\\u00ed\\u017ee. T\\u00fdm pisatel\\u016f vytvo\\u0159il sborn\\u00edk mizej\\u00edc\\u00edch ledovc\\u016f, ve kter\\u00e9m ke ka\\u017ed\\u00e9mu ledovci z mapy p\\u0159ipojil z\\u00e1kladn\\u00ed informace o jeho poloze, aktu\\u00e1ln\\u00edm stavu a o d\\u016fsledc\\u00edch jeho t\\u00e1n\\u00ed pro okoln\\u00ed p\\u0159\\u00edrodu i \\u010dlov\\u011bka.\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">T\\u00fdm \\u0159e\\u010dn\\u00edk\\u016f p\\u0159ipravil poutavou prezentaci, ve kter\\u00e9 sezn\\u00e1mil ostatn\\u00ed \\u017e\\u00e1ky \\u0161koly s problematikou t\\u00e1n\\u00ed ledovc\\u016f, jeho p\\u0159\\u00ed\\u010dinami a d\\u016fsledky. Z\\u00e1rove\\u0148 vyhl\\u00e1sil v\\u00fdzvu \\u201eZ\\u00e1chrana ledovce\\u201c \\u2013 ka\\u017ed\\u00fd, kdo b\\u011bhem dne ud\\u011bl\\u00e1 n\\u011bco pro \\u017eivotn\\u00ed prost\\u0159ed\\u00ed, si vezme modr\\u00fd pap\\u00edrek (symbol kry) a p\\u0159ip\\u00edchne jej na n\\u00e1st\\u011bnn\\u00fd ledovec jako symbol jeho obnovy. <\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Cel\\u00fd projekt spojil znalosti, kreativitu i ak\\u010dn\\u00ed p\\u0159\\u00edstup a uk\\u00e1zal, \\u017ee i mal\\u00e9 \\u010diny mohou v\\u00e9st k velk\\u00fdm zm\\u011bn\\u00e1m.\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">T\\u0159\\u00edda 1.A\\u00a0<br><\\/span><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":934,\"asset_id\":1065,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('944', 'com_content.article.935', '', '2026-09-10 22:21:58', '140', '3287', '05fb299ab950fb81ef0e464bf542afef9bd8a6c4', '{\"title\":\"V\\u00fdjezdn\\u00ed odborn\\u00e9 praxe cestovn\\u00edho ruchu\",\"alias\":\"vyjezdni-odborne-praxe-cestovniho-ruchu\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2025-05-21 13:26:44\",\"publish_up\":\"2025-05-21 13:26:44\",\"ordering\":53,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">V\\u00fdjezdn\\u00ed odborn\\u00e9 praxe cestovn\\u00edho ruchu<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2025\\/VP.jpg\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2025\\/VP.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"600\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Ji\\u017e tradi\\u010dn\\u011b se v m\\u011bs\\u00edc\\u00edch duben a kv\\u011bten konaly v\\u00fdjezdn\\u00ed odborn\\u00e9 praxe druh\\u00fdch a t\\u0159et\\u00edch ro\\u010dn\\u00edk\\u016f studijn\\u00edho oboru Cestovn\\u00ed ruch. B\\u011bhem t\\u011bchto v\\u00fdjezd\\u016f, m\\u011bli vyu\\u010duj\\u00edc\\u00ed a studenti mo\\u017enost poznat celou \\u0159adu v\\u00fdchodo\\u010desk\\u00fdch m\\u011bst. Spole\\u010dn\\u011b jsme se vydali do Hradce Kr\\u00e1lov\\u00e9, kde jsme krom\\u011b v\\u00fdstupu na B\\u00edlou v\\u011b\\u017e, absolvovali tak\\u00e9 kr\\u00e1tkou n\\u00e1v\\u0161t\\u011bvu elektr\\u00e1rny Hu\\u010d\\u00e1k. V Pardubic\\u00edch jsme mimo jin\\u00e9 obdivovali skv\\u011blou p\\u0159estavbu are\\u00e1lu Automatick\\u00fdch ml\\u00fdn\\u016f. Zav\\u00edtali jsme tak\\u00e9 do Jarom\\u011b\\u0159e a p\\u0159ilehl\\u00e9ho Josefova, do nedaleko le\\u017e\\u00edc\\u00edho Nov\\u00e9ho M\\u011bsta nad Metuj\\u00ed, Trutnova, Broumova a Dvora Kr\\u00e1lov\\u00e9.<br><\\/span><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":935,\"asset_id\":1066,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
