('950', 'com_content.article.941', '', '2026-09-10 22:22:00', '140', '4772', '9bfe33694b6c6ebfc825f252283cfb2b99c69898', '{\"title\":\"Prezentace studentsk\\u00fdch firem  2025 - 3.A (ekonomick\\u00e9 lyceum) a 3.B (cestovn\\u00ed ruch)\",\"alias\":\"prezentace-studentskych-firem-2025-3-a-ekonomicke-lyceum-a-3-b-cestovni-ruch\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2025-06-02 19:31:38\",\"publish_up\":\"2025-06-02 19:31:28\",\"ordering\":51,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Prezentace studentsk\\u00fdch firem 2025 - 3.A (ekonomick\\u00e9 lyceum) a 3.B (cestovn\\u00ed ruch)<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2025\\/JA.jpg\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2025\\/JA.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"600\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">25.4. 2025 byl velk\\u00fd den pro na\\u0161e studentsk\\u00e9 firmy. \\u010clenov\\u00e9 jednotliv\\u00fdch studentsk\\u00fdch firem t\\u0159et\\u00edch ro\\u010dn\\u00edk\\u016f si na tento den p\\u0159ipravili komplexn\\u00ed p\\u0159edstaven\\u00ed sv\\u00fdch podnikatelsk\\u00fdch z\\u00e1m\\u011br\\u016f a prezentace, ve kter\\u00fdch do detailu svoji firmu p\\u0159edstavili a uk\\u00e1zali porot\\u011b, jak jejich podnik\\u00e1n\\u00ed fungovalo, co bylo \\u00fasp\\u011b\\u0161n\\u00e9, n\\u00e1ro\\u010dn\\u00e9 nebo naopak jednoduch\\u00e9, ale hovo\\u0159ili i o tom, co by zm\\u011bnili, pokud by m\\u011bli mo\\u017enost. V tomto \\u0161koln\\u00edm roce u n\\u00e1s ve \\u0161kole p\\u016fsobilo p\\u011bt studentsk\\u00fdch firem s rozmanit\\u00fdmi p\\u0159edm\\u011bty podnik\\u00e1n\\u00ed. Firma Luminous vyr\\u00e1b\\u011bla n\\u00e1padit\\u00e9 sv\\u00ed\\u010dky r\\u016fzn\\u00fdch tvar\\u016f a v\\u016fn\\u00ed, firma SHUSHA nab\\u00edzela \\u0159adu chutn\\u00fdch su\\u0161enek a pe\\u010den\\u00fdch \\u010daj\\u016f. Mezi studentsk\\u00fdmi firmami jsme v tomto roce m\\u011bli i jednu \\u201ccestovn\\u00ed kancel\\u00e1\\u0159\\u201c a tou byla firma MercuriiGo, kter\\u00e1 zavezla na\\u0161e studenty na v\\u00fdlet do Coca Cola v Praze. S velmi chutn\\u00fdm n\\u00e1padem p\\u0159i\\u0161la firma Crunchy Bites, kter\\u00e1 nab\\u00edzela zdrav\\u00e9 mls\\u00e1n\\u00ed v podob\\u011b su\\u0161enek, dom\\u00e1c\\u00ed granoly a m\\u00fcsli ty\\u010dek. Mezi firmami se sv\\u00fdm n\\u00e1padem neztratila ani skupina student\\u016f firmy Aroma Clean, kter\\u00e1 se rozhodla nab\\u00edzet dezinfekci na ruce a to hned v n\\u011bkolika vo\\u0148av\\u00fdch variant\\u00e1ch. <\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Svoje n\\u00e1pady a post\\u0159ehy \\u017e\\u00e1ci prezentovali p\\u0159ed porotou, jej\\u00edmi\\u017e \\u010dleny byli na\\u0161e pan\\u00ed \\u0159editelka Mgr. Dana Jarol\\u00edmov\\u00e1, pan\\u00ed u\\u010ditelky Mgr. Judita Jir\\u00e1skov\\u00e1 Galbov\\u00e1 a Mgr. Sarah Sharplesov\\u00e1 a z podnikatelsk\\u00e9ho sektoru k n\\u00e1m dorazil a v\\u011bnoval sv\\u016fj \\u010das pan Mat\\u011bj Truxa, kter\\u00fd se u\\u017e podruh\\u00e9 osv\\u011bd\\u010dil jako podnikatel, kter\\u00fd dok\\u00e1\\u017ee d\\u00e1t na\\u0161im student\\u016f skv\\u011blou a podn\\u011btnou zp\\u011btnou vazbu.\\u00a0<br><\\/span><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":941,\"asset_id\":1072,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('951', 'com_content.article.942', '', '2026-09-10 22:22:01', '140', '2317', 'e5b78af22fe2349f0679bec83609a7a3292648aa', '{\"title\":\"UNESCO - p\\u0159ed\\u00e1n\\u00ed cen za um\\u00edst\\u011bn\\u00ed ve fotografick\\u00e9 sout\\u011b\\u017ei\",\"alias\":\"unesco-predani-cen-za-umisteni-ve-fotograficke-soutezi\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2025-06-22 08:28:55\",\"publish_up\":\"2025-06-22 08:28:55\",\"ordering\":50,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">UNESCO - p\\u0159ed\\u00e1n\\u00ed cen za um\\u00edst\\u011bn\\u00ed ve fotografick\\u00e9 sout\\u011b\\u017ei<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><video style=\\\"display: table; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; width: 729px; height: 366px;\\\" poster=\\\"\\\" controls=\\\"controls\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"451\\\"> <source src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2025\\/unesco.mp4\\\" type=\\\"video\\/mp4\\\"><\\/video><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":942,\"asset_id\":1073,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('952', 'com_content.article.943', '', '2026-09-10 22:22:01', '140', '1694', '9ca2f4e1ba8483b0458108f274efe3e5b56ff942', '{\"title\":\"1.9. zah\\u00e1jen\\u00ed \\u0161koln\\u00edho roku v 8:00 v budov\\u011b \\u0161koly + focen\\u00ed t\\u0159\\u00edd\",\"alias\":\"1-9-zahajeni-skolniho-roku-v-8-00-v-budove-skoly-foceni-trid\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":10,\"state\":0,\"created\":\"2025-06-22 08:35:42\",\"publish_up\":\"2025-06-22 08:35:42\",\"ordering\":26,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targe