('953', 'com_content.article.944', '', '2026-09-10 22:22:02', '140', '5602', 'cd60097e27a26fcde8ee3b8aeb58e26ca355a8fa', '{\"title\":\"3.A na vod\\u011b: \\u010dty\\u0159i dny, 72 kilometr\\u016f a v\\u0161echny jezy zdol\\u00e1ny\",\"alias\":\"3-a-na-vode-ctyri-dny-72-kilometru-a-vsechny-jezy-zdolany\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2025-06-22 09:08:43\",\"publish_up\":\"2025-06-22 09:08:43\",\"ordering\":49,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">3.A na vod\\u011b: \\u010dty\\u0159i dny, 72 kilometr\\u016f a v\\u0161echny jezy zdol\\u00e1ny<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2025\\/vodak_3.A\\/Vodak_1.jpg\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2025\\/vodak_3.A\\/Vodak_1.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"675\\\"><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2025\\/vodak_3.A\\/Vodak_2.jpg\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2025\\/vodak_3.A\\/Vodak_2.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"675\\\"><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Ve dnech 9.\\u201313. \\u010dervna se t\\u0159\\u00edda 3.A vydala na vod\\u00e1ck\\u00fd kurz na \\u0159eku S\\u00e1zavu, konkr\\u00e9tn\\u011b na kr\\u00e1sn\\u00fd, ale v\\u00fd\\u017eivn\\u00fd \\u00fasek z \\u010cesk\\u00e9ho \\u0160ternberka do Pikovic. B\\u011bhem \\u010dty\\u0159 dn\\u016f na vod\\u011b zdolali celkem 72 kilometr\\u016f, sjeli nespo\\u010det jez\\u016f a pro\\u0161li si rychlokurzem vod\\u00e1ck\\u00e9ho \\u017eivota \\u2013 od techniky p\\u00e1dlov\\u00e1n\\u00ed a\\u017e po um\\u011bn\\u00ed p\\u0159e\\u017e\\u00edt s \\u00fasm\\u011bvem a p\\u00e1dlem v ruce.<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Studenti se b\\u011bhem kurzu nau\\u010dili z\\u00e1klady ovl\\u00e1d\\u00e1n\\u00ed lodi \\u2013 a to jak na pozici h\\u00e1\\u010dka, tak i kormideln\\u00edka. Praktick\\u00e9 dovednosti si ov\\u011b\\u0159ili nejen na \\u0159ece, ale tak\\u00e9 p\\u0159i z\\u00e1bavn\\u00fdch hr\\u00e1ch jako bylo p\\u0159eb\\u00edh\\u00e1n\\u00ed po soulod\\u00edc\\u00edch lod\\u00edch nebo vod\\u00e1ck\\u00e9 honi\\u010dky, kter\\u00e9 prov\\u011b\\u0159ily jejich rovnov\\u00e1hu, rychlost i t\\u00fdmovou spolupr\\u00e1ci (a n\\u011bkdy i suchost oble\\u010den\\u00ed).<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Kurz ale nebyl \\u017e\\u00e1dn\\u00fd odpo\\u010dinkov\\u00fd v\\u00fdlet \\u2013 sp\\u00ed\\u0161 vod\\u00e1ck\\u00e1 v\\u00fdzva pro sportovce t\\u011blem i du\\u0161\\u00ed. Kilometry p\\u0159ib\\u00fdvaly, jezy se st\\u0159\\u00eddaly jeden za druh\\u00fdm\\u2026 A kdy\\u017e u\\u017e si v\\u0161ichni mysleli, \\u017ee posledn\\u00ed den si zaslou\\u017e\\u00ed po\\u0159\\u00e1dn\\u00e9 pe\\u0159eje, elektr\\u00e1rna jim od\\u010derpala vodu a zbylo jen 8 kilometr\\u016f kamen\\u00ed a tah\\u00e1n\\u00ed lod\\u00ed. Ale proto\\u017ee to jsou na\\u0161i borci z 3.A, zvl\\u00e1dli to (skoro) bez rept\\u00e1n\\u00ed.<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Krom\\u011b p\\u00e1dlov\\u00e1n\\u00ed si u\\u017eili i spole\\u010dn\\u00e9 ve\\u010dery v\\u00a0kempech. \\u010cas na odpo\\u010dinek, legraci a pov\\u00edd\\u00e1n\\u00ed (tak\\u00e9 o\\u0161et\\u0159en\\u00ed mozol\\u016f a pop\\u00e1lenin od slun\\u00ed\\u010dka) utu\\u017eoval p\\u0159\\u00e1telstv\\u00ed. A\\u0165 u\\u017e \\u0161lo o spole\\u010dn\\u00e9 va\\u0159en\\u00ed, hran\\u00ed her nebo jen ve\\u010dern\\u00ed posezen\\u00ed u stanu \\u010di ohn\\u011b, t\\u0159\\u00edda fungovala jako sehran\\u00fd t\\u00fdm i mimo \\u0159eku.<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Zkr\\u00e1tka \\u2013 vod\\u00e1k s 3.A byl j\\u00edzda. A i kdy\\u017e se mo\\u017en\\u00e1 n\\u011bkdo r\\u00e1no budil trochu rozl\\u00e1man\\u00fd a ob\\u010das n\\u011bkoho zchladila voda pod jezem, v\\u0161ichni si odnesli z\\u00e1\\u017eitky, kter\\u00e9 vydr\\u017e\\u00ed mnohem d\\u00e9le ne\\u017e promo\\u010den\\u00e9 boty.<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":944,\"asset_id\":1075,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('954', 'com_content.article.945', '', '2026-09-10 22:22:02', '140', '3363', '36546af72aa59ad3114db59b5971caa66423f8aa', '{\"title\":\"Odborn\\u00e9 praxe cestovn\\u00edho ruchu t\\u0159\\u00eddy 3.B\",\"alias\":\"odborne-praxe-cestovniho-ruchu-tridy-3-b\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2025-06-22 10:03:57\",\"publish_up\":\"2025-06-22 10:03:57\",\"ordering\":48,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Odborn\\u00e9 praxe cestovn\\u00edho ruchu t\\u0159\\u00eddy 3.B<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2025\\/Praxe\\/3.B\\/1.jpg\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2025\\/Praxe\\/3.B\\/1.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"675\\\"><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2025\\/Praxe\\/3.B\\/2.jpg\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2025\\/Praxe\\/3.B\\/2.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"675\\\"><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Za t\\u0159\\u00eddu 3.B cestovn\\u00ed ruch pos\\u00edl\\u00e1me pozdravy z\\u00a0odborn\\u00fdch prax\\u00ed na hradech, z\\u00e1mc\\u00edch a pevnostech po cel\\u00e9 \\u010cesk\\u00e9 republice. Prov\\u00e1z\\u00edme od 1. do 3. ro\\u010dn\\u00edku interi\\u00e9ry i exteri\\u00e9ry kulturn\\u011b-historick\\u00fdch objekt\\u016f. Na\\u0161e praxe trv\\u00e1 minim\\u00e1ln\\u011b t\\u0159i t\\u00fddny, ale n\\u011bkte\\u0159\\u00ed z\\u00a0n\\u00e1s jsou na prax\\u00edch i m\\u011bs\\u00edc. Jako v\\u017edy, jsme si praxe u\\u017eili a d\\u011bkujeme kastel\\u00e1n\\u016fm a \\u0161kole za mo\\u017enost z\\u00edskat cenn\\u00e9 zku\\u0161enosti. <\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Roz\\u00e1lie Pavlov\\u00e1, 3.B<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":945,\"asset_id\":1076,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('955', 'com_content.article.946', '', '2026-09-10 22:22:03', '140', '3203', '998a367bbd4bc93eaf5e95301d35b407c3c6bb8e', '{\"title\":\"Odborn\\u00e9 praxe cestovn\\u00edho ruchu t\\u0159\\u00eddy 2.B\",\"alias\":\"odborne-praxe-cestovniho-ruchu-tridy-2-b\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2025-06-22 10:08:47\",\"publish_up\":\"2025-06-22 10:08:47\",\"ordering\":47,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Odborn\\u00e9 praxe cestovn\\u00edho ruchu t\\u0159\\u00eddy 2.B <\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2025\\/Praxe\\/2.B\\/1.jpg\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2025\\/Praxe\\/2.B\\/1.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"675\\\"><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">B\\u011bhem kv\\u011btna a \\u010dervna se op\\u011bt na\\u0161e t\\u0159\\u00edda vydala na m\\u011bs\\u00ed\\u010dn\\u00ed odborn\\u00e9 praxe cestovn\\u00edho ruchu. Rozutekli jsme se na hrady a z\\u00e1mky po cel\\u00e9 republice. Mohli jste n\\u00e1s potkat t\\u0159eba na st\\u00e1tn\\u00edm z\\u00e1mku Lednice, Nov\\u00e9 M\\u011bsto nad Metuj\\u00ed, \\u017dleby, Kyn\\u017evart, Bouzov a spoust\\u011b dal\\u0161\\u00edch objekt\\u016f. Praxe v tomto roce byly velice p\\u0159\\u00ednosn\\u00e9 a ka\\u017ed\\u00fd si odnesl nov\\u00e9 zku\\u0161enosti a z\\u00e1\\u017eitky. Cel\\u00e1 na\\u0161e t\\u0159\\u00edda praxe \\u00fasp\\u011b\\u0161n\\u011b zvl\\u00e1dla a t\\u011b\\u0161\\u00edme se na p\\u0159\\u00ed\\u0161t\\u00ed rok. <\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\"> T\\u0159\\u00edda 2.B<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":946,\"asset_id\":1077,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('956', 'com_content.article.947', '', '2026-09-10 22:22:03', '140', '4917', '5009cd3df6c640b431bf307fa2fe770f07d81645', '{\"title\":\"1.B - \\\"Co n\\u00e1m praxe p\\u0159inesly?\\\"\",\"alias\":\"odborne-praxe-cestovniho-ruchu-tridy-1-b\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2025-06-22 10:23:45\",\"publish_up\":\"2025-06-22 10:23:45\",\"ordering\":46,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">1.B - \\\"Co n\\u00e1m praxe p\\u0159inesly?\\\"<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2025\\/Praxe\\/1.B\\/1.jpg\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2025\\/Praxe\\/1.B\\/1.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"675\\\"><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2025\\/Praxe\\/1.B\\/2.jpg\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2025\\/Praxe\\/1.B\\/2.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"675\\\"><\\/a><span style=\\\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-language: CS;\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\\\">\\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\\\" style=\\\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Ur\\u010dit\\u011b m\\u00e1me lep\\u0161\\u00ed zku\\u0161enosti s komunikac\\u00ed s lidmi.<\\/span><\\/li>\\r\\n<li class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Nau\\u010dili jsme se mluvit p\\u0159ed velkou skupinou lid\\u00ed a tak\\u00e9 ji v\\u00e9st.<\\/span><\\/li>\\r\\n<li class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Jsme te\\u010f v\\u00edce samostatn\\u00ed.<\\/span><\\/li>\\r\\n<li class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">N\\u011bkte\\u0159\\u00ed z\\u00a0n\\u00e1s byli daleko od domova a zvykli si na sob\\u011bsta\\u010dnost.<\\/span><\\/li>\\r\\n<li class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Praxe n\\u00e1m celkov\\u011b dost zlep\\u0161ily na\\u0161e dosavadn\\u00ed zku\\u0161enosti.<\\/span><\\/li>\\r\\n<li class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Nakonec n\\u00e1s i bavily :)<\\/span><\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><strong><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Mohli jste n\\u00e1s vid\\u011bt na t\\u011bchto lokalit\\u00e1ch:<\\/span><\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Z\\u00e1mky: Jind\\u0159ich\\u016fv Hradec, Kyn\\u017evart, T\\u0159ebo\\u0148, Lemberk, Hor\\u0161ovsk\\u00fd T\\u00fdn, N\\u00e1chod, Nov\\u00e9 M\\u011bsto nad Metuj\\u00ed, \\u010castolovice<br><\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Hrady: Bouzov, Ro\\u017emberk, Kost<br><\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Pevnost Dobro\\u0161ov<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoListParagraph\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: CS;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":947,\"asset_id\":1078,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('957', 'com_content.article.948', '', '2026-09-10 22:22:04', '140', '4844', '6540b79a8eb9738fb88ab23e88698371846126e4', '{\"title\":\"3.B - vod\\u00e1ck\\u00fd kurz\",\"alias\":\"3-b-vodacky-kurz\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2025-06-30 13:06:36\",\"publish_up\":\"2025-06-30 13:06:36\",\"ordering\":45,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">3.B - vod\\u00e1ck\\u00fd kurz<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2025\\/vodak_3.B.jpg\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2025\\/vodak_3.B.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"600\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Na\\u0161e t\\u0159\\u00edda 3.B vyrazila v ned\\u011bli na vod\\u00e1ck\\u00fd kurz na S\\u00e1zavu. Cesta byla sice dlouh\\u00e1, ale d\\u00edky pozitivn\\u00ed n\\u00e1lad\\u011b utekla rychleji, ne\\u017e jsme \\u010dekali. Stav\\u011bn\\u00ed stan\\u016f n\\u00e1m dalo trochu zabrat, ale hlavn\\u00ed bylo, \\u017ee jsme nakonec v\\u0161ichni m\\u011bli kde sp\\u00e1t. Ve\\u010der jsme si u\\u017eili u t\\u00e1bor\\u00e1ku \\u2013 nechyb\\u011blo op\\u00e9k\\u00e1n\\u00ed \\u0161pek\\u00e1\\u010dk\\u016f, kytara a tak\\u00e9 turnaj v p\\u0159ehazovan\\u00e9, kter\\u00fd n\\u00e1s v\\u0161echny bavil. <\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">V pond\\u011bln\\u00ed dopoledne n\\u00e1s na vod\\u011b nezastavil ani d\\u00e9\\u0161\\u0165. Kdy\\u017e kone\\u010dn\\u011b vykouklo slun\\u00ed\\u010dko, mohli jsme se zchladit ve vod\\u011b a vyzkou\\u0161et hry na balancov\\u00e1n\\u00ed na lod\\u00edch. N\\u011bkomu to \\u0161lo l\\u00edp, n\\u011bkomu h\\u016f\\u0159, a ti m\\u00e9n\\u011b \\u00fasp\\u011b\\u0161n\\u00ed skon\\u010dili (trochu nedobrovoln\\u011b) ve vod\\u011b. <\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">N\\u011bkte\\u0159\\u00ed z n\\u00e1s u\\u017e p\\u0159ijeli jako zku\\u0161en\\u00ed vod\\u00e1ci, jin\\u00ed dr\\u017eeli p\\u00e1dlo poprv\\u00e9 v \\u017eivot\\u011b. Ale nakonec jsme to zvl\\u00e1dli v\\u0161ichni. V\\u0161echny jezy jsme p\\u0159ejeli bez v\\u011bt\\u0161\\u00edch probl\\u00e9m\\u016f \\u2013 i kdy\\u017e u n\\u011bkter\\u00fdch jsme si museli trochu m\\u00e1knout. Cel\\u00fd kurz jsme si n\\u00e1ramn\\u011b u\\u017eili. <\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Velk\\u00e9 d\\u00edky pat\\u0159\\u00ed na\\u0161im pan\\u00edm u\\u010ditelk\\u00e1m Judit\\u011b a St\\u00e1zi, \\u017ee n\\u00e1s na vodu vzaly, i kdy\\u017e m\\u011bly zpo\\u010d\\u00e1tku trochu obavy. D\\u011bkujeme tak\\u00e9 Pavlovi, kter\\u00fd se s n\\u00e1mi neb\\u00e1l vyrazit. Pod\\u011bkov\\u00e1n\\u00ed si zaslou\\u017e\\u00ed instrukto\\u0159i Zby\\u0148\\u010fa a D\\u00e1\\u0161a, kte\\u0159\\u00ed n\\u00e1s v\\u0161echno nau\\u010dili a skv\\u011ble se o n\\u00e1s postarali. Na tento vod\\u00e1k budeme ur\\u010dit\\u011b je\\u0161t\\u011b dlouho vzpom\\u00ednat.\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Michaela Krejcarov\\u00e1 a Michaela Van\\u011b\\u010dkov\\u00e1, 3.B\\u00a0<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\"><br><\\/span><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":948,\"asset_id\":1079,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
