('965', 'com_content.article.956', '', '2026-09-10 22:22:07', '140', '4090', '9578a99f30ccae071394fe26b3068ebbc14d5b20', '{\"title\":\"Vod\\u00e1ck\\u00fd kurz 3.B - S\\u00e1zava\",\"alias\":\"vodacky-kurz-3-b-sazava\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2025-09-18 16:47:00\",\"publish_up\":\"2025-09-18 16:47:00\",\"ordering\":44,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Vod\\u00e1ck\\u00fd kurz 3.B - S\\u00e1zava<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/Vodak_3.B.jpg\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/Vodak_3.B.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\"><\\/span><\\/span><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<div style=\\\"padding-left: 40px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">V \\u00fater\\u00fd 02. 09. na\\u0161e t\\u0159\\u00edda 3. B vyrazila na vod\\u00e1cky kurz na \\u0159eku S\\u00e1zavu spolu s na\\u0161\\u00ed t\\u0159\\u00eddn\\u00ed u\\u010ditelkou pan\\u00ed Proke\\u0161ovou a panem u\\u010ditelem Sr\\u0161n\\u011bm.\\u00a0Ne\\u017e jsme se dostali do prvn\\u00edho kempu, tak n\\u00e1s \\u010dekala pom\\u011brn\\u011b dlouh\\u00e1 cesta, kter\\u00e1 ale d\\u00edky dobr\\u00e9 n\\u00e1lad\\u011b utekla o hodn\\u011b rychleji, ne\\u017e jsme mysleli.\\u00a0Stav\\u011bn\\u00ed stan\\u016f n\\u00e1m p\\u0159ekvapiv\\u011b \\u0161lo mnoh\\u00e9m l\\u00e9pe, ne\\u017e jsme \\u010dekali, zbytek ve\\u010dera jsme tak str\\u00e1vili za deskov\\u00fdmi hrami, pingpongov\\u00fdm turnajem\\u00a0o malinovku a hran\\u00edm p\\u0159ehazovan\\u00e9. Ve st\\u0159edu r\\u00e1no jsme si sbalili v\\u011bci a vydali se na desetikilometrovou plavbu. M\\u011bli jsme docela ne\\u0161t\\u011bst\\u00ed v tom,\\u00a0\\u017ee bylo pom\\u011brn\\u011b m\\u00e1lo vody, ale ani to n\\u00e1s nezastavilo v na\\u0161em dobrodru\\u017estv\\u00ed. T\\u0159et\\u00ed den n\\u00e1s \\u010dekalo \\u0161estn\\u00e1ct kilometr\\u016f, ale i p\\u0159es fyzicky n\\u00e1ro\\u010dnou\\u00a0cestu jsme si to velmi u\\u017eili. Ur\\u010dit\\u011b nesm\\u011bly chyb\\u011bt i koupac\\u00ed hry a sout\\u011b\\u017ee. Mnoz\\u00ed jsme b\\u011bhem vod\\u00e1ck\\u00e9ho kurzu zmokli, ale to n\\u00e1m ur\\u010dit\\u011b nezabr\\u00e1nilo\\u00a0si odv\\u00e9zt kr\\u00e1sn\\u00e9 z\\u00e1\\u017eitky, na kter\\u00e9 si vzpomeneme s \\u00fasm\\u011bvem, a\\u017e budeme star\\u0161\\u00ed.<\\/span><\\/div>\\r\\n<div style=\\\"padding-left: 40px;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/div>\\r\\n<div style=\\\"padding-left: 40px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Studenti 3.B<\\/span><\\/div>\\r\\n<div style=\\\"padding-left: 40px;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/div>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":956,\"asset_id\":1087,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('966', 'com_content.article.957', '', '2026-09-10 22:22:07', '140', '4626', '4dd3b3ba112d0fe049e4b04b3686cd9b877f953e', '{\"title\":\"N\\u00e1v\\u0161t\\u011bva Terez\\u00edna \\u2013 4.A a 4.B, 11. 9. 2025\",\"alias\":\"navsteva-terezina-4-a-a-4-b-11-9-2025\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2025-09-18 17:00:29\",\"publish_up\":\"2025-09-18 17:00:29\",\"ordering\":43,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">N\\u00e1v\\u0161t\\u011bva Terez\\u00edna \\u2013 4.A a 4.B, 11. 9. 2025<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/Terezin.jpg\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/Terezin.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"1125\\\"><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Ve \\u010dtvrtek 11. z\\u00e1\\u0159\\u00ed 2025 se t\\u0159\\u00eddy 4.A a 4.B z\\u00fa\\u010dastnily vzd\\u011bl\\u00e1vac\\u00ed exkurze do Terez\\u00edna. Vyrazili jsme brzy r\\u00e1no, abychom m\\u011bli dostatek \\u010dasu na prohl\\u00eddku tohoto v\\u00fdznamn\\u00e9ho pam\\u00e1tn\\u00edku spojen\\u00e9ho s tragick\\u00fdmi ud\\u00e1lostmi Druh\\u00e9 sv\\u011btov\\u00e9 v\\u00e1lky. <\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Na\\u0161\\u00edm prvn\\u00edm c\\u00edlem byla n\\u00e1v\\u0161t\\u011bva b\\u00fdval\\u00e9ho ghetta a v\\u011bznice v Mal\\u00e9 pevnosti, kde jsme si b\\u011bhem komentovan\\u00e9 prohl\\u00eddky mohli prohl\\u00e9dnout cely, dvory, ale i m\\u00edsta, kter\\u00e1 vypov\\u00eddaj\\u00ed o t\\u011b\\u017ek\\u00e9m \\u017eivot\\u011b v\\u011bz\\u0148\\u016f. D\\u00edky v\\u00fdkladu od sle\\u010dny pr\\u016fvodkyn\\u011b jsme se dozv\\u011bd\\u011bli mnoho zaj\\u00edmav\\u00fdch i siln\\u011b emotivn\\u00edch informac\\u00ed o osudech lid\\u00ed, kte\\u0159\\u00ed Terez\\u00ednem pro\\u0161li. Po prohl\\u00eddce t\\u00e1bora jsme nav\\u0161t\\u00edvili i Muzeum ghetta, kde jsme m\\u011bli mo\\u017enost vid\\u011bt autentick\\u00e9 p\\u0159edm\\u011bty, dobov\\u00e9 dokumenty a v\\u00fdstavy v\\u011bnovan\\u00e9 \\u017eivotu v terez\\u00ednsk\\u00e9m ghettu. Mnoh\\u00e9 z vystaven\\u00fdch materi\\u00e1l\\u016f, v\\u010detn\\u011b d\\u011btsk\\u00fdch kreseb, v n\\u00e1s zanechaly hlubok\\u00fd dojem. Cel\\u00e1 exkurze byla siln\\u00fdm a pou\\u010dn\\u00fdm z\\u00e1\\u017eitkem. P\\u0159esto\\u017ee jsme se zab\\u00fdvali n\\u00e1ro\\u010dn\\u00fdm t\\u00e9matem, v\\u00fdlet jsme si velmi u\\u017eili a odv\\u00e1\\u017e\\u00edme si z n\\u011bj spoustu nov\\u00fdch poznatk\\u016f a podn\\u011bt\\u016f k zamy\\u0161len\\u00ed. Jsme r\\u00e1di, \\u017ee jsme mohli toto v\\u00fdznamn\\u00e9 m\\u00edsto osobn\\u011b nav\\u0161t\\u00edvit. <\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">D\\u011bkujeme na\\u0161im u\\u010ditel\\u016fm a m\\u00edstn\\u00edm pr\\u016fvodkyn\\u00edm za zprost\\u0159edkov\\u00e1n\\u00ed t\\u00e9to siln\\u00e9 zku\\u0161enosti.<br><\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">S\\u00e1ra Hilburgerov\\u00e1 4. B<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":957,\"asset_id\":1088,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('967', 'com_content.article.958', '', '2026-09-10 22:22:08', '140', '4699', '58705b582217fbc6aa66f2a506868c0adc36ebd0', '{\"title\":\"Budape\\u0161\\u0165 - pozn\\u00e1vac\\u00ed z\\u00e1jezd\",\"alias\":\"budapest-poznavaci-zajezd\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2025-09-22 19:27:38\",\"publish_up\":\"2025-09-22 19:27:38\",\"ordering\":42,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Budape\\u0161\\u0165 - pozn\\u00e1vac\\u00ed z\\u00e1jezd<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/Budapest.jpg\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/Budapest.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"902\\\"><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">V term\\u00ednu 6.\\u20139. z\\u00e1\\u0159\\u00ed vyrazila na\\u0161e t\\u0159\\u00edda, 2.B, spole\\u010dn\\u011b s t\\u0159\\u00eddou 4.B na pozn\\u00e1vac\\u00ed z\\u00e1jezd do hlavn\\u00edho m\\u011bsta Ma\\u010farska \\u2013 Budape\\u0161ti. Hned po p\\u0159\\u00edjezdu jsme si vychutnali okru\\u017en\\u00ed plavbu po Dunaji, odkud se n\\u00e1m naskytly n\\u00e1dhern\\u00e9 pohledy na historick\\u00e9 centrum m\\u011bsta.<br><\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">N\\u00e1sleduj\\u00edc\\u00ed den jsme zah\\u00e1jili pozn\\u00e1v\\u00e1n\\u00edm historie \\u2013 a to jak modern\\u00edch ma\\u010farsk\\u00fdch d\\u011bjin v Dom\\u011b teroru, tak i d\\u011bjin sv\\u011btov\\u00e9ho um\\u011bn\\u00ed v Muzeu kr\\u00e1sn\\u00fdch um\\u011bn\\u00ed. Odpoledne jsme m\\u011bli mo\\u017enost nav\\u0161t\\u00edvit Budape\\u0161\\u0165skou zoologickou zahradu, nebo se vykoupat v aquaparku.<br><\\/span><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">T\\u0159et\\u00ed den jsme si prohl\\u00e9dli baziliku sv. \\u0160t\\u011bp\\u00e1na a pot\\u00e9 nav\\u0161t\\u00edvili Velkou tr\\u017enici, kde jsme si mohli koupit suven\\u00fdry nebo ochutnat tradi\\u010dn\\u00ed ma\\u010farsk\\u00e9 speciality, jakou je nap\\u0159\\u00edklad lango\\u0161. Pozd\\u011bji jsme se vydali do Tropicaria, kde jsme obdivovali sv\\u011bt ryb, plaz\\u016f a exotick\\u00fdch zv\\u00ed\\u0159at. Den n\\u011bkte\\u0159\\u00ed z n\\u00e1s zakon\\u010dili adrenalinovou laser game. <br>Posledn\\u00ed den n\\u00e1s \\u010dekala n\\u00e1v\\u0161t\\u011bva muzea voskov\\u00fdch figur\\u00edn Madame Tussauds Budape\\u0161\\u0165, kde jsme se mohli vyfotit s celebritami, jako jsou Madonna, Michael Jackson, Leonardo DiCaprio, Freddie Mercury, Tom Hanks \\u010di Whitney Houston. Nechyb\\u011bly ani osobnosti jako c\\u00edsa\\u0159ovna Al\\u017eb\\u011bta \\u201eSissi\\u201c Bavorsk\\u00e1, Al\\u017eb\\u011bta II., Donald Trump, Lionel Messi nebo Steve Jobs. <br>Cel\\u00fd z\\u00e1jezd jsme si moc u\\u017eili a obrovsk\\u00e9 pod\\u011bkov\\u00e1n\\u00ed pat\\u0159\\u00ed pan\\u00ed u\\u010ditelce Marii Hausknechtov\\u00e9, kter\\u00e1 ho pro n\\u00e1s perfektn\\u011b p\\u0159ipravila. <\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Za v\\u0161echny \\u00fa\\u010dastn\\u00edky z\\u00e1jezdu \\u2014 Mat\\u011bj Petr, \\u017e\\u00e1k 2.B.\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":958,\"asset_id\":1089,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('968', 'com_content.article.959', '', '2026-09-10 22:22:08', '140', '3271', '867b631510e223c68e561a5c767b24aa532718d7', '{\"title\":\"Adapta\\u010dn\\u00ed kurz 1.B\",\"alias\":\"adaptacni-kurz-1-b-2\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2025-09-26 20:06:54\",\"publish_up\":\"2025-09-26 20:06:54\",\"ordering\":41,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Adapta\\u010dn\\u00ed kurz 1.B<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/adaptak_1.B.jpg\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/adaptak_1.B.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"1125\\\"><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Ve t\\u0159et\\u00edm z\\u00e1\\u0159ijov\\u00e9m t\\u00fddnu na\\u0161e t\\u0159\\u00edda 1.B absolvovala adapta\\u010dn\\u00ed kurz, kter\\u00fd byl zam\\u011b\\u0159en na vz\\u00e1jemn\\u00e9 pozn\\u00e1n\\u00ed se a pos\\u00edlen\\u00ed t\\u0159\\u00eddn\\u00edho kolektivu. Zapojili jsme se do r\\u016fzn\\u00fdch aktivit, mezi nimi\\u017e nechyb\\u011bl bowling, odpo\\u010dinek p\\u0159i wellness aktivit\\u00e1ch, hra Just Dance \\u010di turnaj v minigolfu. Sou\\u010d\\u00e1st\\u00ed programu byly vz\\u00e1jemn\\u00e9 pozn\\u00e1vac\\u00ed hry, ale tak\\u00e9 dostatek voln\\u00e9ho \\u010dasu, kter\\u00fd umo\\u017enil nav\\u00e1z\\u00e1n\\u00ed nov\\u00fdch p\\u0159\\u00e1telstv\\u00ed. Z\\u00e1v\\u011bre\\u010dn\\u00fdm bodem kurzu byl spole\\u010dn\\u00fd p\\u011b\\u0161\\u00ed v\\u00fdlet p\\u0159\\u00edrodou Orlick\\u00fdch hor ze \\u0160erlichu. Cel\\u00fd adapta\\u010dn\\u00ed pobyt prob\\u011bhl v p\\u0159\\u00edjemn\\u00e9 atmosf\\u00e9\\u0159e a p\\u0159isp\\u011bl ke snadn\\u011bj\\u0161\\u00edmu za\\u010d\\u00e1tku studia. <br>t\\u0159\\u00edda 1.B\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":959,\"asset_id\":1090,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('969', 'com_content.article.960', '', '2026-09-10 22:22:09', '140', '3336', '8d473be36722b1877a6db18218eb0b8d17c04aca', '{\"title\":\"Adapta\\u010dn\\u00ed kurz 1.A\",\"alias\":\"adaptacni-kurz-1-a\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2025-10-05 15:11:47\",\"publish_up\":\"2025-10-05 15:11:47\",\"ordering\":40,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Adapta\\u010dn\\u00ed kurz 1.A<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/adaptak_1.A.jpg\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/adaptak_1.A.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\"><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Ji\\u017e se stalo tradic\\u00ed, \\u017ee prvn\\u00ed ro\\u010dn\\u00edky vyr\\u00e1\\u017eej\\u00ed na kr\\u00e1tk\\u00fd stmelovac\\u00ed pobyt mimo \\u0161kolu. Na\\u0161e t\\u0159\\u00edda 1.A nebyla v\\u00fdjimkou. V De\\u0161tn\\u00e9m v Orlick\\u00fdch hor\\u00e1ch jsme spole\\u010dn\\u011b str\\u00e1vili prima 2 dny. Rozmary po\\u010das\\u00ed n\\u00e1s nezastavily, a krom pobytu na chat\\u011b jsme vyrazili na minigolf, kr\\u00e1tk\\u00fd v\\u00fd\\u0161lap ke kostelu svat\\u00e9ho Matou\\u0161e a druh\\u00fd den od Masarykovy chaty p\\u0159es \\u0160erli\\u0161sk\\u00fd ml\\u00fdn pochodem zp\\u011bt do De\\u0161tn\\u00e9ho. Ve\\u010der jsme si spole\\u010dn\\u011b \\u201ezablbli\\u201c u her a posed\\u011bli u oh\\u00fdnku. Zp\\u011bt dom\\u016f jsme dojeli, pravda, mnoz\\u00ed s lehkou vir\\u00f3zou, ale jinak spokojen\\u00ed, \\u017ee se n\\u00e1m adapta\\u010dn\\u00ed kurz vyda\\u0159il na jedni\\u010dku. <\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Mgr. \\u0160\\u00e1rka P\\u00e1\\u0161mov\\u00e1 t\\u0159\\u00eddn\\u00ed u\\u010ditelka<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":960,\"asset_id\":1091,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('970', 'com_content.article.961', '', '2026-09-10 22:22:09', '140', '3636', 'd53a08d0d9ffa29d580117910c00a8f44bd108ea', '{\"title\":\"Z\\u00e1vody v p\\u0159espoln\\u00edm b\\u011bhu - Police nad Metuj\\u00ed\",\"alias\":\"zavody-v-prespolnim-behu-police-nad-metuji\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2025-10-05 15:23:59\",\"publish_up\":\"2025-10-05 15:23:59\",\"ordering\":39,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Z\\u00e1vody v p\\u0159espoln\\u00edm b\\u011bhu - Police nad Metuj\\u00ed<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/Police.jpg\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/Police.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\"><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Dne 25. 9. se na\\u0161e studentky a studenti z\\u00fa\\u010dastnili p\\u0159espoln\\u00edho b\\u011bhu v Polici nad Metuj\\u00ed. Adam Nagy 4.A vyhr\\u00e1l kategorii chlapc\\u016f, t\\u00fdm chlapc\\u016f byl pak celkov\\u011b druh\\u00fd. V kategorii d\\u00edvek se nejl\\u00e9pe um\\u00edstila Ema Jir\\u00e1skov\\u00e1 z 2.A a to na 2. m\\u00edst\\u011b. Celkov\\u011b se n\\u00e1\\u0161 d\\u00edv\\u010d\\u00ed t\\u00fdm um\\u00edstil na kr\\u00e1sn\\u00e9m druh\\u00e9m m\\u00edst\\u011b. Student\\u016fm moc gratulujeme a d\\u011bkujeme za skv\\u011blou reprezentaci \\u0161koly - podm\\u00ednky byly tento rok n\\u00e1ro\\u010dn\\u00e9. <\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Kategorie d\\u00edvek: <br>1. Jir\\u00e1skov\\u00e1 Ema <br>2. Pohlov\\u00e1 Matylda <br>3. Pavl\\u00edkov\\u00e1 Nat\\u00e1lie <br>4. \\u0160r\\u016ftkov\\u00e1 Vendula <br>5. Svato\\u0148ov\\u00e1 Nela <br>6. Hanu\\u0161ov\\u00e1 Roz\\u00e1lie <\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Kategorie chlapc\\u016f: <br>1. Nagy Adam <br>2. Bedna\\u0159\\u00edk Jan <br>3. Rohan Dominik <br>4. Dom\\u00e1\\u010dek Kry\\u0161tof <br>5. Ho\\u0161\\u00e1k Jan <br>6. Umlauf Sebasti\\u00e1n<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":961,\"asset_id\":1092,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('971', 'com_content.article.962', '', '2026-09-10 22:22:10', '140', '3617', '08504a8c9aa852e93e3439177eb27a55f92ef1b6', '{\"title\":\"Uk\\u00e1zkov\\u00e1 pr\\u016fvodcovsk\\u00e1 praxe - 1.B\",\"alias\":\"ukazkova-pruvodcovska-praxe-1-b\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2025-10-05 15:29:12\",\"publish_up\":\"2025-10-05 15:29:12\",\"ordering\":38,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Uk\\u00e1zkov\\u00e1 pr\\u016fvodcovsk\\u00e1 praxe - 1.B<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/1.B.jpg\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/1.B.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\"><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Studenti 1. ro\\u010dn\\u00edku oboru cestovn\\u00ed ruch se ji\\u017e za\\u010dali chystat na svoji pr\\u016fvodcovskou praxi a to t\\u00edm, \\u017ee se byli pod\\u00edvat na n\\u00e1chodsk\\u00e9m z\\u00e1mku a z\\u00e1mku v Nov\\u00e9m M\\u011bst\\u011b nad Metuj\\u00ed na uk\\u00e1zkovou prohl\\u00eddku, kterou jim zprost\\u0159edkovali jejich star\\u0161\\u00ed spolu\\u017e\\u00e1ci. Jednalo se o uk\\u00e1zkovou pr\\u016fvodcovskou \\u010dinnost, kde se studenti vy\\u0161\\u0161\\u00edch ro\\u010dn\\u00edk\\u016f sna\\u017eili p\\u0159edat sv\\u00e9 znalosti a dovednosti za\\u010d\\u00ednaj\\u00edc\\u00edm student\\u016fm prvn\\u00edho ro\\u010dn\\u00edku. Ti se taj\\u016fm pr\\u016fvodcovstv\\u00ed teprve budou u\\u010dit a odborn\\u00e9 praxe na hradech a z\\u00e1mc\\u00edch na n\\u011b \\u010dekaj\\u00ed v jarn\\u00edch m\\u011bs\\u00edc\\u00edch tohoto \\u0161koln\\u00edho roku. <\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">P\\u0159ejeme jim mnoho \\u00fasp\\u011bch\\u016f! <\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Vyu\\u010duj\\u00edc\\u00ed odborn\\u00fdch p\\u0159edm\\u011bt\\u016f cestovn\\u00edho ruchu Mgr. Marie Hausknechtov\\u00e1 a Mgr. Judita Jir\\u00e1skov\\u00e1 Galbov\\u00e1<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":962,\"asset_id\":1093,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('972', 'com_content.article.963', '', '2026-09-10 22:22:10', '140', '6357', '0bfa373eb1bcbd21730ca00682752eeb9e870b4e', '{\"title\":\"UNESCO - valn\\u00e1 hromada p\\u0159idru\\u017een\\u00fdch \\u0161kol \",\"alias\":\"unesco-valna-hromada-pridruzenych-skol\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2025-10-12 18:21:20\",\"publish_up\":\"2025-10-12 18:21:20\",\"ordering\":37,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">UNESCO - valn\\u00e1 hromada p\\u0159idru\\u017een\\u00fdch \\u0161kol<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/Unesco.jpg\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/Unesco.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\"><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">22. z\\u00e1\\u0159\\u00ed se z\\u00e1stupci na\\u0161\\u00ed \\u0161koly z\\u00fa\\u010dastnily 31. valn\\u00e9ho shrom\\u00e1\\u017ed\\u011bn\\u00ed S\\u00edt\\u011b p\\u0159idru\\u017een\\u00fdch \\u0161kol UNESCO v \\u010cesk\\u00e9 republice, kter\\u00e9 se konalo v reprezentativn\\u00edch prostor\\u00e1ch refekt\\u00e1\\u0159e GASK. Do Kutn\\u00e9 Hory, kter\\u00e1 letos slav\\u00ed 30 let od z\\u00e1pisu na Seznam sv\\u011btov\\u00e9ho d\\u011bdictv\\u00ed UNESCO, se sjeli z\\u00e1stupci v\\u0161ech 54 zapojen\\u00fdch \\u0161kol, aby bilancovali svou \\u010dinnost a pl\\u00e1novali dal\\u0161\\u00ed sm\\u011b\\u0159ov\\u00e1n\\u00ed. K t\\u011bmto vybran\\u00fdm 54 \\u0161kol\\u00e1m pat\\u0159\\u00ed pr\\u00e1v\\u011b i ta na\\u0161e. <\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Ofici\\u00e1ln\\u00ed \\u010d\\u00e1st programu zah\\u00e1jili Ond\\u0159ej Andrys, st\\u00e1tn\\u00ed tajemn\\u00edk Ministerstva \\u0161kolstv\\u00ed, ml\\u00e1de\\u017ee a t\\u011blov\\u00fdchovy a profesor Stanislav \\u0160tech. <\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Ond\\u0159ej Andrys pozdravil \\u00fa\\u010dastn\\u00edky i jm\\u00e9nem ministra Mikul\\u00e1\\u0161e Beka a upozornil na v\\u00fdznam hodnot, kter\\u00e9 UNESCO dlouhodob\\u011b h\\u00e1j\\u00ed. Vyb\\u00eddl, \\u017ee setk\\u00e1n\\u00ed tohoto typu by mohlo b\\u00fdt p\\u0159\\u00edle\\u017eitost\\u00ed k hlub\\u0161\\u00ed reflexi. \\u201e\\u017dijeme i dnes ve slo\\u017eit\\u00e9 dob\\u011b, o to d\\u016fle\\u017eit\\u011bj\\u0161\\u00ed je ty hodnoty, kter\\u00e9 r\\u00e1muj\\u00ed bezpe\\u010d\\u00ed, spolupr\\u00e1ci, respekt mezi lidmi, d\\u016fv\\u011bru, odolnost, udr\\u017eitelnost, glob\\u00e1ln\\u00ed m\\u00edr, h\\u00e1jit, udr\\u017eovat,\\u201c zd\\u016fraznil. P\\u0159ipomn\\u011bl, \\u017ee UNESCO vzniklo jako reakce na hr\\u016fzy druh\\u00e9 sv\\u011btov\\u00e9 v\\u00e1lky a jeho posl\\u00e1n\\u00edm je pozitivn\\u011b ovliv\\u0148ovat mysl lid\\u00ed v\\u0161ech generac\\u00ed. Pod\\u011bkoval v\\u0161em, kte\\u0159\\u00ed zna\\u010dnou \\u010d\\u00e1st sv\\u00e9ho odborn\\u00e9ho pedagogick\\u00e9ho \\u017eivota spojuj\\u00ed s my\\u0161lenkami, kter\\u00e9 UNESCO cel\\u00e1 l\\u00e9ta nese a h\\u00e1j\\u00ed. <\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">V podobn\\u00e9m duchu vystoupil i profesor Stanislav \\u0160tech, kter\\u00fd se jako p\\u0159edseda \\u010cesk\\u00e9 komise pro UNESCO valn\\u00fdch shrom\\u00e1\\u017ed\\u011bn\\u00ed \\u00fa\\u010dastn\\u00ed pravideln\\u011b. Podotkl, \\u017ee nejde jen o \\u201eelitn\\u00ed uzav\\u0159en\\u00fd klub\\u201c, ale o s\\u00ed\\u0165 \\u0161kol, kter\\u00e9 se v\\u011bdom\\u011b a dlouhodob\\u011b v\\u011bnuj\\u00ed glob\\u00e1ln\\u011b d\\u016fle\\u017eit\\u00fdm t\\u00e9mat\\u016fm. Ocenil mimo jin\\u00e9, \\u017ee Kutn\\u00e1 Hora si k 30. v\\u00fdro\\u010d\\u00ed z\\u00e1pisu m\\u011bsta na Seznam UNESCO zvolila pr\\u00e1v\\u011b motto Unesco spojuje. Vyj\\u00e1d\\u0159il se k jednotliv\\u00fdm t\\u00e9mat\\u016fm shrom\\u00e1\\u017ed\\u011bn\\u00ed a jejich v\\u00fdznamu pro spole\\u010dnost. <\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Program shrom\\u00e1\\u017ed\\u011bn\\u00ed propojil odbornou \\u010d\\u00e1st s tematick\\u00fdmi workshopy, diskusemi i prohl\\u00eddkou m\\u011bsta. Zvl\\u00e1\\u0161tn\\u00ed d\\u016fraz byl letos kladen na t\\u00e9mata wellbeingu, du\\u0161evn\\u00edho zdrav\\u00ed a pohybu a tak\\u00e9 na geodiverzitu, kter\\u00e1 jsou v r\\u00e1mci glob\\u00e1ln\\u00ed s\\u00edt\\u011b UNESCO \\u0161kol hojn\\u011b diskutov\\u00e1na a zpracov\\u00e1v\\u00e1na. Valn\\u00e9 shrom\\u00e1\\u017ed\\u011bn\\u00ed se konalo za podpory m\\u011bsta Kutn\\u00e1 Hora, Ministerstva kultury \\u010cR, Sekretari\\u00e1tu \\u010cesk\\u00e9 komise pro UNESCO a pod z\\u00e1\\u0161titou starosty M\\u011bsta Kutn\\u00e1 Hora a z\\u00e1\\u0161titou Ministerstva \\u0161kolstv\\u00ed, ml\\u00e1de\\u017ee a t\\u011blov\\u00fdchovy.\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":963,\"asset_id\":1094,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
