\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">B\\u011bh do z\\u00e1meck\\u00fdch schod\\u016f<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/Schody.jpg\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/Schody.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\"><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Dne 16. \\u0159\\u00edjna se na\\u0161e studentky a studenti z\\u00fa\\u010dastnili \\\"B\\u011bhu do z\\u00e1meck\\u00fdch schod\\u016f\\\". Studenti p\\u0159edvedli v\\u00fdborn\\u00e9 v\\u00fdkony, ka\\u017ed\\u00fd b\\u011b\\u017eel na sv\\u00e9 maximum. Uk\\u00e1zalo se to v celkov\\u00e9m po\\u0159ad\\u00ed, kdy na\\u0161e d\\u00edvky byly celkov\\u011b prvn\\u00ed, chlapci druz\\u00ed. D\\u00edvky uk\\u00e1zaly svou dominanci, obsadily 2. a\\u017e 6.m\\u00edsto. Nejl\\u00e9pe z na\\u0161ich holek b\\u011b\\u017eely Vendula \\u0160r\\u016ftkov\\u00e1 a R\\u016f\\u017eena Havelkov\\u00e1. V siln\\u00e9 konkurenci chlapc\\u016f se prosadil Adam Nagy, kter\\u00fd celkov\\u011b dob\\u011bhl na 3.m\\u00edst\\u011b, na v\\u00edt\\u011bze v\\u0161ak ztratil 0,2s. V\\u0161em na\\u0161im student\\u016fm gratuluji a velmi d\\u011bkuji za vzornou reprezentaci na\\u0161\\u00ed \\u0161koly.\\u2002\\u2002\\u2002 <\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Anna Rohul\\u00e1nov\\u00e1<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":968,\"asset_id\":1099,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('978', 'com_content.article.969', '', '2026-09-10 22:22:13', '140', '3668', 'f5e6786d1ac58b30e3537111ac9393f4bcd6fef0', '{\"title\":\"Exkurze \\u2013 leti\\u0161t\\u011b V\\u00e1clava Havla - Praha - 2.B, 3.B\",\"alias\":\"exkurze-letiste-vaclava-havla-praha-2-b-3-b\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2025-11-10 19:28:35\",\"publish_up\":\"2025-11-10 19:28:35\",\"ordering\":32,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Exkurze \\u2013 leti\\u0161t\\u011b V\\u00e1clava Havla - Praha - 2.B, 3.B<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/Letiste.jpg\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/Letiste.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\"><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Ve st\\u0159edu 5.11. jsme se jako t\\u0159\\u00edda 3.B spole\\u010dn\\u011b s 2.B vydali na Leti\\u0161t\\u011b V\\u00e1clava Havla v Praze. Zde n\\u00e1s \\u010dekala exkurze v m\\u00edstech, kter\\u00e1 nejsou b\\u011b\\u017en\\u011b p\\u0159\\u00edstupn\\u00e1. Sou\\u010d\\u00e1st\\u00ed prohl\\u00eddky byly vnit\\u0159n\\u00ed prostory termin\\u00e1l\\u016f 1 a 2 a proj\\u00ed\\u017e\\u010fka autobusem po cel\\u00e9m vn\\u011bj\\u0161\\u00edm are\\u00e1lu leti\\u0161t\\u011b, kde jsme m\\u011bli mo\\u017enost vid\\u011bt letadla a v\\u0161e s nimi spojen\\u00e9 z bl\\u00edzka. Celou prohl\\u00eddku n\\u00e1s prov\\u00e1zela velice mil\\u00e1 pr\\u016fvodkyn\\u011b, kter\\u00e1 v\\u0161e doplnila o zaj\\u00edmav\\u00fd v\\u00fdklad. Mohli jsme vid\\u011bt p\\u0159\\u00edlety i odlety r\\u016fzn\\u00fdch letadel a bylo n\\u00e1m p\\u0159ibl\\u00ed\\u017eeno, jak na leti\\u0161ti v\\u0161e funguje a to i v z\\u00e1kulis\\u00ed, kam se b\\u011b\\u017en\\u00fd cestuj\\u00edc\\u00ed nem\\u00e1 mo\\u017enost pod\\u00edvat. Exkurze byla pro n\\u00e1s v\\u0161echny velmi zaj\\u00edmav\\u00e1 a p\\u0159\\u00ednosn\\u00e1 a jsme r\\u00e1di, \\u017ee jsme m\\u011bli mo\\u017enost leti\\u0161t\\u011b nav\\u0161t\\u00edvit. <\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Za \\u017e\\u00e1ky 3.B Karol\\u00edna St\\u0159edov\\u00e1<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":969,\"asset_id\":1100,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('979', 'com_content.article.970', '', '2026-09-10 22:22:14', '140', '3648', '034d42164e9c884c99c35a2ac1e9889dd0613187', '{\"title\":\"Cestov\\u00e1n\\u00ed \\u0160pan\\u011blskem - program pro seniory od studentsk\\u00e9 firmy\",\"alias\":\"cestovani-spanelskem-program-pro-seniory-od-studentske-firmy\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2025-12-02 17:46:13\",\"publish_up\":\"2025-12-02 17:46:13\",\"ordering\":31,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Cestov\\u00e1n\\u00ed \\u0160pan\\u011blskem - program pro seniory od studentsk\\u00e9 firmy<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/OAZA.jpg\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/OAZA.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\"><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">V \\u00fater\\u00fd 18. 11. jsme jako studentsk\\u00e1 firma Animora nav\\u0161t\\u00edvili domov senior\\u016f O\\u00e1za v Nov\\u00e9m M\\u011bst\\u011b nad Metuj\\u00ed, kde jsme si pro seniory p\\u0159ipravili vlastn\\u00ed program. Sou\\u010d\\u00e1st\\u00ed na\\u0161\\u00ed n\\u00e1v\\u0161t\\u011bvy byla prezentace na t\\u00e9ma \\u0160pan\\u011blsko, ve kter\\u00e9 jsme senior\\u016fm p\\u0159edstavili pam\\u00e1tky z turisticky atraktivn\\u00edch m\\u011bst a tak\\u00e9 zaj\\u00edmavosti o kultu\\u0159e, tradic\\u00edch i gastronomii t\\u00e9to zem\\u011b. Tak\\u00e9 jsme p\\u0159ipravili k\\u0159\\u00ed\\u017eovky a omalov\\u00e1nky, na kter\\u00fdch jsme pot\\u00e9 spole\\u010dn\\u011b pracovali. Atmosf\\u00e9ra byla velmi p\\u0159\\u00edjemn\\u00e1, senio\\u0159i ocenili nejen na\\u0161e pov\\u00edd\\u00e1n\\u00ed, ale i spole\\u010dn\\u00e9 rozhovory. <\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Pro n\\u00e1s to byla cenn\\u00e1 zku\\u0161enost a t\\u011b\\u0161\\u00edme se na dal\\u0161\\u00ed podobn\\u00e9 akce.\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Za studentskou firmu Animora,<br>Nikol Mar\\u0161\\u00edkov\\u00e1.<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":970,\"asset_id\":1101,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
