('984', 'com_content.article.975', '', '2026-09-10 22:22:16', '140', '4947', '47d86143d3e90cfe68bdb60085065be9511b180b', '{\"title\":\"Veletrh studentsk\\u00fdch firem 2025\\/2026\",\"alias\":\"veletrh-studentskych-firem-3\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2025-12-15 20:04:23\",\"publish_up\":\"2025-12-15 20:04:23\",\"ordering\":30,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Veletrh studentsk\\u00fdch firem 2025\\/2026<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/JA_25.jpg\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/JA_25.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\"><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Dne 4.12. se v Hradci Kr\\u00e1lov\\u00e9 op\\u011bt konal Veletrh JA studentsk\\u00fdch firem v Hradci Kr\\u00e1lov\\u00e9. Na\\u0161e \\u0161kola se z\\u00fa\\u010dastnila v po\\u010dtu 5 studentsk\\u00fdch firem. Cel\\u00e1 akce prob\\u011bhla ve VIP z\\u00f3n\\u011b Mal\\u0161ovick\\u00e9ho fotbalov\\u00e9ho stadionu.<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Ka\\u017ed\\u00e1 ze studentsk\\u00fdch firem se sna\\u017eila usp\\u011bt v n\\u011bkter\\u00e9 ze sout\\u011b\\u017en\\u00edch kategori\\u00ed a nutno dodat, \\u017ee konkurence byla velk\\u00e1. Cel\\u00e9 akce se z\\u00fa\\u010dastnilo v\\u00edce ne\\u017e 45 firem z \\u010cech a ze zahrani\\u010d\\u00ed.<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">V sout\\u011b\\u017en\\u00edm kl\\u00e1n\\u00ed se p\\u0159edstavily tyto firmy \\u2013 Animora, kter\\u00e1 nab\\u00edz\\u00ed z\\u00e1jezdy pro \\u0161koly a p\\u0159edn\\u00e1\\u0161ky pro seniory, Kouzlo z\\u00e1\\u017eitk\\u016f nab\\u00edzej\\u00edc\\u00ed z\\u00e1jezdy pro seniory a kluby turist\\u016f, PresentAM jej\\u00ed\\u017e aktivitou je po\\u0159\\u00e1d\\u00e1n\\u00ed p\\u0159edn\\u00e1\\u0161ek pro druh\\u00fd stupe\\u0148 z\\u00e1kladn\\u00ed \\u0161koly, PeelBee studentskou firmou vyr\\u00e1b\\u011bj\\u00edc\\u00ed scrubee a lipbee. Posledn\\u00ed sout\\u011b\\u017en\\u00ed firmou je Warmio, kter\\u00e1 m\\u00e1 v nab\\u00eddce h\\u0159ejiv\\u00e9 pol\\u0161t\\u00e1\\u0159ky.<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\\\">Firma Animora si z veletrhu odvezla prvn\\u00ed m\\u00edsto za nejlep\\u0161\\u00ed slogan a z\\u00e1rove\\u0148 skon\\u010dila v celkov\\u00e9m po\\u0159ad\\u00ed v sout\\u011b\\u017ei o absolutn\\u00edho v\\u00edt\\u011bze na kr\\u00e1sn\\u00e9m 8. m\\u00edst\\u011b. Kouzlo z\\u00e1\\u017eitk\\u016f si za sv\\u016fj slogan odvezlo \\u00fa\\u017easn\\u00e9 6. m\\u00edsto. Ani v kategorii sout\\u011b\\u017ee o nejlep\\u0161\\u00edho prodejce si na\\u0161e JA firmy nevedly \\u0161patn\\u011b. Kouzlo z\\u00e1\\u017eitk\\u016f z\\u00edskalo 13. m\\u00edsto na 14. m\\u00edst\\u011b byla Animora a firma PeelBee skon\\u010dila na 16. m\\u00edst\\u011b. Firma PeelBee se um\\u00edstila na 16. m\\u00edst\\u011b v kategorii O nejlep\\u0161\\u00ed p\\u0159edm\\u011bt podnik\\u00e1n\\u00ed. Na\\u0161i studenti se neztratili ani v kategorii Nejlep\\u0161\\u00ed prezentace \\u2013 PeelBee 14. m\\u00edsto a Animora 19. m\\u00edsto.<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">U\\u017e se t\\u011b\\u0161\\u00edme na dal\\u0161\\u00ed ro\\u010dn\\u00edk.\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":975,\"asset_id\":1106,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('985', 'com_content.article.976', '', '2026-09-10 22:22:17', '140', '3053', '21531afe88c36826685d1df5ad85001975303908', '{\"title\":\"V\\u00e1no\\u010dn\\u00ed trhy ve Wroclawi\",\"alias\":\"vanocni-trhy-ve-wroclawi\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2025-12-16 17:58:45\",\"publish_up\":\"2025-12-16 17:58:45\",\"ordering\":29,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">V\\u00e1no\\u010dn\\u00ed trhy ve Wroclawi<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/wroclav_2.jpg\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/wroclav_2.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\"><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/wroclav_1.jpg\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/wroclav_1.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"506\\\"><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">V\\u00e1no\\u010dn\\u00ed trhy ve Wroclawi pat\\u0159\\u00ed k nejkr\\u00e1sn\\u011bj\\u0161\\u00edm v Polsku a nab\\u00edzej\\u00ed kouzelnou p\\u0159edv\\u00e1no\\u010dn\\u00ed atmosf\\u00e9ru. Proto i letos na\\u0161e \\u0161kola uspo\\u0159\\u00e1dala z\\u00e1jezd na v\\u00e1no\\u010dn\\u00ed trhy do tohoto historick\\u00e9ho m\\u011bsta pln\\u00e9 barevn\\u00fdch dom\\u016f, p\\u0159\\u00e1telsk\\u00e9 atmosf\\u00e9ry, tis\\u00edce sv\\u011bt\\u00fdlek a v\\u00fdborn\\u00fdch dobr\\u016ftek. Bylo to opravdu kouzeln\\u00e9 m\\u00edsto. Kr\\u00e1sn\\u00fd p\\u0159edv\\u00e1no\\u010dn\\u00ed \\u010das V\\u0160EM.<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":976,\"asset_id\":1107,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
