('987', 'com_content.article.978', '', '2026-09-10 22:22:17', '140', '4201', 'e71393153f89f57f020c89b920dd2488b7d31cc0', '{\"title\":\"Stubaisk\\u00fd ledovec - 20. ro\\u010dn\\u00edk ly\\u017ea\\u0159sk\\u00e9ho z\\u00e1jezdu\",\"alias\":\"stubaisky-ledovec-20-rocnik-lyzarskeho-zajezdu\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2026-02-09 16:55:05\",\"publish_up\":\"2026-02-09 16:55:05\",\"ordering\":27,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Stubaisk\\u00fd ledovec - 20. ro\\u010dn\\u00edk ly\\u017ea\\u0159sk\\u00e9ho z\\u00e1jezdu<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/Stubai\\/Stub_1.jpg\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/Stubai\\/Stub_1.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"506\\\"><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/Stubai\\/Stub_2.jpg\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/Stubai\\/Stub_2.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"506\\\"><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">I tento rok se konal ly\\u017ea\\u0159sk\\u00fd z\\u00e1jezd do rakousk\\u00fdch Alp a byl to rok v\\u00fdjime\\u010dn\\u00fd, proto\\u017ee to byl v \\u0159ad\\u011b 20. \\u0161koln\\u00ed v\\u00fdjezd do Alp. Ubytov\\u00e1ni jsme byli jako v\\u017edy v kr\\u00e1sn\\u00e9m penzionu Birgit Landhaus v m\\u011bste\\u010dku Telfes, kde jsme mohli vyu\\u017e\\u00edt i sauny \\u010di baz\\u00e9nu. Program byl nabit\\u00fd a po\\u010das\\u00ed n\\u00e1m p\\u0159\\u00e1lo po cel\\u00fd t\\u00fdden. V \\u00fater\\u00fd a st\\u0159edu jsme zam\\u00ed\\u0159ili na Stubaisk\\u00fd ledovec, kde jsme str\\u00e1vili cel\\u00e9 dny na svaz\\u00edch. Ve st\\u0159edu a \\u010dtvrtek jsme nav\\u0161t\\u00edvili ly\\u017ea\\u0159sk\\u00e9 st\\u0159edisko Schlick 2000, kde jsme si u\\u017eili skv\\u011bl\\u00e9 podm\\u00ednky a par\\u00e1dn\\u00ed atmosf\\u00e9ru. N\\u00e1\\u0161 pobyt prov\\u00e1zelo opravdu dokonal\\u00e9 po\\u010das\\u00ed, co\\u017e ud\\u011blalo z ly\\u017eov\\u00e1n\\u00ed nezapomenuteln\\u00fd z\\u00e1\\u017eitek a v\\u0161echny dny jsme si tak mohli u\\u017e\\u00edt na maximum. V sobotu r\\u00e1no jsme se pak spokojen\\u00ed, i kdy\\u017e unaven\\u00ed, vydali zp\\u011bt do N\\u00e1choda. Byl to t\\u00fdden pln\\u00fd skv\\u011bl\\u00fdch z\\u00e1\\u017eitk\\u016f, sportu a kr\\u00e1sn\\u00fdch v\\u00fdhled\\u016f, na kter\\u00e9 budeme je\\u0161t\\u011b dlouho vzpom\\u00ednat.<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Igor Chmela\\u0159 <br>vedouc\\u00ed ly\\u017ea\\u0159sk\\u00e9ho z\\u00e1jezdu a vyu\\u010duj\\u00edc\\u00ed cestovn\\u00edho ruchu\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":978,\"asset_id\":1109,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('988', 'com_content.article.979', '', '2026-09-10 22:22:18', '140', '3768', '90c5cc43b96f12edb9631c60ef58ca5a5ee644c8', '{\"title\":\"Ly\\u017ea\\u0159sk\\u00fd v\\u00fdcvik - 2.B\",\"alias\":\"lyzarsky-vycvik-2-b-2\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2026-02-09 17:03:02\",\"publish_up\":\"2026-02-09 17:03:02\",\"ordering\":26,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Ly\\u017ea\\u0159sk\\u00fd v\\u00fdcvik - 2.B<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/Lyzak_2.B.jpg\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/Lyzak_2.B.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"506\\\"><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Od 25. do 29. ledna 2026 se na\\u0161e t\\u0159\\u00edda, 2.B, z\\u00fa\\u010dastnila ly\\u017ea\\u0159sk\\u00e9ho kurzu v Peci pod Sn\\u011b\\u017ekou. Byli jsme ubytov\\u00e1ni na Havlov\\u011b boud\\u011b, kde n\\u00e1s u\\u017e od za\\u010d\\u00e1tku po zdol\\u00e1n\\u00ed nep\\u0159\\u00edjemn\\u00e9ho kopce p\\u011b\\u0161ky, p\\u0159iv\\u00edtala skv\\u011bl\\u00e1 atmosf\\u00e9ra. Person\\u00e1l chaty k n\\u00e1m byl celou dobu velmi mil\\u00fd a ve\\u0161ker\\u00fd \\u010das str\\u00e1ven\\u00fd na chat\\u011b byl velmi p\\u0159\\u00edjemn\\u00fd. N\\u00e1sledovaly samotn\\u00e9 ly\\u017eovac\\u00ed dny, kde jsme sj\\u00ed\\u017ed\\u011bli hned n\\u011bkolik sjezdovek v are\\u00e1lu okolo Pece a posledn\\u00ed den tak\\u00e9 na \\u010cern\\u00e9 ho\\u0159e. Na\\u0161t\\u011bst\\u00ed nikdo neutrp\\u011bl \\u017e\\u00e1dn\\u00e1 v\\u011bt\\u0161\\u00ed zran\\u011bn\\u00ed ne\\u017e p\\u00e1r boul\\u00ed, za co\\u017e jsme tak\\u00e9 v\\u0161ichni r\\u00e1di. Ly\\u017eov\\u00e1n\\u00ed jsme si u\\u017eili nehled\\u011b na na\\u0161e zdatnosti a odj\\u00ed\\u017ed\\u011bli jsme z kurzu zase o n\\u011bco jist\\u011bj\\u0161\\u00ed ve sv\\u00fdch schopnostech na sjezdovce. Velk\\u00e9 d\\u00edky pat\\u0159\\u00ed panu u\\u010diteli Vrabcovi za zorganizov\\u00e1n\\u00ed cel\\u00e9ho kurzu a tak\\u00e9 pan\\u00ed u\\u010ditelce Krulichov\\u00e9 a Rohul\\u00e1nov\\u00e9 za doprovod a veden\\u00ed sv\\u00fdch skupin. <\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">T\\u0159\\u00edda 2.B\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":979,\"asset_id\":1110,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('989', 'com_content.article.980', '', '2026-09-10 22:22:19', '140', '2931', 'f60fab855b268e0d1ee6abb86ba62d27e181e378', '{\"title\":\"Cambridgesk\\u00e9 zkou\\u0161ky\",\"alias\":\"cambridgeske-zkousky\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2026-02-20 09:08:05\",\"publish_up\":\"2026-02-20 09:08:05\",\"ordering\":25,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Cambridgesk\\u00e9 zkou\\u0161ky<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/Cambridge.jpg\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/Cambridge.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\"><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">19. 1. 2026 se na na\\u0161\\u00ed \\u0161kole ji\\u017e druh\\u00fdm rokem konaly Cambridgesk\\u00e9 zkou\\u0161ky. Ostr\\u00fdm zkou\\u0161k\\u00e1m p\\u0159edch\\u00e1zely testy zku\\u0161ebn\\u00ed, kde si studenti mohli na z\\u00e1klad\\u011b sv\\u00fdch v\\u00fdsledk\\u016f rozmyslet, kdo z nich k ostr\\u00e9mu testov\\u00e1n\\u00ed p\\u016fjde. V\\u00fdbornou zpr\\u00e1vou je, \\u017ee ostrou zkou\\u0161ku slo\\u017eilo 10 na\\u0161ich student\\u016f, 8 na \\u00farovn\\u00ed B2 a 2 na \\u00farovni C1. V\\u0161em moc gratulujeme! <\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Dana Jarol\\u00edmov\\u00e1 <br>\\u0159editelka \\u0161koly<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":980,\"asset_id\":1111,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('990', 'com_content.article.981', '', '2026-09-10 22:22:19', '140', '4121', 'bc1b92d9e6598417c36539f05a6f3bc8b15344c4', '{\"title\":\"Kondi\\u010dn\\u00ed testy ve Vital Praha - sportovn\\u00ed management\",\"alias\":\"kondicni-testy-ve-vital-praha-sportovni-management\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2026-02-20 09:17:26\",\"publish_up\":\"2026-02-20 09:17:26\",\"ordering\":24,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Kondi\\u010dn\\u00ed testy ve Vital Praha - sportovn\\u00ed management<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/Vital.jpg\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/Vital.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\"><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">V r\\u00e1mci \\u0161koln\\u00ed akce jsme nav\\u0161t\\u00edvili Vital Praha, kde jsme absolvovali kondi\\u010dn\\u00ed testy. Cel\\u00e1 n\\u00e1v\\u0161t\\u011bva byla velmi zaj\\u00edmav\\u00e1 a p\\u0159\\u00ednosn\\u00e1, proto\\u017ee jsme si mohli vyzkou\\u0161et profesion\\u00e1ln\\u00ed m\\u011b\\u0159en\\u00ed fyzick\\u00e9 kondice a zjistit, na jak\\u00e9 \\u00farovni se nach\\u00e1z\\u00ed na\\u0161e v\\u00fdkonnost. Prost\\u0159ed\\u00ed bylo modern\\u00ed, p\\u0159\\u00edjemn\\u00e9 a v\\u0161e prob\\u00edhalo pod dohledem odborn\\u00edk\\u016f. <br>Celou akci vedl Mgr. Ale\\u0161 Tvrzn\\u00edk, kter\\u00fd m\\u00e1 ve Vital Praha na starosti veden\\u00ed a odborn\\u00fd dohled. V\\u0161e n\\u00e1m srozumiteln\\u011b vysv\\u011btlil, pr\\u016fb\\u011bh test\\u016f organizoval a ochotn\\u011b odpov\\u00eddal na na\\u0161e dotazy, co\\u017e p\\u0159isp\\u011blo k tomu, \\u017ee jsme se b\\u011bhem testov\\u00e1n\\u00ed c\\u00edtili dob\\u0159e a v\\u011bd\\u011bli, co a pro\\u010d d\\u011bl\\u00e1me. <br>B\\u011bhem testov\\u00e1n\\u00ed jsem b\\u011b\\u017eel na b\\u011b\\u017eeck\\u00e9m p\\u00e1su, kde se m\\u011b\\u0159ila moje vytrvalost a kondice, zat\\u00edmco spolu\\u017ea\\u010dka Ema jela na kole, kde se sledoval v\\u00fdkon a zat\\u00ed\\u017een\\u00ed jej\\u00edho organismu. Oba testy byly n\\u00e1ro\\u010dn\\u00e9, ale z\\u00e1rove\\u0148 motivuj\\u00edc\\u00ed. Celkov\\u011b se n\\u00e1m n\\u00e1v\\u0161t\\u011bva velmi l\\u00edbila, proto\\u017ee jsme z\\u00edskali nov\\u00e9 zku\\u0161enosti, dozv\\u011bd\\u011bli se v\\u00edce o sv\\u00e9m t\\u011ble a vyzkou\\u0161eli si, jak prob\\u00edhaj\\u00ed profesion\\u00e1ln\\u00ed kondi\\u010dn\\u00ed testy. <\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Dominik Rohan <br>t\\u0159\\u00edda 2.A - sportovn\\u00ed management<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":981,\"asset_id\":1112,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
