('994', 'com_content.article.985', '', '2026-09-10 22:22:21', '140', '5810', '710e4fdf33cbe88c9e963132ef55d466d58ed38d', '{\"title\":\"V\\u00fdstava Titanik v Praze \",\"alias\":\"vystava-titanik-v-praze\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2026-03-21 14:47:54\",\"publish_up\":\"2026-03-21 14:47:54\",\"ordering\":22,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">V\\u00fdstava Titanik v Praze <\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/Titanik.jpg\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/Titanik.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\"><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">2. b\\u0159ezna nav\\u0161t\\u00edvila t\\u0159\\u00edda 2.B v Praze expozici v\\u011bnovanou nejslavn\\u011bj\\u0161\\u00edmu parn\\u00edku, kter\\u00fd kdy br\\u00e1zdil sv\\u011btov\\u00e1 mo\\u0159e \\u2013 Titaniku. Tento legend\\u00e1rn\\u00ed zaoce\\u00e1nsk\\u00fd parn\\u00edk se stal symbolem technick\\u00e9ho pokroku sv\\u00e9 doby, ale z\\u00e1rove\\u0148 i jednou z nejzn\\u00e1m\\u011bj\\u0161\\u00edch n\\u00e1mo\\u0159n\\u00edch trag\\u00e9di\\u00ed v historii. Jeho p\\u0159\\u00edb\\u011bh zn\\u00e1 dnes t\\u00e9m\\u011b\\u0159 ka\\u017ed\\u00fd, a to i d\\u00edky slavn\\u00e9mu oscarov\\u00e9mu filmu s Leonardem DiCapriem, kter\\u00fd osud Titaniku p\\u0159ibl\\u00ed\\u017eil milion\\u016fm div\\u00e1k\\u016f po cel\\u00e9m sv\\u011bt\\u011b. <\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">B\\u011bhem n\\u00e1v\\u0161t\\u011bvy expozice jsme m\\u011bli mo\\u017enost pono\\u0159it se do historie t\\u00e9to slavn\\u00e9 lodi opravdu do hloubky. Hned na za\\u010d\\u00e1tku jsme obdr\\u017eeli kopie palubn\\u00edch l\\u00edstk\\u016f skute\\u010dn\\u00fdch cestuj\\u00edc\\u00edch, kte\\u0159\\u00ed se na Titaniku plavili b\\u011bhem jeho prvn\\u00ed a z\\u00e1rove\\u0148 posledn\\u00ed plavby v roce 1912. Ka\\u017ed\\u00fd z n\\u00e1s tak symbolicky dostal palubn\\u00ed l\\u00edstek jednoho z pasa\\u017e\\u00e9r\\u016f a mohl d\\u00edky tomu sledovat to, co na palub\\u011b mohl za\\u017e\\u00edvat. D\\u00edky tomu jsme si dok\\u00e1zali mnohem l\\u00e9pe p\\u0159edstavit, jak\\u00e9 byly osudy lid\\u00ed na palub\\u011b \\u2013 od bohat\\u00fdch cestuj\\u00edc\\u00edch prvn\\u00ed t\\u0159\\u00eddy a\\u017e po emigranty, kte\\u0159\\u00ed m\\u00ed\\u0159ili do Ameriky za nov\\u00fdm \\u017eivotem. <\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Postupn\\u011b jsme proch\\u00e1zeli jednotliv\\u00fdmi \\u010d\\u00e1stmi expozice, kter\\u00e9 zachycovaly \\u017eivot na palub\\u011b i samotnou historii Titaniku \\u2013 od jeho stavby a slavnostn\\u00edho vyplut\\u00ed z p\\u0159\\u00edstavu a\\u017e po osudnou noc, kdy se lo\\u010f v severn\\u00edm Atlantiku srazila s ledovcem. V\\u00fdstava obsahovala mnoho zaj\\u00edmav\\u00fdch informac\\u00ed, dobov\\u00fdch fotografi\\u00ed i autentick\\u00fdch p\\u0159edm\\u011bt\\u016f, kter\\u00e9 pom\\u00e1haly p\\u0159ibl\\u00ed\\u017eit atmosf\\u00e9ru tehdej\\u0161\\u00ed doby. <\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Na konci v\\u00fdstavy p\\u0159i\\u0161el okam\\u017eik, na kter\\u00fd jsme byli v\\u0161ichni zv\\u011bdav\\u00ed. Mohli jsme zjistit, zda osoba uveden\\u00e1 na na\\u0161em palubn\\u00edm l\\u00edstku katastrofu p\\u0159e\\u017eila, nebo zda jej\\u00ed p\\u0159\\u00edb\\u011bh skon\\u010dil tragicky. Tento moment byl velmi siln\\u00fd a pomohl n\\u00e1m uv\\u011bdomit si, \\u017ee za historickou ud\\u00e1lost\\u00ed stoj\\u00ed skute\\u010dn\\u00e9 lidsk\\u00e9 osudy. <\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Celou exkurzi jsme si moc u\\u017eili. D\\u011bkujeme za mo\\u017enost tuto v\\u00fdstavu nav\\u0161t\\u00edvit a za \\u00fa\\u017easnou p\\u0159\\u00edle\\u017eitost dozv\\u011bd\\u011bt se v\\u00edce o jedn\\u00e9 z nejzn\\u00e1m\\u011bj\\u0161\\u00edch ud\\u00e1lost\\u00ed sv\\u011btov\\u00fdch d\\u011bjin.<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Mat\\u011bj Petr<br>t\\u0159\\u00edda 2.B\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":985,\"asset_id\":1116,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('995', 'com_content.article.986', '', '2026-09-10 22:22:21', '140', '3828', 'fe213dbfefdf41ee7b7ea9dcb5a30ceb275cb2dd', '{\"title\":\" Ly\\u017ea\\u0159sk\\u00fd v\\u00fdcvik 2.A\",\"alias\":\"lyzarsky-vycvik-2-a-2\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2026-03-21 15:16:18\",\"publish_up\":\"2026-03-21 15:16:18\",\"ordering\":21,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"> Ly\\u017ea\\u0159sk\\u00fd v\\u00fdcvik 2.A<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/Lyzak_2.A\\/Lyzak_2.A.jpg\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/Lyzak_2.A\\/Lyzak_2.A.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\"><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><br><video style=\\\"display: table; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" poster=\\\"\\\" controls=\\\"controls\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"450\\\">\\r\\n<source src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/Lyzak_2.A\\/Lyzak_2.A.mp4\\\" type=\\\"video\\/mp4\\\"><\\/video><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Na za\\u010d\\u00e1tku b\\u0159ezna vyrazila na\\u0161e t\\u0159\\u00edda 2.A na ly\\u017ea\\u0159sk\\u00fd v\\u00fdcvik do Pece pod Sn\\u011b\\u017ekou. Ubytovan\\u00ed jsme byli na Havlov\\u011b boud\\u011b a hned po p\\u0159\\u00edjezdu jsme museli vy\\u0161l\\u00e1pnout strm\\u00fd a kluzk\\u00fd kopec k chat\\u011b. Od pond\\u011bl\\u00ed do \\u010dtvrtka jsme ka\\u017ed\\u00fd den ly\\u017eovali na sjezdovk\\u00e1ch v okol\\u00ed Pece. Ve st\\u0159edu jsme se pod\\u00edvali i na \\u010cernou horu. Nav\\u00edc n\\u00e1m cel\\u00fd t\\u00fdden p\\u0159\\u00e1lo po\\u010das\\u00ed, bylo slune\\u010dno a i teplo. Cel\\u00fd kurz jsme si moc u\\u017eili, odvezli jsme si dom\\u016f spoustu nov\\u00fdch zku\\u0161enost\\u00ed a na\\u0161t\\u011bst\\u00ed se obe\\u0161el i bez v\\u00e1\\u017en\\u011bj\\u0161\\u00edch zran\\u011bn\\u00ed. Velk\\u00e9 d\\u00edky pat\\u0159\\u00ed panu u\\u010diteli Sr\\u0161\\u0148ovi, panu u\\u010diteli Vrabcovi, pan\\u00ed u\\u010ditelce Rohul\\u00e1nov\\u00e9 a pan\\u00ed u\\u010ditelce Krulichov\\u00e9 za jejich podporu trp\\u011blivost a organizaci. V p\\u00e1tek jsme se vraceli dom\\u016f pln\\u00ed z\\u00e1\\u017eitk\\u016f. <\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Karol\\u00edna Kr\\u00e1l\\u00ed\\u010dkov\\u00e1<br>t\\u0159\\u00edda 2.A\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":986,\"asset_id\":1117,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('996', 'com_content.article.987', '', '2026-09-10 22:22:22', '140', '3264', '85bbf3c138910a587896bb6519ba2e3dedd7f840', '{\"title\":\"Tipova\\u010dka - Olympi\\u00e1da 2026\",\"alias\":\"tipovacka-olympiada-2026\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2026-04-13 07:37:02\",\"publish_up\":\"2026-04-13 07:37:02\",\"ordering\":20,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Tipova\\u010dka - Olympi\\u00e1da 2026<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/Olympiada.jpg\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/Olympiada.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\"><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">V pr\\u016fb\\u011bhu zimn\\u00edch olympijsk\\u00fdch her 2026 v Mil\\u00e1n\\u011b a Cortin\\u011b o\\u017eila na\\u0161e \\u0161kola tipovac\\u00ed sout\\u011b\\u017e\\u00ed v\\u00fdsledk\\u016f hokeje mu\\u017e\\u016f. Jako v\\u017edy, tuto tipovac\\u00ed sout\\u011b\\u017e po\\u0159\\u00e1dal pan u\\u010ditel Martin Vrabec. Do sout\\u011b\\u017ee se p\\u0159ihl\\u00e1silo 55 \\u00fa\\u010dastn\\u00edk\\u016f, kte\\u0159\\u00ed odhadovali v\\u00fdsledky utk\\u00e1n\\u00ed a st\\u0159elce. Nejlep\\u0161\\u00ed odhad a tedy 1. m\\u00edsto z\\u00edskal \\u0160t\\u011bp\\u00e1n Pluh\\u00e1\\u010dek 3.A studuj\\u00edc\\u00ed sportovn\\u00ed management, 2. m\\u00edsto obsadily \\u0160\\u00e1rka Birke a <br>\\u0160\\u00e1rka Rudolfov\\u00e1 - kancel\\u00e1\\u0159 \\u0161koly a 3. m\\u00edsto si vybojoval Hor\\u00e1c Al Sofy student 3. ro\\u010dn\\u00edku cestovn\\u00edho ruchu. <\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">V\\u0161em z\\u00fa\\u010dastn\\u011bn\\u00fdm gratulujeme ???<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":987,\"asset_id\":1118,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('997', 'com_content.article.988', '', '2026-09-10 22:22:22', '140', '3392', '300af7aaf013809ea58dfeffde63759dff2324a3', '{\"title\":\"\\u0160kolen\\u00ed 1. pomoci pro studenty i u\\u010ditel\\u00e9\",\"alias\":\"skoleni-1-pomoci-pro-studenty-i-ucitele\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2026-04-13 07:49:25\",\"publish_up\":\"2026-04-13 07:49:25\",\"ordering\":19,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">\\u0160kolen\\u00ed 1. pomoci pro studenty i u\\u010ditel\\u00e9<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/1.pomoc.jpg\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/1.pomoc.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\"><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Dne 23.3.2026 bylo na na\\u0161\\u00ed \\u0161kole uskute\\u010dn\\u011bno \\u0161kolen\\u00ed 1. pomoci pro studenty i u\\u010ditele. \\u0160kolen\\u00ed se z\\u00fa\\u010dastnily 3. ro\\u010dn\\u00edky obor\\u016f cestovn\\u00ed ruch, ekonomick\\u00e9 lyceum a sportovn\\u00ed management. Studenti budou moci uplatnit z\\u00edskan\\u00e9 v\\u011bdomost\\u00ed jak p\\u0159i odborn\\u00fdch prax\\u00edch, tak ve sv\\u00e9m osobn\\u00edm \\u017eivot\\u011b. \\u0160kolen\\u00edm n\\u00e1s provedla Bc. Martina Eli\\u00e1\\u0161ov\\u00e1 z organizace ABC prvn\\u00ed pomoc s.r.o. a to velice n\\u00e1zorn\\u011b se zam\\u011b\\u0159en\\u00edm na praktick\\u00e9 vyu\\u017eit\\u00ed. Pan\\u00ed lektorce t\\u00edmto moc d\\u011bkujeme a ji\\u017e se t\\u011b\\u0161\\u00edme na podzimn\\u00ed term\\u00edn, kdy stejn\\u00fdm \\u0161kolen\\u00edm projdou i n\\u00e1sleduj\\u00edc\\u00ed 3. ro\\u010dn\\u00edky a 2. \\u010d\\u00e1st u\\u010ditelsk\\u00e9ho sboru.<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Dana Jarol\\u00edmov\\u00e1<br>\\u0159editelka \\u0161koly<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":988,\"asset_id\":1119,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('998', 'com_content.article.989', '', '2026-09-10 22:22:23', '140', '3140', '4665e9d6cd229bf40c7a532d7ef854d25993d00a', '{\"title\":\"Vital Praha \\u2013 kondi\\u010dn\\u00ed testy pro 3.A (sportovn\\u00ed management)\",\"alias\":\"vital-praha-kondicni-testy-pro-3-a-sportovni-management\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2026-04-13 09:09:05\",\"publish_up\":\"2026-04-13 09:09:05\",\"ordering\":18,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Vital Praha \\u2013 kondi\\u010dn\\u00ed testy pro 3.A (sportovn\\u00ed management)<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/Vital_3.A.jpg\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/Vital_3.A.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\"><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Pro velk\\u00fd \\u00fasp\\u011bch kondi\\u010dn\\u00edch test\\u016f pro \\u017e\\u00e1ky sportovn\\u00edho managementu ve 2. ro\\u010dn\\u00edku jsme se rozhodli tuto akci uspo\\u0159\\u00e1dat i pro 3. ro\\u010dn\\u00edk. Z\\u00e1t\\u011b\\u017eov\\u00e9 testy si studenti mohli vyzkou\\u0161et ve zdravotnick\\u00e9 organizaci zam\\u011b\\u0159en\\u00e9 na sportovce VITAL PRAHA. Studenti si otestovali svoji fyzickou kondici a zjistili tak stav sv\\u00e9 v\\u00fdkonnosti. Student\\u016fm se v\\u011bnoval vedouc\\u00ed odd\\u011blen\\u00ed Mgr. Ale\\u0161 Tvrzn\\u00edk a dal\\u0161\\u00ed odborn\\u00edci. Pro na\\u0161e studenty byla tato exkurze tak\\u00e9 uk\\u00e1zkou mo\\u017enosti jejich dal\\u0161\\u00edho uplatn\\u011bn\\u00ed po absolvov\\u00e1n\\u00ed studovan\\u00e9ho oboru sportovn\\u00ed management.<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":989,\"asset_id\":1120,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('999', 'com_content.article.990', '', '2026-09-10 22:22:23', '140', '3510', '7d51138bf1621b32e88ee97e73281a867a514b32', '{\"title\":\"V\\u00fduka \\\"za \\u0161kolou\\\" :-)\",\"alias\":\"vyuka-za-skolou\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2026-04-13 09:20:40\",\"publish_up\":\"2026-04-13 09:20:40\",\"ordering\":17,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">V\\u00fduka \\\"za \\u0161kolou\\\" :-) <\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/zaskolou.jpg\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/zaskolou.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\"><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">10.4.2026 dostali studenti na\\u0161\\u00ed \\u0161koly mo\\u017enost vycestovat, tak abychom uvolnili na\\u0161e prostory pro p\\u0159ij\\u00edmac\\u00ed \\u0159\\u00edzen\\u00ed. \\u017d\\u00e1ci se rozd\\u011blili do t\\u0159\\u00ed respektive \\u010dty\\u0159 skupin: <br>1. skupina se pod veden\\u00edm pana u\\u010ditele Martina Vrabce vydala do Prahy na n\\u00e1v\\u0161t\\u011bvu v\\u00fdstavy Body World, jednalo se p\\u0159ev\\u00e1\\u017en\\u011b o studenty sportovn\\u00edho managementu; <br>2. skupina se vydala tak\\u00e9 do Prahy pod taktovkou pan\\u00ed z\\u00e1stupkyn\\u011b Judity Jir\\u00e1skov\\u00e9 Galbov\\u00e9 a jej\\u00ed studentsk\\u00e9 firmy \\\"Animora\\\", kter\\u00e1 pro na\\u0161e \\u017e\\u00e1ky zorganizovala pozn\\u00e1vac\\u00ed z\\u00e1jezd do N\\u00e1rodn\\u00edho divadla; <br>3. skupina, sestaven\\u00e1 ze student\\u016f p\\u0159\\u00edrodn\\u011b lad\\u011bn\\u00fdch se se sv\\u00fdmi u\\u010diteli Josefem Sr\\u0161n\\u011bm a Isabel Lopez Rodriguez vydali po stop\\u00e1ch \\u010deskoslovensk\\u00e9ho opevn\\u011bn\\u00ed z let 1936-1938.<br>Posledn\\u00ed 4. skupinu tvo\\u0159ily na\\u0161e 4. ro\\u010dn\\u00edky, kter\\u00e9 v odpoledn\\u00edch hodin\\u00e1ch ji\\u017e psaly svoji 1. \\u010d\\u00e1st maturitn\\u00edch zkou\\u0161ek a to slohov\\u00e9 pr\\u00e1ce z \\u010desk\\u00e9ho jazyka a literatury.<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":990,\"asset_id\":1121,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('1000', 'com_content.article.991', '', '2026-09-10 22:22:24', '140', '5095', '8b51c349ec8c2ad515e7568bbbacf55f3bb27b44', '{\"title\":\"Barcelona - pozn\\u00e1vac\\u00ed z\\u00e1jezd\",\"alias\":\"barcelona-poznavaci-zajezd\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2026-04-20 15:09:42\",\"publish_up\":\"2026-04-20 15:09:42\",\"ordering\":16,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Barcelona - pozn\\u00e1vac\\u00ed z\\u00e1jezd<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/Barcelona\\/1.jpg\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/Barcelona\\/1.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\"><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Ve \\u010dtvrtek 9.4. jsme se vydali na pozn\\u00e1vac\\u00ed z\\u00e1jezd viva Barcelona. Nejprve n\\u00e1s \\u010dekal no\\u010dn\\u00ed p\\u0159ejezd do Monaka, kde jsme str\\u00e1vili prvn\\u00ed den. Vid\\u011bli jsme Oce\\u00e1nografick\\u00e9 muzeum, katedr\\u00e1lu, slavn\\u00e9 monack\\u00e9 casino, z\\u00e1rove\\u0148 jsme se mohli pod\\u00edvat na slavnou tra\\u0165 Formule 1. Ve\\u010der jsme p\\u0159ejeli do Francie a ubytovali se. Dal\\u0161\\u00ed den byly na programu dv\\u011b m\\u011bste\\u010dka Figueres, co\\u017e je rodi\\u0161t\\u011b slavn\\u00e9ho mal\\u00ed\\u0159e Salvadora Dal\\u00edho a p\\u0159\\u00edmo\\u0159sk\\u00e9 m\\u011bste\\u010dko Cadaqu\\u00e9s. Ve\\u010der n\\u00e1s \\u010dekalo kr\\u00e1sn\\u00e9 ubytov\\u00e1n\\u00ed v kempu ve m\\u011bst\\u011b Callela. V ned\\u011bli jsme se rozd\\u011blili, kdo cht\\u011bl mohl j\\u00edt na fotbalov\\u00fd stadion Camp Nou a zbytek se vydal na Montjuic pod\\u00edvat se na olympijsk\\u00fd stadion. Odpoledne jsme zam\\u00ed\\u0159ili na posv\\u00e1tn\\u00e9 m\\u00edsto Katal\\u00e1nska zvan\\u00e9 Montserrat. N\\u00e1sledn\\u011b dal\\u0161\\u00ed den jsme si ud\\u011blali v\\u00fdlet do p\\u0159\\u00edmo\\u0159sk\\u00e9ho m\\u011bsta Tossa de Mar, kde n\\u00e1s to m\\u00e1lem odfouklo. A posledn\\u00ed den p\\u0159ed cestou zp\\u011bt jsme se vydali objevovat Barcelonu. Za\\u010dali jsme na hlavn\\u00ed t\\u0159\\u00edd\\u011b La Rambla, pak n\\u00e1s \\u010dekala Sagrada Fam\\u00edlia, kde jsme se ka\\u017ed\\u00fd mohl pod\\u00edvat dovnit\\u0159. Odpoledne byl rozchod v centru m\\u011bsta. N\\u011bkdo to pojal formou n\\u00e1kup\\u016f a n\\u011bkte\\u0159\\u00ed se pro\\u0161li a\\u017e k mo\\u0159i. Ve ve\\u010dern\\u00edch hodin\\u00e1ch jsme nasedli do autobusu a \\u010dekala n\\u00e1s dlouh\\u00e1 cesta dom\\u016f. Cel\\u00fd z\\u00e1jezd se velice vyda\\u0159il i po\\u010das\\u00ed, a\\u017e na jeden den, bylo ide\\u00e1ln\\u00ed, v\\u0161ichni jsme si to u\\u017eili a p\\u0159ivezli si spoustu vzpom\\u00ednek a z\\u00e1\\u017eitk\\u016f. <\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Karol\\u00edna St\\u0159edov\\u00e1 <br>3.B\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/Barcelona\\/2.jpg\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/Barcelona\\/2.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"506\\\"><\\/span><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/Barcelona\\/3.jpg\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/Barcelona\\/3.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"506\\\"><\\/span><\\/a><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":991,\"asset_id\":1122,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('1001', 'com_content.article.992', '', '2026-09-10 22:22:24', '140', '3062', '953d67c2de54ef37270cf11246b7cb4a14f0e786', '{\"title\":\"Didaktick\\u00e1 proch\\u00e1zka Hradcem Kr\\u00e1lov\\u00e9 v rusk\\u00e9m jazyce\",\"alias\":\"didakticka-prochazka-hradcem-kralove-v-ruskem-jazyce\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2026-04-21 19:58:27\",\"publish_up\":\"2026-04-21 19:58:27\",\"ordering\":15,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Didaktick\\u00e1 proch\\u00e1zka Hradcem Kr\\u00e1lov\\u00e9 v rusk\\u00e9m jazyce<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/RJHK.jpg\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/RJHK.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\"><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">V r\\u00e1mci zpest\\u0159en\\u00ed v\\u00fduky rusk\\u00e9ho jazyka jsme se dnes vydali do Hradce Kr\\u00e1lov\\u00e9 na didaktickou proch\\u00e1zku, kterou n\\u00e1s provedli studenti u\\u010ditelstv\\u00ed. P\\u0159ipravili si pro n\\u00e1s n\\u011bkolik stanovi\\u0161\\u0165 s \\u00fakoly, kter\\u00e9 jsme plnili ve skupin\\u00e1ch. Program za\\u010d\\u00ednal u hotelu \\u010cernigov u hlavn\\u00edho n\\u00e1dra\\u017e\\u00ed a kon\\u010dil u Univerzity Hradec Kr\\u00e1lov\\u00e9. <\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Mgr. Dita Flejberk Jel\\u00ednkov\\u00e1 a Mgr. Jarom\\u00edr Tomek <br>vyu\\u010duj\\u00edc\\u00ed rusk\\u00e9ho jazyka<br><\\/span><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":992,\"asset_id\":1123,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('1002', 'com_content.article.993', '', '2026-09-10 22:22:25', '140', '3688', 'cdd9a48f314b32696a1fce0bb76ee38aa8ed67e7', '{\"title\":\"HOLIDAY WORLD - Zpropaguj sv\\u00e9 m\\u00edsto\",\"alias\":\"holiday-world-zpropaguj-sve-misto\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2026-04-26 18:11:48\",\"publish_up\":\"2026-04-26 18:11:48\",\"ordering\":14,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">HOLIDAY WORLD - Zpropaguj sv\\u00e9 m\\u00edsto<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/HW.jpg\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/HW.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\"><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">V r\\u00e1mci ka\\u017edoro\\u010dn\\u00edho veletrhu cestovn\\u00edho ruchu HOLIDAY WORLD &amp; REGION WORLD v Praze se na\\u0161i studenti 3. ro\\u010dn\\u00edku cestovn\\u00edho ruchu z\\u00fa\\u010dastnili sout\\u011b\\u017ee \\\"Zpropaguj sv\\u00e9 m\\u00edsto\\\". Tato studentsk\\u00e1 sout\\u011b\\u017e se uskute\\u010dnila pod z\\u00e1\\u0161titou Asociace cestovn\\u00edch kancel\\u00e1\\u0159\\u00ed \\u010cR (ACK \\u010cR) a \\u010cesk\\u00e9ho d\\u011bdictv\\u00ed UNESCO a byla ur\\u010dena pro studenty st\\u0159edn\\u00edch \\u0161kol, kte\\u0159\\u00ed prezentuj\\u00ed sv\\u00e9 regiony. Na\\u0161i studenti Hor\\u00e1c Al Sofy a Jakub Van\\u011bk se pod veden\\u00edm pan\\u00ed u\\u010ditelky Judity Jir\\u00e1skov\\u00e9 Galbov\\u00e9 vydali do Prahy potom, co s p\\u0159evahou vyhr\\u00e1li \\u0161koln\\u00ed kolo t\\u00e9to sout\\u011b\\u017ee. Na\\u0161im student\\u016fm d\\u011bkujeme za skv\\u011blou reprezentaci \\u0161koly i na\\u0161eho regionu a i kdy\\u017e se neum\\u00edstili na stupn\\u00edch v\\u00edt\\u011bz\\u016f, zajist\\u00e9 si odvezli mnoho cenn\\u00fdch zku\\u0161enost\\u00ed. <\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Mgr. Judita Jir\\u00e1skov\\u00e1 Galbov\\u00e1 <br>z\\u00e1stupkyn\\u011b \\u0159editelky a vyu\\u010duj\\u00edc\\u00ed cestovn\\u00edho ruchu<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\"><br><\\/span><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":993,\"asset_id\":1124,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('1003', 'com_content.article.994', '', '2026-09-10 22:22:25', '140', '3378', 'c1d5ac7b2ad85e4fbadfe27bccbc356f43dfe4c4', '{\"title\":\"Sportovn\\u00ed den pro seniory\",\"alias\":\"sportovni-den-pro-seniory\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2026-04-26 18:18:24\",\"publish_up\":\"2026-04-26 18:18:24\",\"ordering\":13,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Sportovn\\u00ed den pro seniory<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/SDS.jpg\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/SDS.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\"><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Dal\\u0161\\u00ed velmi vyda\\u0159enou akci jsme pro\\u017eili v MSSS O\\u00e1za v Nov\\u00e9m M\\u011bst\\u011b nad Metuj\\u00ed, kde jsme se studenty 1. ro\\u010dn\\u00edku sportovn\\u00edho managementu p\\u0159ipravili pro na\\u0161e nejstar\\u0161\\u00ed spoluob\\u010dany sportovn\\u00ed den. Senio\\u0159i si vyzkou\\u0161eli ledovou bitvu, tajnou misi bosono\\u017ece, kel\\u00edmkov\\u00e9ho architekta a jin\\u00e9. Jak na \\u00fa\\u010dastn\\u00edc\\u00edch, tak i na organiz\\u00e1torech byla vid\\u011bt radost z pohybu, mezigenera\\u010dn\\u00ed spolupr\\u00e1ce a vz\\u00e1jemn\\u00e9 p\\u0159ed\\u00e1v\\u00e1n\\u00ed dobr\\u00e9 n\\u00e1lady. Velmi chci pod\\u011bkovat veden\\u00ed MSSS O\\u00e1za za mo\\u017enost uspo\\u0159\\u00e1dat tuto akci na jejich \\\"h\\u0159i\\u0161ti\\\" a na\\u0161im student\\u016fm za precizn\\u00ed v\\u00fdkon a nasazen\\u00ed. <\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Mgr. Anna Rohul\\u00e1nov\\u00e1 <br>Vyu\\u010duj\\u00edc\\u00ed sportovn\\u00edho managementu<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\"><br><\\/span><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":994,\"asset_id\":1125,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('1004', 'com_content.article.995', '', '2026-09-10 22:22:26', '140', '4714', 'dcb673fb0f30f0f92a2b5f75bf10c823c92b4cd6', '{\"title\":\"Prima sez\\u00f3na\",\"alias\":\"prima-sezona\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2026-05-07 16:21:59\",\"publish_up\":\"2026-05-07 16:21:59\",\"ordering\":12,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">Prima sez\\u00f3na<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/PS.jpg\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/PS.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\"><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">ACADEMIA MERCURII se v r\\u00e1mci Prima sez\\u00f3ny z\\u00fa\\u010dastnila n\\u011bkolika program\\u016f a ne jen to, student 2. ro\\u010dn\\u00edku Jan H\\u00e1jek uspo\\u0159\\u00e1dal se svoji rockovou kapelou The Burning Storm na n\\u00e1m\\u011bst\\u00ed kr\\u00e1sn\\u00fd koncert. <\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Studenti nap\\u0159\\u00ed\\u010d ro\\u010dn\\u00edky se pak tak\\u00e9 z\\u00fa\\u010dastnili t\\u011bchto program\\u016f - <strong>Evropa: 80 + 1 let spolupr\\u00e1ce a m\\u00edru (Evrop\\u0161t\\u00ed dobrovoln\\u00edci)<\\/strong> v n\\u00e1chodsk\\u00e9m D\\u00e9\\u010dku d\\u00e1le pak <strong>\\u017div\\u00e1 knihovna<\\/strong> v n\\u00e1chodsk\\u00e9 m\\u011bstsk\\u00e9 knihovn\\u011b a tak\\u00e9 besedy s Jind\\u0159ichem F\\u00e1borsk\\u00fdm na t\\u00e9ma <strong>Vibe Coding<\\/strong>. V Programu s dobrovoln\\u00edky se na\\u0161i \\u017e\\u00e1ci vyst\\u0159\\u00eddali ve skupink\\u00e1ch u dobrovoln\\u00edk\\u016f z r\\u016fzn\\u00fdch evropsk\\u00fdch zem\\u00ed jako je N\\u011bmecko, Francie, Irsko nebo \\u0160pan\\u011blsko, kte\\u0159\\u00ed jim p\\u0159edstavili kl\\u00ed\\u010dov\\u00e9 momenty z historie jejich rodn\\u00fdch zem\\u00ed od konce 2. sv\\u011btov\\u00e9 v\\u00e1lky po sou\\u010dasnost. Cel\\u00e1 akce prob\\u00edhala v angli\\u010dtin\\u011b a \\u017e\\u00e1ci se dov\\u011bd\\u011bli spoustu zaj\\u00edmav\\u00fdch a u\\u017eite\\u010dn\\u00fdch informac\\u00ed. <\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">V r\\u00e1mci \\u017div\\u00e9 knihovny na\\u0161i studenti nam\\u00edsto \\u201ep\\u016fj\\u010dov\\u00e1n\\u00ed\\u201c knih, mluvili se zaj\\u00edmav\\u00fdmi lidmi N\\u00e1chodska a diskutovali s nimi o jejich p\\u0159\\u00edb\\u011bz\\u00edch. <\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Vibe Coding v pod\\u00e1n\\u00ed Jind\\u0159icha F\\u00e1borsk\\u00e9ho byla p\\u0159edn\\u00e1\\u0161ka, kde se studenti dozv\\u011bd\\u011bli jak pomoc\\u00ed AI vytv\\u00e1\\u0159et vlastn\\u00ed aplikace, weby \\u010di hry bez znalosti programov\\u00e1n\\u00ed a jak tuto dovednost vyu\\u017e\\u00edt pro vlastn\\u00ed n\\u00e1pady i budouc\\u00ed kari\\u00e9ru. (Jind\\u0159ich F\\u00e1borsk\\u00fd je p\\u0159edn\\u00ed \\u010desk\\u00fd market\\u00e9r a zakladatel mezin\\u00e1rodn\\u00edch konferenc\\u00ed Marketing Festival, je tak\\u00e9 tv\\u016frcem vzd\\u011bl\\u00e1vac\\u00edho programu Digisemestr)\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":995,\"asset_id\":1126,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
