mage_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"> Odborn\\u00e9 praxe cestovn\\u00edho ruchu - pr\\u016fvodcovsk\\u00e1 \\u010dinnost: z\\u00e1mek \\u017dleby, rodn\\u00fd domek Aloise Jir\\u00e1ska, Kl\\u00e1\\u0161ter benediktin\\u016f v Polici nad Metuj\\u00ed; Broumovsk\\u00fd kl\\u00e1\\u0161ter; hotelov\\u00fd provoz - Grand Hotel Hradec v Peci pod Sn\\u011b\\u017ekou <\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/Praxe_4.jpg\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/Praxe_4.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\"><\\/a><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":1013,\"asset_id\":1144,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
('1023', 'com_content.article.1014', '', '2026-09-10 22:22:35', '140', '4516', 'a5879cf29cc963929b5141b70ce1bd5048a561fe', '{\"title\":\"\\\"V\\u0161ude dob\\u0159e, doma nejl\\u00edp!\\\" - program cestovn\\u00edho ruchu pro mate\\u0159sk\\u00e9 \\u0161kolky\",\"alias\":\"vsude-dobre-doma-nejlip-program-cestovniho-ruchu-pro-materske-skolky\",\"note\":\"\",\"catid\":9,\"state\":1,\"created\":\"2026-06-28 17:26:23\",\"publish_up\":\"2026-06-28 17:26:23\",\"ordering\":3,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"language\":\"*\",\"featured\":0,\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"introtext\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">\\\"V\\u0161ude dob\\u0159e, doma nejl\\u00edp!\\\" - program cestovn\\u00edho ruchu pro mate\\u0159sk\\u00e9 \\u0161kolky<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/Skolky.jpg\\\"><img class=\\\"float-none\\\" style=\\\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\\\" src=\\\"images\\/foto\\/2026\\/Skolky.jpg\\\" width=\\\"900\\\"><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Ve dnech 22. - 24. \\u010dervna studenti na\\u0161\\u00ed \\u0161koly ze t\\u0159\\u00edd 1. B, 2. B a 3. B oboru cestovn\\u00ed ruch p\\u0159ipravili d\\u011btskou animaci pro n\\u00e1chodsk\\u00e9 \\u0161kolky. Jednalo se o mate\\u0159skou \\u0161kolu B\\u0159ezinova, Al\\u0161ova a Havl\\u00ed\\u010dkova - Plhov. Pro \\u201e\\u0161kolkov\\u00e9\\u201c d\\u011bti bylo nachyst\\u00e1no dev\\u011bt nau\\u010dn\\u00fdch stanovi\\u0161\\u0165, kde ka\\u017ed\\u00fd koutek p\\u0159edstavoval jeden st\\u00e1t. Zem\\u011b byly vybr\\u00e1ny podle jazyk\\u016f, kter\\u00e9 se na na\\u0161\\u00ed \\u0161kole vyu\\u010duj\\u00ed, a p\\u0159id\\u00e1ny byly dal\\u0161\\u00ed \\u010dty\\u0159i zem\\u011b, kter\\u00e9 jsou pro d\\u011bti atraktivn\\u00ed. Jednalo se o zem\\u011b: \\u010cesk\\u00e1 republika, Anglie, Austr\\u00e1lie, N\\u011bmecko, \\u0160pan\\u011blsko, Francie, USA, Antarktida a Japonsko. Studenti na\\u0161\\u00ed \\u0161koly si pro d\\u011bti p\\u0159ipravili r\\u016fzn\\u00e9 pom\\u016fcky, se kter\\u00fdmi pak dan\\u00e9 zem\\u011b p\\u0159edstavili. Tento projekt m\\u011bl op\\u011bt velk\\u00fd \\u00fasp\\u011bch jak na stran\\u011b mate\\u0159sk\\u00fdch \\u0161kol, tak na stran\\u011b na\\u0161\\u00ed st\\u0159edn\\u00ed \\u0161koly. Setk\\u00e1n\\u00ed t\\u011bchto dvou generac\\u00ed a vz\\u00e1jemn\\u00e9 p\\u0159ed\\u00e1v\\u00e1n\\u00ed informac\\u00ed bylo velk\\u00fdm z\\u00e1\\u017eitkem pro v\\u0161echny z\\u00fa\\u010dastn\\u011bn\\u00e9. Tuto akci jsme uspo\\u0159\\u00e1dali ji\\u017e osm\\u00fdm rokem a stala se tak na\\u0161\\u00ed tradi\\u010dn\\u00ed aktivitou pro studenty cestovn\\u00edho ruchu. V\\u0161em z\\u00fa\\u010dastn\\u011bn\\u00fdm d\\u011bkujeme a t\\u011b\\u0161\\u00edme se op\\u011bt na p\\u0159\\u00ed\\u0161t\\u00ed \\u0161koln\\u00ed rok! <\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">\\u0160\\u00e1rka Rudolfov\\u00e1 z\\u00e1stupkyn\\u011b \\u0159editele \\u2013 vedouc\\u00ed projektu <br>Realiza\\u010dn\\u00ed t\\u00fdm: <br>Mgr. Jarom\\u00edr Tomek <br>Mgr. Dita Flejberk Jel\\u00ednkov\\u00e1 <br>Mgr. Veronika Davidov\\u00e1 <br>Igor Chmela\\u0159\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"tags\":{},\"typeAlias\":\"com_content.article\",\"id\":1014,\"asset_id\":1145,\"fulltext\":\"\",\"created_by\":140,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"publish_down\":null}', '0', '1', '0'),
