 style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">-<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">                     </span></span></span><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Německý jazyk</b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">-<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">                     </span></span></span><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Francouzský jazyk</b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-add-space: auto; line-height: 150%;\">Školní kolo:</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-add-space: auto; line-height: 150%;\">1.ročník: 1. Adéla Melicharová, 2. Anna Dušková, 3.Klára Nováčková</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-add-space: auto; line-height: 150%;\">2.ročník: 1. Jana Valicová, 2. Iveta Hanušová, 3. Šimon Stolín</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-add-space: auto; line-height: 150%;\">3.ročník: 1. Anna Borsová, 2. Veronika Rybková, 3.Dominika Martínková</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">-<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">                     </span></span></span><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Španělský jazyk</b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-add-space: auto; line-height: 150%;\">Školní kolo:</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-add-space: auto; line-height: 150%;\">1.ročník: 1. Pavlína Nýčová, 2. Marek Bílek, 3. Aneta Francová</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-add-space: auto; line-height: 150%;\">2. a 3. ročník: 1. Kristýna Sztrapková, 2. Ondřej Mazáč, 3. Anna Cozlová</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">-<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">                     </span></span></span><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Ruský jazyk</b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-add-space: auto; line-height: 150%;\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"> </b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: 150%;\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Soutěž v matematice</b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: 150%;\">Školní kolo:</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: 150%;\">1.ročník: 1. Milan Vencl, Jakub Šmíd, 2. Anna Kůsová, Tereza Martincová, Josef Novák, 3. Lucie Rotterová</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: 150%;\">2. ročník: 1. Dominika Pachlová, Šimon Stolín, 2. Jan Jandík, 3. Lucie Patterová</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: 150%;\">3. ročník: 1. Sára Zajíčková, 2. Michaela Rousková, Tomáš Kincl, 3. Veronika Rybková</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: 150%;\">4. ročník: 1. Nela Biedermannová, 2. Sabina Rošková, 3. Martina Bydelská</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: 150%;\"> </p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: 150%;\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Finanční gramotnost</b> – soutěž v teoretických a praktických znalostech</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: 150%;\">Školní kolo: 1. Sára Bihari, 2. Petr Štodt, 3. Silvie Mikulková</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: 150%;\">Postup do okresního kola</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: 150%;\"> </p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: 150%;\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Přírodovědný klokan </b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: 150%;\">Školní kolo: 1. Josef Novák, 2. Iveta Hanušová, 3. Denisa Chaloupková, Aneta Lukešová</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: 150%;\"> </p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: 150%;\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Bobřík informatiky </b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: 150%;\">Školní kolo:</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">1.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">                  </span></span></span>– 2. ročník: 1. Milan Vencl, 2. Michaela Brožová, 3. Veronika Rybková, Aneta Francová</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">2.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">                  </span></span></span>– 4. ročník: 1. Alice Světlíková, 2. Sebastian Švec, 3.<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">  </span>Anna Borsová</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: 150%;\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"> </b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: 150%;\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">JA Studentská firma roku</b> – 21. ročník – soutěž o nejúspěšnější studentskou firmu</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">-<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">                     </span></span></span>Soutěž proběhne v květnu 2016</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-add-space: auto; line-height: 150%;\"> </p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: 150%;\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Sport:</b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: 150%;\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Přespolní běh – okresní finále – chlapci - 4. místo:</b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: 150%;\">M. Bílek, J.Šmíd, J.Hladík, J.Kalaš, O.Mazáč, P.Štod</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: 150%;\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Přespolní běh – okresní finále – dívky - 2. místo:</b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: 150%;\">T.Mědílková, I.Hanušová, A.Kůsová, K.Nováčková</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: 150%;\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Stolní tenis – okresní finále – chlapci </b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: 150%;\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">7.místo: </b><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\"> </span>J.Tvrdík, J.Hladík, N.Musil, M.Bouček</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: 150%;\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">8.místo:</b> J.kalaš, J.Tichý, M.Tvrdík, M.Adam</p>\";s:4:\"body\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"images\";s:173:\"{\"image_intro\":\"\",\"image_intro_alt\":\"\",\"float_intro\":\"\",\"image_intro_caption\":\"\",\"image_fulltext\":\"\",\"image_fulltext_alt\":\"\",\"float_fulltext\":\"\",\"image_fulltext_caption\":\"\"}\";s:5:\"catid\";i:8;s:10:\"created_by\";i:140;s:16:\"created_by_alias\";s:0:\"\";s:8:\"modified\";s:19:\"2016-02-23 21:58:29\";s:11:\"modified_by\";i:140;s:6:\"params\";O:24:\"Joomla\\Registry\\Registry\":3:{s:7:\"\0*\0data\";O:8:\"stdClass\":86:{s:14:\"article_layout\";s:9:\"_:default\";s:10:\"show_title\";s:1:\"1\";s:11:\"link_titles\";s:1:\"0\";s:10:\"show_intro\";s:1:\"0\";s:19:\"info_block_position\";s:1:\"0\";s:21:\"info_block_show_title\";s:1:\"1\";s:13:\"show_category\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"link_category\";s:1:\"1\";s:20:\"show_parent_category\";s:1:\"0\";s:20:\"link_parent_category\";s:1:\"0\";s:17:\"show_associations\";s:1:\"0\";s:5:\"flags\";s:1:\"1\";s:11:\"show_author\";s:1:\"0\";s:11:\"link_author\";s:1:\"0\";s:16:\"show_create_date\";s:1:\"0\";s:16:\"show_modify_date\";s:1:\"0\";s:17:\"show_publish_date\";s:1:\"0\";s:20:\"show_item_navigation\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"show_readmore\";s:1:\"0\";s:19:\"show_readmore_title\";s:1:\"1\";s:14:\